// One paragraph per result, keyed by result name (must match quiz-data.js).
// Hand-written, not generated: edit freely. Shown under "Your vibe" on the result card.
const BLURBS = {
  "Bulbasaur": "Bulbasaur is born with a seed planted on its back, and the seed grows steadily as it does, soaking up sunlight. That's your ambition: carried quietly, never rushed, but always growing. You're down-to-earth enough to keep your roots, mischievous enough to keep things fun, and a little elusive about just how big your plans really are.",
  "Ivysaur": "As Ivysaur's bud gets bigger, its legs grow sturdier to carry the weight, and a sweet smell means it's close to blooming. You're in that same exciting in-between: light-hearted on the surface, ambitious underneath, and quietly building the strength for what's next. You keep your cards close, but anyone paying attention can tell something good is coming.",
  "Venusaur": "Venusaur's flower soaks up sunlight to power itself, and after a rainy day its scent grows stronger and draws other Pokémon in. You're like that: modest and understated, never needing to announce yourself, yet people drift towards you anyway. You recharge outdoors, think before you speak, and your calm, thoughtful presence makes the whole room feel warmer.",
  "Mega Venusaur": "When Venusaur Mega Evolves, its flower grows so much larger that its back and legs become stronger just to support the extra weight. You grow into your ambitions. Thoughtful and outdoorsy, with an edge to your drive that surprises people, you build the strength you need to carry the big things you've decided to take on.",
  "Gigantamax Venusaur": "Venusaur spreads the broad petals of its flower to catch the sun's rays, filling its body with power, and it's strongest in the summertime. When it Gigantamaxes, that flower becomes enormous. You're usually modest and thoughtful, happiest outdoors, but when the moment is right you bloom dramatically, and everyone remembers the day the quiet one blossomed.",
  "Charmander": "The flame on Charmander's tail shows its health and mood, flickering when it's weak and blazing when it's happy. You wear your heart in the same place: bright, light-hearted and impossible to hide. You're young at heart and quick to light up a room, and when something fires you up, everybody can see it straight away.",
  "Charmeleon": "Charmeleon has a reputation for being hot-headed, and in battle its tail flame flares up to a bluish-white heat. You're warmer and more patient than that reputation suggests, unhurried and thoughtful most of the time. But your boldness is real, and when a challenge finally earns your full attention, the temperature in the room rises noticeably.",
  "Charizard": "Charizard flies across the sky looking for powerful opponents, and it's said never to turn its fire on anyone weaker than itself. You're free-spirited and fiery, but your heat comes with a code. People find you surprisingly approachable for someone so strong, because you're authentic through and through and only ever pick fights that are worth having.",
  "Mega Charizard X": "Mega Charizard X turns black, and the flames that pour from its mouth burn blue and fierce. You're the person whose ambition turns quieter and hotter when it counts. Moody in the best way, you transform under pressure into someone darker, more focused and far more determined than anyone who only knows your everyday self might expect.",
  "Mega Charizard Y": "Mega Charizard Y draws its power from its bond with its Trainer, and it boasts speed and manoeuvrability greater than a jet fighter. Your ambition is the bright, soaring kind. You transform when you're chasing a goal with people you trust, burning with energy and optimism, and you lift everyone else up with you as you climb.",
  "Gigantamax Charizard": "Gigantamax Charizard's wings become great sheets of flame, and the fire inside its body burns hotter than three thousand six hundred degrees, climbing even higher when it roars. Most of the time you're free-spirited and modest, happy just to enjoy the ride. But when you transform, you do it dramatically, and people finally see how much fire you've been carrying.",
  "Squirtle": "When Squirtle feels threatened, it pulls back into its shell and then sprays water with surprising force. You're level-headed and grounded, the kind of person who knows when to retreat and regroup. You keep your guard up until you feel safe, but your youthful energy means you never stay hidden for long once the coast is clear.",
  "Wartortle": "Wartortle's long, furry tail is seen as a symbol of long life, and it grows deeper in colour as Wartortle ages. You're young at heart yet wise beyond your years. Cool and calm in a crisis, you love the buzz of city life and the people in it, and there's a sense that you're building something that will last a very long time.",
  "Blastoise": "Blastoise's water cannons can blast through thick steel, and it deliberately plants its heavy body to brace for the recoil. You're the practical, down-to-earth friend who prepares properly before acting. You keep your guard up, but you're authentic to your core, and when you finally release that pressure, you hit exactly where you meant to.",
  "Mega Blastoise": "When Blastoise Mega Evolves, the cannon on its back becomes as powerful as a tank gun, and its tough legs and back let it withstand the recoil. You're understated and practical, the type who doesn't need to shout. Yet when something really matters, you transform, and the down-to-earth friend reveals a focus and power nobody saw coming.",
  "Gigantamax Blastoise": "Blastoise's water spouts are so accurate that it can hit an empty can from a great distance, and Gigantamax energy turns its whole shell into a battery of cannons. You're practical and down-to-earth day to day, never one for showing off. But when the stage is set, you go big and dramatic, and suddenly everyone sees how precisely you can hit your target.",
  "Caterpie": "Caterpie's short legs have suction-cup tips so it can climb almost any surface, and its red antenna releases a strong smell to scare predators. You're compact, modest and quick, the kind of person who quietly finds a foothold anywhere. You stay grounded and humble, but you've got a clever way of protecting yourself when it counts.",
  "Metapod": "Metapod's shell is as hard as an iron slab, and inside it, its body is soft and busy preparing to evolve. You're thoughtful and adaptable, putting on a sturdy face while a lot of change happens underneath. You might seem still from the outside, but you're bright, modest and quietly transforming into something new.",
  "Butterfree": "Butterfree's wings are protected by a rain-repellent dust, so it can keep flying even in a downpour. Nothing much dampens your spirit. Thoughtful and understated, with a huge imagination, you carry on through the stormy days as easily as the sunny ones, and people are amazed at just how high you go.",
  "Gigantamax Butterfree": "Gigantamax Butterfree's scales are made of crystallised Gigantamax energy, blindingly bright and highly toxic, and it can whip up a tornado strong enough to blow away a ten-ton truck. You're thoughtful and free-floating most of the time. But when you choose to make an impression, it's spectacularly dramatic, and people walk away a little dazzled.",
  "Weedle": "Weedle has a sharp, venomous stinger on its head and an excellent sense of smell, which it uses to find the leaves it likes best. You're modest and grounded, often happy to stay small. But you have a moody, mischievous streak, and people quickly learn not to underestimate the little one with the sharp point.",
  "Kakuna": "Kakuna can barely move, but it's busy preparing to evolve, and if pushed it can jab out its poison barbs. You're unhurried and light-hearted, adaptable to whatever's going on around you. You might look like you're just waiting, but there's a lot happening inside, and you can flare up fast when someone pokes you too hard.",
  "Beedrill": "Beedrill are fiercely territorial and fly at high speed, attacking with the venomous stingers on their arms and tail. You're down-to-earth and natural, with a bright energy that's hard to ignore. Your mischievous side makes you fun to be around, but anyone who threatens what's yours quickly learns how fast and sharp you can be.",
  "Mega Beedrill": "When Beedrill Mega Evolves, its legs become poisonous stingers, and it stabs its prey again and again before finishing with the stinger on its rear. You're warm, outdoorsy and bright, the kind of person who transforms when you find something worth chasing. When you're focused, you're relentless, and you keep going until the job is done.",
  "Pidgey": "Pidgey is gentle and doesn't like to fight, often kicking up sand to protect itself instead of attacking. You're warm but guarded, and you'd rather avoid trouble than start it. You've got a moody streak and a soaring spirit, and even when life gets stormy, you find a way to protect yourself without losing your kindness.",
  "Pidgeotto": "Pidgeotto claims a large territory as its own and patrols it constantly, showing no mercy to anything that violates it. You're youthful, sweet-natured and warm, but you never lose sight of the bigger picture. You love flying high and covering ground, and your friends rely on you to watch over the spaces and people you care about.",
  "Pidgeot": "Pidgeot's glossy feathers make it beautiful, and it can fly at twice the speed of sound. You're sweet-natured and authentic, with a calm dignity that people admire. You're guarded with new people, but those who get close see someone city-minded, sharp and capable of covering an incredible distance when it matters.",
  "Mega Pidgeot": "When Pidgeot Mega Evolves, its muscular strength increases so much that it can fly for two weeks straight without resting. You're thoughtful, practical and a little moody, the person who thinks things through before acting. When you transform, you find staying power you never knew you had, and you soar past problems that once felt overwhelming.",
  "Rattata": "Rattata's front teeth never stop growing, so it gnaws on almost anything to keep them filed down, and it can live wherever there's food. You're small, sweet and always busy. Your energy burns fast and bright, you're endlessly good-natured, and that restless curiosity keeps you chewing through new ideas, hobbies and plans.",
  "Alolan Rattata": "Alolan Rattata changed its habits to live in the cities, coming out at night to raid kitchens and leftovers. You're sweet-natured and compact, but you're shaped by your surroundings and you know how to adapt. Your mischievous side makes you resourceful, and you can thrive anywhere, even if it means going a little nocturnal.",
  "Raticate": "Raticate's whiskers help it keep its balance, and its strong teeth can gnaw through concrete. You're approachable, compact and quick, but there's a moody streak behind the friendly face. You're resilient and practical, chewing through problems that would stop other people, and keeping your balance while you do.",
  "Alolan Raticate": "Alolan Raticate commands a nest of Rattata, making its underlings gather food for it, and it dines only on the most nutritious and delicious fare. You know exactly what you like. Moody and mischievous but unhurried, shaped by your surroundings, you take your time choosing the best, and you're happy to let others follow your lead.",
  "Spearow": "Spearow flaps its short wings frantically to fly, and it's known for its loud cry and aggressive temper. You're warm, bold and quick, the kind of person who launches into things before thinking twice. You might not be the most graceful, but your energy and determination get you where you need to go.",
  "Fearow": "Fearow can fly for a whole day without landing, carrying its long beak to snatch prey from the water or ground. You're seasoned and hands-on, sweet-natured beneath a sharp exterior. You've got remarkable stamina, and you're the friend who can keep going long after others have run out of steam.",
  "Ekans": "Ekans slithers silently through tall grass, flicking its tongue to sense danger, and it can unhinge its jaw to swallow eggs whole. You move through social situations quietly, reading the room. You're cool and light-hearted with a mischievous streak, though a moody undercurrent means people never quite know which side of you they'll get.",
  "Arbok": "The pattern on Arbok's belly is said to frighten foes, and its markings vary from region to region. You're bold and bright, with an edgy streak that makes people take notice. You're warm-blooded and confident, and your presence is enough to make anyone think twice before crossing you.",
  "Pikachu": "Pikachu stores electricity in the pouches on its cheeks and releases it when it's threatened or excited. You're bold, ambitious and tech-minded, but you keep your power understated until you need it. When something sparks your interest, you light up, and people remember the little one with the big energy.",
  "Gigantamax Pikachu": "Gigantamax Pikachu's tail swells into a huge bolt of lightning, crackling with enough electricity to match a thunderstorm. You keep a lot of charge stored away. Bold and ambitious, you love tinkering with gadgets and big ideas, and when you finally go dramatic, everyone discovers just how much energy you'd been holding back.",
  "Raichu": "Raichu's long tail works as a ground, safely draining away excess charge, and its body glows faintly in the dark when it's fully powered. That balance is very you. You're ambitious and full of energy, comfortable with tech and new ideas, yet classic and affectionate at heart, and you've learned how to run at full voltage without ever frying the people you love.",
  "Alolan Raichu": "Alolan Raichu focuses psychic energy into its tail and rides it like a surfboard, levitating as it goes, and it attacks with star-shaped thunderbolts. You catch the local wave. Ambitious and affectionate, you love new tech and new places alike, and wherever you land, you pick up the rhythm and ride it with a grin.",
  "Mega Raichu X": "Raichu grows more aggressive as electricity builds up inside it, and it can let loose hundred-thousand-volt bursts that floor foes several times its size; Mega Raichu X turns that charge loose. You're affectionate and hands-on, and when your fire catches, you throw your whole self in, fixing and powering through until everyone around you is buzzing.",
  "Mega Raichu Y": "Raichu protects itself by planting its tail in the ground to discharge excess electricity, and its body gives off a soft glow in the dark; Mega Raichu Y takes that control even further. Quick and thoughtful, you'd rather plan than waste energy, and when you decide to change, you channel every spark precisely where you meant it to go.",
  "Sandshrew": "Sandshrew lives in hot, dry places and curls into a tight ball when danger comes, letting its tough, dry hide take the hits. You keep your guard up in a similar way, protecting yourself first. But underneath you're warm, bright and practical with your hands, and once you feel safe you uncurl into one of the sunniest friends anyone could ask for.",
  "Alolan Sandshrew": "Alolan Sandshrew fled a volcanic eruption long ago and settled in snowy mountains, where its shell turned to ice as hard as steel. You adapt with real good nature. Wherever life puts you, even after an upheaval, you settle in, keep cool and calm, and somehow turn the coldest new situation into somewhere you belong.",
  "Sandslash": "Sandslash's spikes are hardened sections of its hide, and once a year the old ones fall out and new ones grow in from beneath. You're tough in ways people don't always notice. Easy to approach but quietly guarded, you love being outdoors, and you shed old defences regularly, growing back a little stronger every time.",
  "Alolan Sandslash": "Alolan Sandslash carves through deep snow with its large hooked claws, and on snowy mountains it's faster than any other Pokémon. You've adapted brilliantly to tough conditions. Friendly but guarded, you've found your pace in busy places too, and wherever life drops you, you find your footing fast and race ahead with a cool head.",
  "Nidoran♀": "Nidoran♀ is gentle and avoids fights, but the small barbs on its body release a potent poison if it's attacked. That's you exactly: light-hearted, small in presence and happy to keep the peace. You've also got a mischievous, edgy streak, and anyone who mistakes your sweetness for weakness gets a quick, sharp surprise.",
  "Nidorina": "When Nidorina rests with friends and family, it folds its barbs down so nobody gets hurt. That gentleness comes naturally to you. You're approachable and bright, with a kind of classic, old-fashioned decency, and the people closest to you feel completely safe in your company because they know you'll always soften your edges for them.",
  "Nidoqueen": "Nidoqueen's body is covered in scales as hard as armour, and it's at its most powerful when it's protecting its young. You're the protector in your circle. Guarded and outdoorsy, you've got a bright, mischievous side that comes out with friends, but threaten someone you love and you become an immovable wall.",
  "Nidoran♂": "Nidoran♂ keeps its large ears up to listen for danger, and the horn on its forehead holds a powerful poison. You're always tuned in like that. Approachable and ambitious, you love the energy of a busy place and the people in it, but you keep your mischievous horn handy, just in case anyone gets ideas.",
  "Nidorino": "Nidorino has a short temper, and the horn on its head is harder than a diamond. You're quieter than that sounds, a little elusive and very down-to-earth. But your edgy, mischievous side is real, and when someone pushes you, you react quickly and precisely, which teaches people not to test you twice.",
  "Nidoking": "One swing of Nidoking's thick tail can snap a telephone pole in half, and once it starts rampaging it's very hard to stop. You know your own strength and keep it carefully in check. You're guarded and outdoorsy, with a moody streak and a mischievous sense of humour, but if you're pushed too far, everyone hears about it.",
  "Clefairy": "Clefairy gather on quiet mountains to dance under the full moon, and people rarely get to see it happen. You're like that private dance. You're warm and affectionate with your inner circle and wise beyond your years, but you keep your guard up with strangers, and only a lucky few ever see your truly joyful, magical side.",
  "Clefable": "Clefable's hearing is so sharp it can pick up a pin dropping half a mile away, so it prefers to live somewhere quiet. You're a brilliant listener with a big, bright presence. You're affectionate and modest despite being larger than life, and you need peaceful places to recharge after hearing everyone else's worries.",
  "Mega Clefable": "Clefable skips so lightly using its little wings that it can even walk on water, and it's known to take strolls across lakes on quiet, moonlit nights; when it Mega Evolves, those wings finally grow. You're bright, ambitious and sweet, and when you transform, your kindness takes flight, lifting the people around you along with it.",
  "Vulpix": "Vulpix is born with a single white tail that splits into six as it grows, and it shoots out fireballs when it's angry. You're shy and a little elusive, keeping your guard up with new people. But your passion burns quickly and brightly, and when something matters to you, that small fire turns into something nobody can ignore.",
  "Alolan Vulpix": "Alolan Vulpix lives in packs in the snowy mountains and breathes air colder than minus fifty-eight degrees, and Alola's elders still call it by its old name, Keokeo. You're cool on the surface and warm underneath. Approachable and bright, shaped by where life has put you, your good nature makes even the coldest places feel welcoming.",
  "Ninetales": "Ninetales is said to live for a thousand years, and legend says anyone who grabs one of its tails will be cursed for just as long. You're loyal for the long haul, quick, practical and fiery. But you guard your heart carefully, and anyone who disrespects you will find you remember it for a very, very long time.",
  "Alolan Ninetales": "Alolan Ninetales dwells on sacred snowy peaks, and it's said to appear to virtuous people who've lost their way on mountain paths and guide them safely back down. You've got that calm, sheltering grace. Thoughtful and sweet-natured, shaped by everywhere you've lived, people naturally look to you when they've lost their way.",
  "Jigglypuff": "Jigglypuff never pauses for breath while it sings, so if an opponent won't fall asleep, it can keep going until it's in real danger. You commit completely to sharing what you love. Approachable and grounded, modest about your talents, you keep singing your bright, wholehearted song, because the joy of sharing is the whole point.",
  "Wigglytuff": "Wigglytuff's fur is so fine and soft that touching it is famously comforting, and its body can inflate enormously. You're the friend people want to hug. You're good-natured and sweet, but also a little elusive, and that hint of mystery makes people want to get to know the gentle, bright person underneath.",
  "Zubat": "Zubat has no eyes, so it navigates dark caves by sending out ultrasonic waves and listening for the echoes. You don't need to see the whole map to find your way. You're cool, calm and unhurried, modest about your talents, and your mischievous streak comes out once you're comfortable in the dark corners others avoid.",
  "Golbat": "Once Golbat bites, it keeps draining energy even when it's become too heavy to fly properly. You've got that same appetite for more. You're cool-toned and mischievous, unhurried in how you move, but your ambition is hungry, and when you finally get your teeth into a goal, you hold on until you've had your fill.",
  "Oddish": "Oddish buries itself in the soil during the day, then wanders at night, scattering seeds as it goes. You're quiet in the spotlight but busy behind the scenes. Approachable and outdoorsy, with a mischievous side, you've got big ambitions, and you're always planting little ideas that grow when nobody's looking.",
  "Gloom": "Gloom drools a nectar so smelly it can knock people out, though a handful of people actually love the scent. You're an acquired taste and proud of it. You're edgy and authentic, cool-toned in style but warm in your loyalties, and you'd rather be loved by a few people who get you than adored by many who don't.",
  "Vileplume": "Vileplume has the largest petals in the world, and with every step it scatters clouds of allergy-inducing pollen. You leave a trail wherever you go. You're bright and light-hearted, with a mischievous streak and a slightly elusive air, and people keep feeling your effect long after you've wandered off.",
  "Paras": "Paras has mushrooms called tochukaso growing on its back, and they grow along with it, drawing nutrients from its body. You carry other people's hopes as well as your own. Bold and grounded, you're unhurried in your approach, but your ambition is steady, and you grow stronger alongside the people relying on you.",
  "Parasect": "Parasect's huge mushroom has taken over completely, and the spores it scatters are collected and prized as medicine. You've let your passions shape who you are. Steady, good-natured and unhurried, you're light-hearted company, and your calm presence works like medicine on everyone lucky enough to be around you.",
  "Venonat": "Venonat's big compound eyes work like radar, letting it spot tiny prey even in the dark, and at night it's drawn to bright lights. You notice the things other people miss. You're unhurried and outdoorsy, with classic tastes and a cool calm, and you're always drawn towards whatever, or whoever, is shining brightest.",
  "Venomoth": "Venomoth's wings are covered in dust-like scales, and at night it's drawn to light, flitting around streetlamps. You're bold and light-hearted, and you love to soar. But you're also down-to-earth, and wherever you flutter, you leave a little bit of yourself behind on everyone you meet.",
  "Diglett": "Diglett spends most of its life underground, and farmland it has tunnelled through is said to grow especially good crops. You do your best work out of sight. You're quick and good-natured, with classic tastes and the occasional moody spell, and your quiet effort makes a real difference to everyone around you.",
  "Alolan Diglett": "Alolan Diglett has three metal hairs on its head that it uses to sense its surroundings while it digs through volcanic soil. You're always quietly reading the room. Good-natured and quick, you've adapted well to where you live, and you stay level-headed even when the ground beneath you gets hot.",
  "Dugtrio": "Dugtrio are Diglett triplets who tunnel together at incredible speed, and they're said to think as one. You're at your best on a team. Warm, classic and good-natured, you're authentic about who you are, and when you work alongside people you trust, there's very little you can't dig through.",
  "Alolan Dugtrio": "Alolan Dugtrio's shining golden hair protects it, and it's said that keeping one of its fallen hairs brings bad luck. You've got a striking presence and firm boundaries. You're warm and level-headed, shaped by where you've lived, with a moody side, and people learn quickly that some things about you aren't up for grabs.",
  "Meowth": "Meowth adores round, shiny objects and wanders the streets at night hunting for loose coins. You've got an eye for the good stuff. You're approachable but guarded, bright yet understated, and you're happy to roam around quietly until you find exactly the thing that makes your eyes light up.",
  "Alolan Meowth": "Alolan Meowth was once pampered by Alola's royal family, which left it proud, clever and a little spoiled. You've got that regal confidence. You're approachable and bright, shaped by where you've lived, and your mischievous charm means you usually get what you want without anyone quite noticing how.",
  "Galarian Meowth": "Galarian Meowth sailed with seafaring Vikings for so long that its fur hardened into metal. You've been toughened by your surroundings too. Ambitious, approachable and good-natured, you've adapted to rough conditions, and the grit you picked up along the way is a big part of what makes you so dependable.",
  "Gigantamax Meowth": "Gigantamax Meowth's body stretches impossibly long, and the coin on its forehead becomes a huge, shining charm. You're approachable but guarded in everyday life, bright and modest about it. When the moment calls for drama, though, you go all in, and everyone suddenly notices just how much you shine.",
  "Persian": "Persian is admired for its sleek fur and graceful walk, but it's also famously fickle and can turn on a whim. You carry yourself well. Quick-witted and approachable, you have a bright, elegant manner that people love, though they also know your mood can switch the instant someone gets on your nerves.",
  "Alolan Persian": "In Alola, Persian's round face is seen as a symbol of prosperity, so people pamper it, and it's known for being proud and haughty. You've got that easy confidence. You're quick and light-hearted, shaped by where you've lived, and your mischievous charm means people forgive you almost anything.",
  "Psyduck": "Psyduck suffers from constant headaches, and when the pain gets bad enough it unleashes psychic powers it can't remember using afterwards. You've got hidden depths like that. On the surface you're bright, youthful and endlessly good-natured, the easygoing friend who laughs things off, but you stay level-headed in a crisis and surprise everyone with what you're capable of.",
  "Golduck": "Golduck swims gracefully with its webbed limbs, and the jewel on its forehead glows when it uses its psychic power. You do the practical things beautifully. You're down-to-earth and authentic, a little guarded until you trust someone, and when you're in your element, your calm competence makes hard things look effortless.",
  "Mankey": "Mankey lives in treetop colonies and flies into a rage at the smallest thing, so once it's angry, nobody can calm it down. You've got that natural spark. Fiery and a little moody, you love the bustle of busy places and you wear your feelings openly, and that honesty means people always know exactly where they stand with you.",
  "Primeape": "Primeape gets so furious that it chases anyone who annoys it relentlessly, and it's said its anger never really fades. You feel things with your whole body. You're quick, youthful and fiery, but that intensity runs both ways, and your affection is just as wholehearted and long-lasting as your temper.",
  "Growlithe": "Growlithe is fiercely loyal, barking to drive away anyone who approaches its Trainer without permission. You're the friend who'd defend people to the end. You're approachable and bold, with a fiery warmth and a classic sense of right and wrong, and once you've decided someone's yours, you'll always have their back.",
  "Hisuian Growlithe": "Hisuian Growlithe patrolled its territory in pairs, and its rocky coat formed from living near volcanoes. Your surroundings have shaped you just as clearly. You're approachable and bold, with real fire in your loyalty, and you're happiest when you're standing guard over the people and places you care about.",
  "Arcanine": "Arcanine is said to run nearly six thousand miles in a single day and night, and ancient scrolls describe people captivated by its majestic presence. You live at full speed. You're hands-on and guided by classic values, and though you have your moody moments, your loyalty and grace leave a lasting impression on everyone.",
  "Hisuian Arcanine": "Hisuian Arcanine snaps at foes with fangs cloaked in blazing flame, and despite its bulk, it feints every which way, practically dancing around its opponents. Where you've lived has shaped your style. Quick and hands-on, with a moody streak, you bring rugged, protective warmth to everything, and you're far nimbler than people expect.",
  "Poliwag": "Poliwag's skin is so thin that you can see the spiral of its internal organs through its belly. You're more transparent than you think. You're bright and approachable, with an edgy humour and a classic, open-hearted way of showing people exactly who you are, swirls and all.",
  "Poliwhirl": "Poliwhirl's sweaty skin keeps it moist on land, and staring at the spiral on its belly is said to make people sleepy. You've got that hypnotic, cool calm. You're quick and composed, never flustered, and people find themselves relaxing in your company without quite knowing why.",
  "Poliwrath": "Poliwrath is an incredible swimmer with muscles so strong it can cross oceans without tiring. You've got enormous endurance. Calm and cool-headed, you love the busy pace of urban life but keep your guard up, and your steady strength carries you through challenges that would exhaust most people.",
  "Abra": "Abra sleeps for up to eighteen hours a day, and even while it's asleep, it can teleport away the instant it senses danger. You're more capable than you let on. Easy to talk to and young at heart, you look completely relaxed, but your thoughtful, bold mind is always quietly working away in the background.",
  "Kadabra": "Kadabra emits strange alpha waves that give people headaches, and its silver spoon amplifies its psychic power. You're a thoughtful, bold mind that people can sense in the room. You're young at heart and a little elusive, and you prefer to keep your full abilities just out of sight.",
  "Alakazam": "Alakazam's brain never stops growing, and it's said to remember everything that's ever happened to it. You've got a mind that keeps building on itself. You're guarded and intuitive, but your warm, light-hearted side comes out when you're with people you trust, and you never forget the small things that matter to them.",
  "Mega Alakazam": "When Alakazam Mega Evolves, all its power converts into psychic energy and its muscles lose their strength, but it can foresee its opponents' every move. You run on brainpower. Seasoned and intuitive, you think boldly and deeply, and when you transform, you lean fully into your mind, seeing where things are going before anyone else.",
  "Machop": "Machop loves working out, and it builds its incredible strength by lifting Graveler every day, until it can throw a hundred people at once. You throw yourself into everything. Bold and hands-on, with a fiery temperament and the occasional moody spell, you put in the work day after day, and people admire your dedication.",
  "Machoke": "Machoke is strong enough to lift a dump truck with one hand, and it puts that strength to use helping people with heavy, demanding jobs. You use your power for good. Approachable and bold, seasoned by experience with a slightly edgy wit, people trust you to carry the heavy stuff, because you always use your strength responsibly.",
  "Machamp": "Machamp's four powerful arms can launch a flurry of a thousand punches in just two seconds, and one arm alone is said to be able to move mountains. You're all power and passion. Bold and fiery with a moody, elusive side, you're unstoppable once you've committed, and you put absolutely everything into whatever you've chosen.",
  "Gigantamax Machamp": "Gigantamax energy makes Machamp's punches hit as hard as bomb blasts, and one is said to have lifted a large ship in trouble and carried it safely to port. You transform into a powerhouse when it counts. Good-natured and city-minded, when you go dramatic, you do it in the biggest, most generous way possible, carrying others to safety.",
  "Bellsprout": "Bellsprout's thin, flexible body lets it bend and sway to avoid attacks however strong they are, and it spits a corrosive fluid that can melt iron. You're bold and hands-on, but you know how to stay flexible. You keep a level head under pressure, and your edgy side means people never quite see your sharp comeback coming.",
  "Weepinbell": "At night, Weepinbell hooks its rear onto a tree branch to sleep, and if it wriggles too much in its sleep, it wakes up to find itself on the ground. You take life's tumbles in your stride. Grounded and easygoing, you're happy to dust yourself off and try again, trusting that things will work out.",
  "Victreebel": "Victreebel lures prey with a sweet nectar smell, and it's said to live deep in jungles where few people go. You've got a compact, bright charm that draws people in. Light-hearted and grounded, you're happiest in places that feel a little off the beaten track.",
  "Mega Victreebel": "Victreebel's acid grows sweeter the more prey it dissolves, making it even better at luring more in; when it Mega Evolves, that pull becomes overwhelming. You're a steady, grounded presence, larger than life without trying. You think carefully before you act, and people find themselves drawn towards your calm, unshakeable confidence.",
  "Tentacool": "Tentacool's body is almost entirely water, and it uses the red orbs on its head to soak up sunlight and fire beams. You're cool-toned and grounded, with a mischievous streak. You're more complex than you look, and you keep your guard up until you're sure of someone.",
  "Tentacruel": "Tentacruel's eighty tentacles can stretch and shrink at will, and when the red orbs on its head glow, it's about to attack. You're seasoned and guarded, with a mischievous, authentic streak. You read situations carefully, and when you do make a move, it's precise and unmistakable.",
  "Geodude": "Geodude often rests on mountain paths half-buried in the ground, and hikers sometimes trip over it without noticing. You're grounded and steady, with a warm, hands-on approach. You're guarded and a little moody, but you're always there, holding firm even when people forget to look.",
  "Alolan Geodude": "Alolan Geodude's rocky body is magnetic, covered in iron sand that can give anyone who steps on it a nasty shock. You're a little prickly, but warm underneath. You're good-natured and cool in style, shaped by where you live, and you draw people towards you even if they occasionally get a jolt.",
  "Graveler": "Graveler rolls down mountain slopes on purpose to get around, and it's said to eat a ton of rocks every day. You take life at your own pace. Young at heart and happiest outdoors, you've got a warm, easy nature, and you roll right over obstacles that would stop other people in their tracks.",
  "Alolan Graveler": "Alolan Graveler fights by smashing together the electrically charged rocks on its body, creating crackling sparks. You're unhurried and outdoorsy, happy to take life at your own pace. But living where you do has given you a hidden charge, and when you need to stand your ground, you can make sparks fly.",
  "Golem": "Golem's body is as hard as rock, and it sheds its shell once a year, getting bigger and stronger each time. You're grounded and level-headed, a little moody and very outdoorsy. You grow steadily, shedding old versions of yourself and getting tougher with every year that passes.",
  "Alolan Golem": "Alolan Golem uses magnetism to fire electrically charged rocks, and when it can't fire boulders fast enough, it's been known to grab a nearby Geodude and launch that instead. You improvise brilliantly. Outdoorsy and tech-minded, shaped by your surroundings, you find practical uses for whatever's at hand, and you're always building something bigger.",
  "Ponyta": "A newborn Ponyta can barely stand, but it gets stronger by chasing after its parents, and soon its mane burns hot enough to scorch anyone who isn't trusted. You warm up slowly too. You're friendly once you've decided someone's safe, yet a little guarded and edgy at first, and the fire you carry gets fiercer the more confident you become.",
  "Galarian Ponyta": "Galarian Ponyta's pale mane is woven from psychic energy, and it can heal wounds by touching them with its small horn. Something about growing up where you did gave you that soothing touch. You're approachable and bright with a slightly offbeat, edgy humour, and people tend to come away from time with you feeling a little more mended.",
  "Rapidash": "Rapidash loves to race, and it can hit top speed in just ten strides, chasing anything that moves faster than it does. You're competitive in the best way. You're hands-on and bold, your enthusiasm burns hot and fast, and the moment someone suggests a challenge, you're already halfway down the track.",
  "Galarian Rapidash": "Galarian Rapidash is brave and proud, dashing airily through the forest on psychic power stored in the fur around its hooves, and its horn can punch through thick metal. Where you grew up gave you a natural grace. Warm-hearted and grounded, at home in cities and quiet places alike, there's real strength behind your dignified calm.",
  "Slowpoke": "Slowpoke dangles its tail in rivers to fish, but it often forgets what it's doing, and if something bites its tail, it may not notice for a whole day. You refuse to be rushed. Light-hearted, intuitive and comfortingly old-fashioned, your big, easy presence reminds everyone else that most things can wait until tomorrow.",
  "Galarian Slowpoke": "Galarian Slowpoke eats the seeds of a plant that only grows in Galar, and its tail has developed a spicy flavour as a result. You absorb the flavour of wherever you live. Light-hearted and intuitive, with a big presence, the places and people around you have quietly seasoned you into someone wonderfully distinctive.",
  "Slowbro": "When a Shellder bites onto Slowpoke's tail, it evolves into Slowbro, and if the Shellder ever lets go, it's said to turn back into a Slowpoke. You're the kind of person others latch onto. You're bright and authentic, with a big, grounded presence, and you carry your friends along with you without ever making a fuss.",
  "Galarian Slowbro": "Galarian Slowbro's Shellder clamped onto its arm instead of its tail, and the spice inside made it fire poison like a cannon. You've adapted to your surroundings in surprising ways. You're bright, modest and larger than life, and you've turned a quirk of circumstance into one of your greatest strengths.",
  "Mega Slowbro": "When Slowbro Mega Evolves, its Shellder swallows almost its entire body, leaving it free to lounge while its shell takes the hits. You've mastered the art of letting your defences work for you. You're bright and classic, with a big presence, and when you transform, you somehow become both more relaxed and much harder to beat.",
  "Magnemite": "Magnemite floats using electromagnetic waves from the units on its sides, and it's drawn to power lines and generators. You're drawn to the energy of busy places. You're bold, cool-headed and practical, and you seem to recharge by plugging yourself into whatever, or whoever, has the most going on.",
  "Magneton": "Magneton forms when three Magnemite are linked by magnetism, and its strong magnetic field can make people's ears ring. You're stronger when you're connected. You're tech-minded and grounded, but also affectionate and fiery, and when you're bonded with your people, the energy you generate together is impossible to ignore.",
  "Farfetch’d": "Farfetch'd always carries a stalk of leek, and it'll fight to the end to protect it, even using it as a weapon. You've got your own little quirks and you defend them proudly. You're light-hearted and free-spirited, youthful at heart, and you love to soar off on your own odd little adventures.",
  "Galarian Farfetch’d": "Galarian Farfetch'd carry thicker, longer leeks, and the bravest of them are known as warriors that never back down. You've been shaped by a tough environment, and it shows in your courage. You're grounded and natural, but you have soaring ideals, and you'll always stand up for the people and principles you believe in.",
  "Doduo": "Doduo's two heads never sleep at the same time, so one is always keeping watch, and when it's threatened, it flees at over sixty miles per hour. You're always quietly looking out for others. Bold yet sweet-natured, you're easy to approach, and you'd rather sprint alongside your friends than go off soaring alone.",
  "Dodrio": "Dodrio's three heads are said to represent joy, sadness and anger, and it has three hearts and three sets of lungs, so it can run long distances without rest. You contain a lot of different moods. You're sweet-natured and quick, a bit elusive, and free-spirited enough to let all those feelings coexist without ever slowing down.",
  "Seel": "Seel loves the freezing sea, and it uses the hard horn on its head to smash through ice when it surfaces to breathe. You're happiest when things are cool and calm. You're grounded and good-natured, a little guarded at first, and you have a knack for breaking through awkward moments so everyone can breathe again.",
  "Dewgong": "Dewgong's pure white coat hides it from predators in the snow, and the colder the weather gets, the more active it becomes. You know when to blend in and when to shine. You're calm and guarded, bright when you're comfortable, and your quick-burning enthusiasm comes out most when you're in your element.",
  "Grimer": "Grimer was born when sludge was exposed to X-rays from the moon, and anything it touches gets a little bit messier. You've got that chaotic, playful energy. You're bold and youthful, mischievous to your core, but there's something classic about you too, the cheerful troublemaker every friend group secretly needs.",
  "Alolan Grimer": "Alolan Grimer was brought to Alola to solve a garbage problem, and the toxins it absorbs from all that trash form brilliant crystals on its body. You've turned your surroundings into something beautiful. You're bold and youthful, with a mischievous sense of humour, and you find a way to make even the messy parts of life sparkle.",
  "Muk": "Muk's body is made of toxic sludge, and plants and trees won't grow wherever it has crawled. You have a presence people definitely notice. You're approachable but guarded, with classic tastes and an edgy streak, and you're not interested in toning yourself down just to be more convenient for anyone else.",
  "Alolan Muk": "Alolan Muk's vivid colours come from the chemical changes caused by the garbage it eats, and the more trash it feasts on, the brighter it becomes. You've made your edge into a gift. You're approachable but guarded, shaped by where you've lived, and you do the work others avoid, which is why your community is so glad to have you.",
  "Shellder": "Shellder's shell is harder than diamond, and it likes to stick its long tongue out from between its halves. You're tough on the outside and cheeky underneath. You're cool-toned and unhurried, with the occasional moody spell, but once you feel safe, your good-natured, playful side pokes straight out.",
  "Cloyster": "Cloyster's shell is so tough that even a bomb can't crack it, and it can fire its spikes at enemies. You're remarkably resilient. You're calm, steady and hands-on, completely authentic about who you are, and people know they can lean on you, because you've got the toughness to protect them as well as yourself.",
  "Gastly": "Gastly's thin body is made of gas, so it can slip into any place it likes, and it can envelop an opponent of any size. You're quicker and stronger than you look. You're light-hearted, authentic and warm, and you drift in and out of situations so easily that people barely notice you've arrived until you've already won them over.",
  "Haunter": "Haunter can glide through walls, appearing wherever it likes, and it's said that it tries to steal people's life force with a lick of its gaseous tongue. You love a good surprise. Bold and thoughtful, you're light-hearted company, and your playful, mischievous spirit means you're always slipping into places nobody expected to find you.",
  "Gengar": "Gengar hides in people's shadows, and the room is said to drop several degrees in temperature when it's nearby. You've got an unmistakable presence. Thoughtful yet bold, grounded and genuine, you enjoy a good prank, though you're always careful that the joke is fun for everyone involved.",
  "Mega Gengar": "When Gengar Mega Evolves, it sinks partly into another dimension, keeping a patient watch from there for its chance to strike. You see more than you let on. You're thoughtful and bold, quietly understated, and when you transform, you reveal a perceptive, slightly eerie depth that most people never knew was there.",
  "Gigantamax Gengar": "Gigantamax Gengar's huge mouth is said to lead to the afterlife, and it uses its own gaping maw to trap its foes. You make an entrance nobody forgets. You're thoughtful and bold, and when you go big, you go fully dramatic, transforming into someone so magnetic it's almost a little spooky.",
  "Onix": "Onix bores through the earth at fifty miles per hour, guided by a magnet in its brain that works like a compass, and its body grows rounder and smoother as it ages. You only get stronger with time. You're moody and authentic, with a natural, larger-than-life presence, and you carve your own path wherever you go.",
  "Drowzee": "Drowzee eats people's dreams, and it can tell what someone is dreaming about just by sniffing their nose. You have an uncanny sense of what people want. Young at heart but a little guarded, you're warm-blooded and natural, and you use that intuition to help people get closer to their dreams.",
  "Hypno": "Hypno lulls its foes into a deep trance with the glittering arc of its pendulum, and the longer it swings it, the longer the hypnosis lasts. You have a quietly captivating presence. Bright but modest, deeply intuitive with an edgy streak, you draw people into your orbit without them quite understanding why.",
  "Krabby": "Krabby lives in burrows on sandy beaches, and if it loses a pincer in battle, a new one grows back in its place. Setbacks don't keep you down for long. Hands-on and warm, you stay grounded and steady, and whatever life knocks off you, you quietly regrow it and get straight back to work.",
  "Kingler": "Kingler's huge claw has enormous power, but it's so heavy that it's hard to aim, and it gets tired quickly. You've learned to manage your own strength. You're seasoned, warm and steady, and you've discovered that knowing when to swing is just as important as having the power to do it.",
  "Gigantamax Kingler": "Gigantamax energy makes Kingler's left pincer grow to an enormous size, and the strongly alkaline bubbles it spews can melt opponents away. You've got a big, bubbly personality. Affectionate and bright, you love getting stuck in, and when you let loose dramatically, you fill the whole room with your energy.",
  "Voltorb": "Voltorb looks so much like a Poké Ball that people have been startled when it suddenly exploded, and it was first spotted near a Poké Ball factory. You're full of surprises. Quick and practical, you keep your feet on the ground, but there's a warm-blooded spark in you that goes off the moment something catches your interest.",
  "Hisuian Voltorb": "Hisuian Voltorb looks like an old-fashioned Poké Ball, and when it gets excited, it discharges the electricity in its belly and lets out a great, uproarious laugh. You've been shaped by where you come from, and it gives you an old-fashioned charm. You're good-natured and quick, but if someone startles you, your fiery side flashes out before you can stop it.",
  "Electrode": "Electrode stores so much electricity that the slightest jolt can set it off, earning it the nickname 'the Bomb Ball'. You don't do lukewarm. You're hands-on and genuine, warm in your tastes and fiery in your feelings, and when something matters, you let it out in a single, unforgettable burst.",
  "Hisuian Electrode": "Hisuian Electrode's body is curiously similar to an Apricorn, and when it's irritated, it lets loose an electric current equal to twenty lightning bolts. You build up slowly, then release everything. You're warm-toned and moody, shaped by where you've lived, and your fire tends to arrive suddenly, after a long, quiet charge.",
  "Exeggcute": "Exeggcute is six eggs that communicate with each other by telepathy, and if one strays, the rest quickly gather it back. You stay quietly in tune with the people you love. You're bright and unhurried, a little guarded with outsiders, and your intuition about the group's mood is almost spooky.",
  "Exeggutor": "Exeggutor's three heads each have their own thoughts, and when the time comes, one of them falls off and grows into an Exeggcute. You're full of ideas that go off in their own directions. You're thoughtful and bright, with classic tastes and an edgy wit, and your mind is a busy, leafy place where something's always growing.",
  "Alolan Exeggutor": "Alola's strong sunlight made Exeggutor grow incredibly tall, awakening a dragon's power, and the Alolan people are so proud of it that its image is carved into historic buildings. Your surroundings brought out your big, bright side. You're thoughtful with an edgy streak, and wherever you plant yourself, you grow towards the light and stand out on the skyline.",
  "Cubone": "Cubone wears the skull of its late mother, and when it sees her likeness in the full moon, it cries, its tears staining the skull it wears. You've learned to look after yourself. You're independent and good-natured, warm in quiet ways, and your guardedness comes from a tender heart that's learned to protect itself.",
  "Marowak": "Marowak has overcome its grief and grown tough, wielding its bone like a boomerang with real skill. You've turned hard experiences into strength. You're seasoned and unhurried, happiest in the outdoors, and your warmth carries the quiet confidence of someone who's been through things and come out stronger.",
  "Alolan Marowak": "Alolan Marowak sets the bone it carries alight and dances through the night to mourn its fallen allies. Your environment shaped how you honour the past. You're unhurried and city-minded, loyal to the people you've lost, and you've transformed difficult feelings into something beautiful and meaningful to watch.",
  "Hitmonlee": "Hitmonlee's springlike legs can stretch to double their length to deliver devastating kicks, and after every battle, it carefully rubs down its tired muscles. You've got discipline and fire. You're quick and bold, with classic values about practice and respect, and you approach every challenge with fast, confident footwork.",
  "Hitmonchan": "Hitmonchan is said to be infused with the spirit of a pro boxer, and it throws punches faster than a bullet train, though it needs a short break after three minutes of fighting. You're a fighter, but you keep your guard up. You're hands-on and quick, with real fire in you, and you'll keep going round after round until you've reached your goal.",
  "Lickitung": "Lickitung's tongue is twice the length of its body, and it uses it like a hand to grab and explore things. You find unusual ways to engage with the world. You're bright and practical, compact in your habits, a bit elusive, and endlessly curious about anything you haven't already tasted for yourself.",
  "Koffing": "Koffing's thin, balloon-like body is filled with toxic gas, and it mixes its toxins with raw garbage to brew an even more powerful poison. You float through life on your own terms. You're unhurried and light-hearted, with an edgy sense of humour and a practical knack for finding what you need.",
  "Weezing": "Weezing alternately shrinks and inflates its twin bodies to mix the toxic gases inside, and the more they're mixed, the more potent they become. You thrive in a bit of chaos. Light-hearted and down-to-earth, you love getting stuck in with your hands, and causing a little cheerful trouble with your best friends.",
  "Galarian Weezing": "Galarian Weezing consumes the particles that pollute the air and, instead of leaving droppings, expels clean air, a change it's thought to have made when factories fouled the skies long ago. You quietly make things better. You're warm-blooded but cool-toned in style, understated about your good deeds, and you've transformed yourself into someone who cleans up the mess others leave.",
  "Rhyhorn": "Rhyhorn charges forward in a straight line, and it's said to be so forgetful that it can't remember why it started running. You go all in. You're grounded and hands-on, a little elusive, and your natural determination means you keep moving forward, even if you've forgotten the original plan.",
  "Rhydon": "Rhydon's drill-like horn can crush diamonds, and its tough hide is so heat-resistant that it can walk through molten lava. You're tougher than you realise. You're unhurried and youthful, with a moody edge, and you stride calmly through situations that would leave most people completely overwhelmed, barely noticing the heat.",
  "Chansey": "Chansey carries a highly nutritious egg in its pouch, and it happily shares it with injured people and Pokémon, which is why it's thought to bring happiness. You give generously. Bright and modest, you're the practical, affectionate friend who arrives with exactly what someone needs, without ever needing to be asked.",
  "Tangela": "Tangela's body is hidden by a tangle of blue vines that keep growing back when they're torn off, and nobody knows what lies underneath. You keep a little mystery about yourself. You're grounded and everyday on the surface but quietly ambitious, and you only let people see as much of you as you choose.",
  "Kangaskhan": "Kangaskhan raises its young in its belly pouch, and it only lets its baby out to play when it feels completely safe. You're fiercely protective. You're quick and authentic, guarded with strangers and moody when threatened, and the people you love know they'll always have a safe place with you.",
  "Mega Kangaskhan": "When Kangaskhan Mega Evolves, its baby grows big enough to leap out of the pouch and fight side by side with its parent. You get braver with people you love beside you. You're quick and authentic, guarded with strangers, and when you transform, you become part of an unbeatable two-person team.",
  "Horsea": "Horsea anchors itself to coral with its curled tail, and when danger comes, it squirts thick ink and darts away. You stay steady and know your escape routes. You're grounded, cool and calm, and you protect yourself so smoothly that people rarely realise you were ever under pressure.",
  "Seadra": "Seadra's spines are poisonous, and it's the males who raise the young, fiercely guarding the nest. You're a protector beneath a cool exterior. You're calm and youthful with a moody streak, and once someone's under your care, you'll defend them with a prickliness nobody wants to test.",
  "Goldeen": "Goldeen's elegant fins ripple like a ballgown, earning it the nickname 'the Water Queen', but its horn is sharp. You've got natural grace with a point to it. Warm and hands-on, you glide through new situations adaptably, which makes people underestimate how grounded and strong you really are.",
  "Seaking": "Seaking bores holes into riverbed boulders with its horn to make nests that keep its eggs from washing away, and in autumn, the males patrol around them to protect their young. You're a quietly determined builder. Seasoned and warm, you stay grounded and adapt as you go, pushing against the current for as long as it takes to make a home for the people you love.",
  "Staryu": "Staryu can regrow any of its limbs as long as its red core is intact, and at night that core glows. You're more resilient than you look. You're calm and youthful, warm in your tastes with a moody side, and you bounce back from setbacks quietly, glowing a little brighter each time.",
  "Starmie": "Starmie's jewel-like core shines in seven colours, and some people believe it's sending signals out into space. You've got a slightly cosmic quality. You're cool-toned and good-natured, completely authentic, and people sense that your calm, natural way of being is tuned to something much bigger than the everyday.",
  "Mega Starmie": "Starmie's core glows in seven colours when it unleashes its psychic power, and when it Mega Evolves, that glow flares into a dazzling light, like a star at full strength. You glow brighter as you grow. You're cool-toned and good-natured, natural in how you carry yourself, and when you transform, you become impossible to look away from.",
  "Mr. Mime": "Mr. Mime's fingertips can solidify the air, and it uses this to create invisible walls through pantomime. You protect yourself creatively. Quick and thoughtful, with a natural, intuitive feel for people, you know how to set boundaries without saying a single word, just by how you carry yourself.",
  "Galarian Mr. Mime": "Galarian Mr. Mime tap-dances constantly, and it creates walls of ice beneath its feet to dance on. Your surroundings gave you your own style. You're quick and thoughtful, with an edgy sense of performance, and you've turned the chilly parts of life into a stage to show off your rhythm.",
  "Scyther": "Scyther slashes through grass with its twin scythes, moving far too fast for the human eye to track. You're quick and decisive. You're bright and youthful, cool in your style and happiest outdoors, and you slice through problems before anyone else has finished worrying about them.",
  "Jynx": "Jynx dances to its own rhythm, swaying its hips as it walks, and its cries sound eerily like human speech. You express yourself in a way that's uniquely yours. Bright and intuitive, you stay cool and calm, picking up meaning in the gaps between words that other people completely miss.",
  "Electabuzz": "Electabuzz loves electricity so much that it often gathers at power plants, and when it does, nearby cities can suffer blackouts. You're drawn to energy. Quick, bright and warm-blooded, you love new tech, and you can't resist plugging into whatever is buzzing with the most activity.",
  "Magmar": "Magmar is found near the mouths of volcanoes, and its body temperature reaches nearly two thousand two hundred degrees. You've got a natural warmth that's hard to contain. Quick and bright, you run warm-blooded, and you're always ready to heat things up with your energy and enthusiasm.",
  "Pinsir": "Pinsir grips its prey between its two huge horns and won't let go, but when it's cold it gets sluggish and hides in the forest. You're quick and capable once you're warmed up. Modest about your strength and happiest outdoors, you've got a bright, determined grip on the things you care about.",
  "Mega Pinsir": "After Mega Evolution, Pinsir becomes able to fly, and it seems so happy about it that it rarely touches the ground, carrying foes ten times its weight through the air. You're everyday and down-to-earth until ambition gives you lift. Quick and outdoorsy, you seize opportunities with both hands, and once you're airborne, there's no stopping you.",
  "Tauros": "Tauros whip themselves with their three tails to psych up before a charge, and once running, they won't stop until they hit something. You're sweet underneath a tough exterior. Quick and down-to-earth, with an elusive streak, you fire yourself up and then commit fully to whatever direction you've chosen.",
  "Paldean Tauros (Aqua Breed)": "Aqua Breed Tauros swims by jetting water from holes in its horns, and its unusually high body fat lets it float with ease. You've adapted to your surroundings with real composure. Grounded and cool-headed, you keep calm under pressure, and that steadiness lets you push forward when others burn out.",
  "Paldean Tauros (Blaze Breed)": "Blaze Breed Tauros snorts hot air from its nostrils, and when its horns are heated by fire energy, they get hotter than eighteen hundred degrees. You've picked up a fiery edge from where you've lived. Quick and light-hearted, you're good-natured company, but when you decide to go for something, you charge at it with real heat.",
  "Paldean Tauros (Combat Breed)": "Combat Breed Tauros has thick, powerful muscles and a fierce disposition, and it excels at close combat, aiming its short horns at an opponent's weak spots. Your surroundings toughened you up. Quick and warm-blooded, you stay grounded, and when something gets in your way, you meet it head-on with a strength people respect.",
  "Magikarp": "Magikarp is famously weak, flopping about uselessly, but it can survive in almost any body of water, however polluted. You're more resilient than people think. Warm, calm and a little guarded, you quietly endure setbacks that would sink others, and everyone who wrote you off is in for a surprise.",
  "Gyarados": "When Magikarp evolves into Gyarados, its brain cells transform, which is said to explain its violent nature, and ancient records describe one that razed a village. You've been through a big transformation. Larger than life but good-natured, you're hands-on and everyday in how you live, and you've learned to channel your power instead of letting it rage.",
  "Mega Gyarados": "Mega Gyarados becomes a Dark type, its temper so fierce it's said to destroy everything in sight until it calms down. You're calm and guarded most of the time. But you've a mischievous side, and when you transform under pressure, you become an unstoppable force that nobody wants to be on the wrong side of.",
  "Lapras": "Lapras is a gentle soul that can understand human speech, and it ferries people across the sea on its back. You carry people through rough waters without complaint. Calm, thoughtful and tireless, you're understated about the kindness you show, and people trust you to get them safely to the other side.",
  "Gigantamax Lapras": "Over five thousand people can ride on Gigantamax Lapras's shell at once, without the slightest shake, while a huge ring of ice around it smashes any icebergs in its way. Your capacity for care is huge. Calm and thoughtful, you never seem to run out of energy for others, and when the moment calls for it, your kindness becomes dramatically big.",
  "Ditto": "Ditto can rearrange its cells to transform into any Pokémon it sees, though it struggles to copy faces from memory. You adapt to people beautifully. Grounded and natural, you're sweet-natured and easy to be around, though a moody day shows you've got your own shape underneath all that flexibility.",
  "Eevee": "Eevee's unstable genes let it evolve in many different ways depending on its environment. You're full of untapped potential. Elusive and a little guarded, you keep your feelings understated, and those moody spells are really just you working out which of your many possible paths feels right.",
  "Gigantamax Eevee": "Gigantamax energy makes the fur around Eevee's neck even fluffier, enveloping a foe and captivating its mind, and it gets so friendly that it tries to play with everyone around. You're usually guarded and understated. But when you go dramatic, you become irresistibly comforting, and the people around you see just how much warmth you've been keeping to yourself.",
  "Vaporeon": "Vaporeon's cells are so similar to water molecules that it can melt into a lake and become invisible. You blend effortlessly into new places. Thoughtful and tireless, you have classic tastes and love city life, and you flow through busy places so smoothly that people only notice you when you choose to be noticed.",
  "Jolteon": "Jolteon's fur bristles into sharp needles when it's angry, and it builds up electricity in its cells before firing off lightning bolts. You're quick-thinking and full of charge. Thoughtful and genuine, you love tech and ideas, and when you're fired up, your sharp mind works at lightning speed.",
  "Flareon": "Flareon stores heat in a flame sac in its body, and its fluffy collar helps release excess warmth so it can cool down. You've got a warm, comforting presence. Bright and unhurried, you're hands-on and love busy places, and you know how to keep your heat at a level that warms others rather than burns them.",
  "Porygon": "Porygon was created by people using the latest programming, and it can convert itself back into data to travel through cyberspace. You're a little elusive and built for the modern world. Grounded and sweet-natured, you're affectionate with your people, and you connect with them in ways they never quite expect.",
  "Omanyte": "Omanyte is an ancient Pokémon revived from a fossil, and it once swam by adjusting the air in its spiral shell. You've got an old soul in a young body. Compact and thoughtful, you adapt quietly to new circumstances, and there's something timeless about the way you navigate the world.",
  "Omastar": "Omastar's heavy shell grew so large that it's thought to have made it too slow to catch prey, leading to its extinction. You're thoughtful and larger than life. Grounded and adaptable, you carry a lot, and you've learned that knowing your limits is just as important as building yourself up.",
  "Kabuto": "Kabuto was regenerated from the fossil of an ancient creature, and it protects itself with its hard, domed shell. You've got an old-fashioned practicality. Young at heart and good-natured, you have the occasional moody spell, but you're tough underneath and always watching carefully from your shell.",
  "Kabutops": "Kabutops was a swift swimmer that slashed its prey with its scythe-like claws, then drank their bodily fluids. You're quick, sharp and level-headed in a crisis. Warm in your tastes but a little elusive, you move decisively, and people learn not to underestimate how efficiently you get things done.",
  "Aerodactyl": "Aerodactyl ruled the prehistoric skies, and it was revived from DNA found preserved in amber. You've got a wild, ancient spirit. Bold and genuine, you love the outdoors and have a moody streak, and when you take off on your own adventures, it feels like something old and powerful has been set free.",
  "Mega Aerodactyl": "When Aerodactyl Mega Evolves, its body bristles with rocky spikes, and its ferocity returns to that of the ancient skies. You transform into something fierce. Bold and outdoorsy, you're moody and fearless, and when you change, you tap into an older, wilder part of yourself that nothing can tame.",
  "Snorlax": "Snorlax eats nearly nine hundred pounds of food a day and spends the rest of its time asleep, and it's so docile that children play on its big belly. You're unhurried and understated, and you know the value of a good nap. Sweet-natured with a moody side, you're the comfortable presence everyone loves, as long as nobody wakes you too early.",
  "Gigantamax Snorlax": "Gigantamax energy makes the stray seeds and pebbles stuck to Snorlax grow to enormous sizes, and the Pokémon itself becomes the size of a mountain, moving about as much as one. You're usually the unhurried, understated friend. But when you go dramatic, you become a whole landscape of warmth that everyone else can settle into.",
  "Articuno": "Articuno is a legendary bird that's said to appear to doomed travellers lost in icy mountains, and it creates snow as it flies. You're practical and calm. Good-natured and cool under pressure, you show up for people when they need you most, and you bring a peaceful clarity to the coldest moments.",
  "Galarian Articuno": "Galarian Articuno's feather-like blades are made of psychic energy that can shear through thick iron, and it fires beams that leave opponents frozen in place. You've been shaped by your surroundings into someone cool and perceptive. Legendary in your own way, you're intuitive and calm, and people find your quiet focus mesmerising.",
  "Zapdos": "Zapdos is a legendary bird that gains power when struck by lightning, and it's said to appear from thunderclouds. You're energised by challenges. Warm and modest, with classic tastes and a love of tech, you seem to grow stronger every time life throws a storm at you.",
  "Galarian Zapdos": "Galarian Zapdos is said to run through the mountains at over a hundred and eighty miles per hour, and one kick from its powerful legs can pulverise a dump truck. You've adapted to your surroundings in your own way. Legendary yet modest, you're warm and full of energy, and you're happiest when you're running towards your next big goal.",
  "Moltres": "Moltres is a legendary bird whose flaming wings bring spring to the land, and it's said to heal itself by bathing in magma. You're warm and modest, natural in your approach. With classic tastes and a fiery heart, you bring warmth and renewal to everyone you meet, healing yourself through passion.",
  "Galarian Moltres": "Galarian Moltres blazes with a sinister, flame-like aura that consumes the spirit of anything it touches, leaving its victims burned-out shadows of themselves. You've been shaped by your surroundings into someone with a cool, mischievous edge. Practical and a little mysterious, you know how to make an impression that people won't soon forget.",
  "Dratini": "Dratini keeps growing all its life, shedding its skin again and again, and for a long time people thought it was only a myth. You're forever outgrowing old versions of yourself. Young at heart and fiercely independent, you adapt to whatever comes, and you'd much rather swim your own course than follow anyone else's current.",
  "Dragonair": "Dragonair is said to control the weather, and the crystal orbs on its neck and tail give off a gentle, mysterious aura. Experience has given you a quiet sort of power. Independent and adaptable, you're a free spirit who changes the mood of a room simply by drifting into it, calm on the surface with real depth beneath.",
  "Dragonite": "Dragonite is kind-hearted enough to guide shipwrecked sailors to land, and it can circle the globe in just sixteen hours. You'll go to the ends of the earth for people. Modest and approachable despite your strength, you're a free spirit with your feet on the ground, and others feel safe the moment you arrive.",
  "Mega Dragonite": "Dragonite is so kind-hearted that it simply must help any drowning person or Pokémon it spots, and when it Mega Evolves, that urge to help seems to give it even more strength. Ambition gives your free spirit real lift. You stay grounded about who you are, but when you transform, you're ready to fly further and faster than you ever thought possible.",
  "Mewtwo": "Mewtwo was created by scientists rearranging Mew's genes, and it's said to have the most savage heart of any Pokémon. You've spent a lot of time working out who you really are. Ambitious and fiercely authentic, you have deep intuition and keep people at a distance, but your search for purpose is what makes you so compelling.",
  "Mega Mewtwo X": "Mega Mewtwo X's psychic power augments its muscles so much that it has a grip strength of one ton and can sprint a hundred metres in two seconds flat. Your strength is surprisingly physical. Understated and intuitive, you're light-hearted on a good day and moody on a hard one, and when you transform, your mind turns into raw, focused power.",
  "Mega Mewtwo Y": "Mega Mewtwo Y is smaller than Mewtwo, but its mental power has grown so phenomenally that it can smash a skyscraper with a mere thought. You know that brains beat brawn. Ambitious and level-headed, your intuition guides your moves, and when you transform, you become sharper and more precise than anyone in the room.",
  "Mew": "Mew is said to carry the genetic code of every Pokémon, and it's so rarely seen that many experts believe it's only a mirage. You hold a lot of potential in one person. Bright and intuitive yet level-headed and grounded, you're playful enough to surprise everyone, and wise enough to know when to stay out of sight.",
  "Chikorita": "Chikorita waves the leaf on its head to give off a sweet, fresh scent that calms everyone around it, and it loves sunbathing. You bring that quiet calm with you. Warm-blooded and outdoorsy, you're a little elusive, but your natural, gentle presence makes even strangers feel more relaxed after a few minutes with you.",
  "Bayleef": "The spicy aroma from the leaves around Bayleef's neck is said to perk people up and make them feel energised. You lift people's moods without trying. Good-natured and light-hearted, you keep some of your plans to yourself, but there's real ambition growing quietly underneath that easy charm.",
  "Meganium": "Meganium's breath can revive dead plants, and the scent from its flower soothes angry feelings and calms fights. You're the everyday peacemaker. Quick, hands-on and happiest outside, you have a knack for walking into a tense room and leaving it calmer, greener and kinder than you found it.",
  "Mega Meganium": "When Meganium Mega Evolves, the great flower around its neck blooms even wider, spreading its soothing, restorative fragrance much further. Your kindness has big ambitions. Thoughtful and sweet-natured, you love the outdoors, and when you transform, the calm you bring stops being local and starts reaching everyone.",
  "Cyndaquil": "Cyndaquil is timid and usually curls into a ball, but when it's startled or angry, the flames on its back flare up in a burst. You're young at heart and light-hearted, a little shy until something fires you up. Then your bright, fiery side comes roaring out, and everybody remembers it.",
  "Quilava": "Quilava keeps its foes at bay with intense heat, and its fiery collar flares up and crackles when it's ready to fight. You keep people at a careful distance until you trust them. Bright with an edgy streak, you're a little elusive and guarded, but once someone gets close, they feel your warmth properly.",
  "Typhlosion": "Typhlosion hides behind a shimmering heat haze, and when it's angry, its explosive flames can burn everything around it. You've got a deep, authentic intensity. Thoughtful and natural, with classic values, you don't waste your fire on trivial things, but when something matters, people feel the heat.",
  "Hisuian Typhlosion": "Hisuian Typhlosion is said to purify lost, forsaken souls with its flames and guide them to the afterlife, its form shaped by the energy of a sacred mountain. Your surroundings gave you an old, gentle wisdom. Bright and thoughtful, natural in how you carry yourself, you help people through hard endings with real tenderness.",
  "Totodile": "Totodile has a habit of biting anything with its powerful, well-developed jaws, so even its own Trainer has to be careful. You show affection in your own unusual way. Hands-on and down-to-earth, you love the bustle of a busy place, and your elusive playfulness keeps everyone around you on their toes.",
  "Croconaw": "Once Croconaw clamps its jaws on something, it won't let go, and its fangs regrow if any break off. You're cool, calm and unhurried, but your grip on what you care about is unbreakable. You don't rush, and you don't let go, and people quickly realise you're more determined than you look.",
  "Feraligatr": "Feraligatr finds it hard to support its own weight out of water, so it gets down on all fours, but it can still move fast when it charges. You're affectionate and genuine, light-hearted in good company. You keep a level head, thinking before you make a move, but once you commit, you go at it with full strength.",
  "Mega Feraligatr": "When Feraligatr Mega Evolves, its jaws grow even larger and its body sleeker, letting it surge forward with explosive power. You keep your transformations understated. Level-headed and city-minded, you don't make a fuss, but when you finally change gear, people are amazed by how much strength you've been holding back.",
  "Sentret": "Sentret takes turns keeping watch, standing tall on its tail to look out for danger and alerting the others with a loud cry. You're the thoughtful lookout in your group. Modest and sweet-natured, you have the occasional moody day, but your friends know you'll always spot trouble before it arrives.",
  "Furret": "Furret's slender body lets it slip through narrow gaps, and it builds nests that perfectly fit its long shape. You fit yourself into people's lives easily. Sweet-natured and approachable, you've got a big personality and love the city, and you always seem to find the cosiest spot in any room.",
  "Hoothoot": "Hoothoot always stands on one foot, switching legs so quickly you can barely see it, and its internal clock keeps perfect time. You've got a steady, reliable rhythm. Warm, sweet-natured and young at heart, you love to soar, and people can always count on you to be exactly where you said you'd be.",
  "Noctowl": "Noctowl's eyes concentrate even the faintest light, letting it see in pitch darkness, and it's known as the emperor of dark nights. Experience has given you wisdom and perspective. Warm and thoughtful, you have a sweet nature that people trust, and you're the friend they turn to when they feel lost in the dark.",
  "Ledyba": "Ledyba are timid and uneasy unless they're in a swarm, and when the weather turns cold, they gather from everywhere to cluster together for warmth. You're happiest with your people. A little guarded but quick and free-spirited, you love to flutter off on adventures, so long as you can always find your way back to the group.",
  "Ledian": "Ledian flies by starlight and its spots grow larger when the stars are out, sprinkling a glowing dust as it flies. You come alive at night. Quick and free-spirited, you love to soar, but you're also guarded, and your full brilliance only shows when the conditions are exactly right.",
  "Spinarak": "Spinarak spins a strong web and waits patiently, sometimes for days, until prey gets caught in its threads. You're unhurried and bright, with a warm-blooded heart. Affectionate with your people, you know that the best things in life come to those who are prepared to wait.",
  "Ariados": "Ariados spins thread from both ends of its body, and it can attach silk to its prey, set it free, then track the thread back to its friends. You keep track of what you care about. Steady and unhurried, you're light-hearted company, but your mischievous side means you have a habit of turning up just when nobody expects you.",
  "Crobat": "Crobat developed a second pair of wings on its legs, letting it fly silently and at high speed through the darkness. You're cool-toned and quick, with a mischievous streak. Down-to-earth and everyday, you move through life smoothly and quietly, getting where you need to go before anyone notices.",
  "Chinchou": "Chinchou lives deep in the dark sea, and it uses its glowing antennae to communicate and to stun its prey. You've got a bright, edgy spark. Youthful and grounded, you're tech-minded and good at finding your way in the dark, lighting the path for yourself and others.",
  "Lanturn": "Lanturn's light is so bright that it can be seen from the surface of the sea, and it's called 'the deep-sea star'. You're a calm, guiding presence. Tireless and tech-minded, you keep your guard up, but your steady light shines on everyone around you, helping them find their way.",
  "Pichu": "Pichu isn't very good at storing electricity yet, so it sometimes accidentally zaps itself when it's excited. You're bold and full of energy, even when it's a little hard to control. Modest and affectionate, you're tech-minded and full of spark, and people love your enthusiastic, slightly chaotic charm.",
  "Cleffa": "Cleffa are often spotted on nights full of shooting stars, and it's said they arrive on Earth riding meteors. You've got a little bit of stardust about you. Young at heart and warm with the people you love, you stay guarded with strangers, but your affection is pure magic once someone wins your trust.",
  "Igglybuff": "Igglybuff's body is so soft and bouncy that once it starts bouncing it can't stop, and its vocal cords aren't quite developed yet. You're joyfully, unstoppably young at heart. Approachable and sweet, you're light-hearted company, and even when your voice isn't fully formed yet, your enthusiasm says everything for you.",
  "Togepi": "Togepi's shell is said to be filled with joy, and it's believed to share that happiness with people who are kind to it. You're a quiet bringer of good luck. Good-natured with classic, gentle values, you stay grounded, and your bright little presence rewards anyone who treats you and others with kindness.",
  "Togetic": "Togetic is said to appear to kind-hearted people, sprinkling a shining dust of happiness, and it grows weak if it isn't around kindness. You thrive on goodness. Sweet and practical, you've learned a lot about people, and you like the buzz of city life, where you can spread your quiet joy to as many people as possible.",
  "Natu": "Natu's wings aren't developed enough to fly, so it hops around, staring intently at people as if it can see their future. You're quick and intuitive, with your feet firmly on the ground. Warm-blooded and perceptive, you notice what's coming long before anyone else does, even if you can't yet fly towards it.",
  "Xatu": "Xatu stands motionless all day staring at the sun, and it's said one eye sees the past while the other sees the future. You've got a calm, far-seeing wisdom. Good-natured and intuitive, with a cool, soaring perspective, you spend a lot of time thinking quietly, and people trust your sense of where things are heading.",
  "Mareep": "Mareep's fluffy wool builds up static electricity, and it puffs up to twice its size when it's fully charged. You're soft, light-hearted and full of energy. Practical and tech-minded, with a surprisingly big presence, you store up enthusiasm until it's bursting, then share the spark with everyone around you.",
  "Flaaffy": "Flaaffy stores so much electricity in its fleece that it's gone bald in patches, but the bare spots have rubbery skin that's perfectly safe to touch. You've adapted to change practically. Experienced, warm and a little edgy, you've learned to keep your energy where you need it, and you're stronger for having let some things go.",
  "Ampharos": "The light from Ampharos's tail is so bright it can be seen from space, and in olden times people used it as a lighthouse. You're the steady beacon others steer by. Modest despite a big presence, you're bright and independent, and people find their way home thanks to your quiet, reliable glow.",
  "Mega Ampharos": "The energy of Mega Evolution makes the wool Ampharos had lost grow back, and it seems to awaken its long-sleeping dragon's blood. You've got hidden depths waiting to show. Bright and ambitious, with an edgy love of new tech, you surprise people when you transform, revealing a power and style they never knew was in you.",
  "Bellossom": "When Bellossom dance together, their petals rub against each other and make pretty, relaxing sounds, and when cloudy weather drags on, they dance as if to call the sun back. You've got a compact, practical charm. Affectionate and joyful, you have a playful, edgy streak, and you bring a sense of celebration wherever you go, dancing through the good times.",
  "Marill": "Marill's tail is filled with oil that acts like a float, so it can play in fast rivers without being swept away. You stay afloat no matter what. Good-natured and practical, with classic tastes and occasional moody spells, you have a knack for keeping your head above water when life gets turbulent.",
  "Azumarill": "Azumarill's long ears can hear the sounds of prey moving in a fast river, and its round body helps it float effortlessly. You're a great listener. Affectionate and sweet, you're compact and practical, and you float through life with ease because you always take the time to listen to what's going on around you.",
  "Sudowoodo": "Sudowoodo pretends to be a tree to avoid battles, but it's actually a Rock type and hates water. You're happy blending in. Unhurried and natural, you love the outdoors, but you have a moody side, and people might not realise you're more than you seem until they get close.",
  "Politoed": "When Politoed calls out, groups of Poliwag and Poliwhirl gather to listen, and it's revered as the king of the frogs. You've got a natural, easy charisma. Affectionate and good-natured, with the occasional moody day, you never ask for attention, yet people somehow end up gathered around your big personality.",
  "Hoppip": "Hoppip is so light that even the gentlest breeze can carry it away, and it clings to the ground in strong winds. You're a free spirit who knows when to hold on. Warm and thoughtful, you keep your guard up, but you let the wind of life carry you to new places when it's safe.",
  "Skiploom": "Skiploom's flower opens and closes depending on the temperature, and it floats high in the sky to soak up the sun. You're outdoorsy and bright, sensitive to the mood around you. Guarded and free-spirited, you open up when you feel the warmth of a good friendship, and close off when things get cold.",
  "Jumpluff": "Jumpluff drifts on seasonal winds right across the world, and wherever it goes, it scatters cotton-like spores that grow into new plants. You're an everyday adventurer. Practical and down-to-earth with an edgy, moody streak, you love to wander, and you leave a little piece of yourself in every place you pass through.",
  "Aipom": "Aipom's tail is so dexterous that it uses it like a hand, swinging between branches and grabbing things while its real hands stay free. You're resourceful and level-headed. Sweet-natured and affectionate, you love the energy of a busy place, and you always find clever ways to juggle more than everyone else.",
  "Sunkern": "Sunkern sometimes falls suddenly from the sky in the morning, and it tries to move as little as possible to save its limited energy. You're happy to take life slowly. Bold in your own quiet way, light-hearted and modest, you're in no rush, trusting that you'll bloom in your own time when the moment is right.",
  "Sunflora": "Sunflora turns its face to follow the sun all day, converting the light into energy, and it becomes sluggish when the sun goes down. You're always looking for the bright side. Approachable and good-natured, you're light-hearted with an edgy wit, and your warmth noticeably dims only when you've been without sunshine too long.",
  "Yanma": "Yanma's large eyes let it see in all directions without moving its head, and it can fly at high speed in any direction. You're bold and quick, with a soaring spirit. Grounded and perceptive, you see all the angles of a situation, and you can change direction in an instant.",
  "Wooper": "Wooper usually lives in water, but when it ventures onto land in search of food, it coats its body in a gooey, toxic film. You're cool, calm and wonderfully easy to approach. Your laid-back, friendly nature makes everyone comfortable, and you're always up for an unhurried wander.",
  "Paldean Wooper": "Paldean Wooper lost its habitat in a battle long ago, so it adapted to living on land, coating its body in poisonous film. You're light-hearted and warm, shaped by your surroundings. Compact and resilient, you've adapted to change with a smile, and you've found a way to thrive in a new environment.",
  "Quagsire": "Quagsire is so easygoing that it often bumps its head on boat hulls while swimming, and it doesn't seem to mind at all. You don't let small knocks bother you. Cool and calm, you love being outdoors at your own pace, and though you stay a little guarded, your unflappable nature is wonderfully reassuring to everyone around you.",
  "Espeon": "Espeon's fine fur senses the slightest shift in air currents, letting it predict the weather and its opponents' next move. You read people unusually well. Good-natured with classic tastes and an edgy streak, you trust your intuition, and you're often reacting to things before anyone else has realised they're happening.",
  "Umbreon": "When Umbreon is angry, its rings glow in the dark, and it releases a poisonous sweat from its pores. You've got a cool, nocturnal kind of style. Guarded and mischievous, you love the city at night, and the people who get close to you see a glow that the rest of the world rarely notices.",
  "Murkrow": "Murkrow is said to bring bad luck to anyone who sees it at night, and it has a habit of collecting shiny things. You're a bold free spirit with a mischievous eye for treasure. Young at heart, you love a bit of mystery, and you're always flitting off to see what interesting things you can find.",
  "Slowking": "When a Shellder bit Slowpoke's head, it turned into Slowking, and the toxin made it so intelligent it ponders world mysteries. You've got a bright, thoughtful mind. Light-hearted and authentic, with a big presence, you're always thinking, and people value your wisdom and gentle, regal humour.",
  "Galarian Slowking": "A mix of toxins and the shock of evolving made Galarian Slowking's Shellder so intelligent that it now controls Slowking, chanting strange spells while it brews peculiar potions. You've been transformed by your surroundings. Bright and larger than life, you have a sharp mind, and your unique perspective comes from all the experiences that have shaped you.",
  "Misdreavus": "Misdreavus loves to sneak up on people at night, wailing and tugging at their hair, then soaking up their startled reactions through the red orbs around its neck. You live for a reaction. Bold and young at heart, you've got a cool, mischievous edge, and you love keeping people guessing about what you'll do next.",
  "Unown": "Unown are shaped like ancient writing, and to this day it's a mystery whether written language or Unown came first. You see patterns and meanings others miss. Steady and intuitive, light-hearted with occasional moody spells, you're happiest piecing together the bigger picture from small, scattered clues.",
  "Wobbuffet": "Wobbuffet hides its black tail at all costs, patiently enduring every attack without striking first, and only ever lashing out to counter. You're endlessly patient. Seasoned, cool and steady, you rarely start a fight, but you can take an enormous amount before you push back, and when you do, it's perfectly measured.",
  "Girafarig": "Girafarig's tail has its own small brain, and it reacts automatically to smells and sounds, guarding against anyone who creeps up from behind. You've always got your back covered. Bright and sweet-natured, you're a little elusive, and your intuition picks up on things before your conscious mind has even caught up.",
  "Pineco": "Pineco hangs from tree branches waiting for prey, and if it's disturbed while it's resting, it might suddenly explode. You're unhurried and natural, happy to stay put in your favourite spot. You have a big presence and a moody side, and people quickly learn that interrupting your downtime is a risky move.",
  "Forretress": "Forretress hides inside its tough steel shell and stays rooted in place, opening up only briefly to snatch its prey. You're steady and hands-on, a little guarded from the outside. But you're warm-blooded and deeply affectionate, and the people you do open up to find a surprisingly caring heart inside all that armour.",
  "Dunsparce": "Dunsparce creates mazes in dark places, and when it's spotted, it flees by furiously boring backwards into the ground with its tail. You're more playful than people expect. Young at heart, warm and sweet-natured, you've got a cosy, unassuming charm, and you'd much rather build your own little world than be the centre of attention.",
  "Gligar": "Gligar glides silently from cliffs on its wing-like membranes, clinging to its target's face before it can react. You're quick to seize a moment. Outdoorsy and young at heart, you have a moody, guarded side, and people learn that your quiet glide in often comes with a surprising sting.",
  "Steelix": "Steelix is said to have formed when Onix lived underground for over a hundred years, its body compressed into steel harder than diamond. Time and pressure have made you formidable. You're moody and authentic, with a huge presence and a love of tech, and you only grow tougher as life squeezes you.",
  "Mega Steelix": "Steelix is tempered deep underground under such intense pressure and heat that its body is harder than any metal, and Mega Evolution makes it even more formidable. You're hands-on and larger than life, with a moody intensity. When you transform, you harden into something unbreakable, and the pressure that would crush other people just makes you shine.",
  "Snubbull": "Snubbull looks scary, but it's actually affectionate and loves being cuddled, which makes it popular with young women. You're bold and hands-on, but your bark is far worse than your bite. Level-headed and sweet-natured, you're a big softie underneath, and the people who look past your tough face love you for it.",
  "Granbull": "Granbull's lower jaw is so heavy it has to tip its head back to balance, yet it's actually timid and easily spooked. You've got a tough exterior and a soft heart. Bold and seasoned, you look formidable, but anyone who knows you sees a warm-blooded, sweet-natured friend who'd rather share a laugh than a fight.",
  "Qwilfish": "Qwilfish swallows water to inflate its body, then fires its poisonous spines in every direction when it's threatened. You're young at heart and mischievous, but authentic to your core. You keep your guard up, and people quickly learn not to provoke you, because you've got plenty of prickly defences.",
  "Hisuian Qwilfish": "Fishers detest Hisuian Qwilfish because it sprays poison from its spines and gets it absolutely everywhere, while a different form of Qwilfish lives in other regions. You're everyday and youthful, shaped by your surroundings. City-minded and resilient, you've adapted to a tough environment, and you've got a few sharp edges to show for it.",
  "Scizor": "Scizor's steel pincers have eye-like patterns that intimidate its foes, and its wings vibrate to control its body temperature. You're down-to-earth and tech-minded. Authentic and soaring, you're always in control of yourself, and your quiet confidence is enough to make anyone think twice before challenging you.",
  "Mega Scizor": "Mega Evolution gives Scizor's pincers a more diabolical form, ripping anything they pinch to shreds, though their weight becomes too much in a long battle. You're tech-minded and down-to-earth, with a soaring spirit. When you transform, you become an unstoppable force, and your focused strength and determination are simply impossible to ignore.",
  "Shuckle": "Shuckle stores berries inside its hard shell, where they slowly ferment into a delicious juice. You're unhurried and grounded, happy to let things mature in their own time. Bright and a little guarded, you keep your best qualities tucked away, and the people who wait for them are always rewarded.",
  "Heracross": "Heracross loves sweet honey, and it uses its powerful horn to throw opponents much larger than itself. You've got a fiery, protective strength. Outdoorsy and good-natured, you're a bit guarded, but you'll throw your full weight behind protecting the people and things you care about.",
  "Mega Heracross": "Mega Heracross can grip things between its two horns and lift five hundred times its own body weight, though it's left with terrible muscle soreness once Mega Evolution ends. You're outdoorsy and natural, with a genuinely good nature. When you transform, you discover reserves of strength you never knew you had, lifting burdens that would crush anyone else.",
  "Sneasel": "Sneasel scales trees by punching its hooked claws into the bark, then steals eggs from unguarded nests while the parents are away. You're quick and level-headed, with a cool, down-to-earth style. You're more cunning than you look, and you always keep a few tricks up your sleeve, ready to use them at exactly the right moment.",
  "Hisuian Sneasel": "Hisuian Sneasel's sturdy, curved claws are ideal for climbing sheer cliffs, and venom drips from their tips that seeps into the nerves of anything it scratches. You've been shaped by a tough environment, and you're bold and quick to show it. Fiery and fearless, you're always ready for a challenge, and you've learned to fight for what you want.",
  "Teddiursa": "Teddiursa's palms are always sweet from being soaked in honey, which it makes itself by blending fruit with pollen collected by Beedrill. You're sweet-natured and a little elusive, with a warm, hands-on personality. You like making sweet things from scratch, and you're happy to share your treats with the people you love.",
  "Ursaring": "Ursaring has an excellent sense of smell, and it can track down food that's buried deep underground. You're authentic and grounded, with a natural instinct for finding the good things in life. City-minded but at home in nature, you're always tracking down your next big discovery.",
  "Slugma": "Slugma's body is made of magma, and it has to keep moving to stop itself from cooling down and hardening. You're youthful and warm-blooded, with an edgy energy. You're always on the go, because staying still makes you restless, and your warmth is contagious to everyone around you.",
  "Magcargo": "Magcargo's body temperature is said to be hotter than the surface of the sun, and its brittle shell of cooled magma crumbles at a touch. You're unhurried and grounded, and you adapt to whatever life throws at you. There's a moody side to you, but underneath that calm exterior burns an intense, fiery passion that few people ever get to see.",
  "Swinub": "Swinub roots through snow with its sensitive nose, and when it catches a promising scent, it's been known to dig up a hot spring by accident. You have a knack for finding warmth in cold places. Outdoorsy with an edgy streak, you stay cool and calm, quietly digging for the good stuff while everyone else complains about the weather.",
  "Piloswine": "Piloswine's shaggy fur grows so long that it covers its eyes, so it relies on its keen nose to find its way through the snow. You trust your instincts over appearances. Warm and comfortingly big-hearted, you stay cool and calm, and people feel safe following you, even when the path ahead is hard to see.",
  "Corsola": "Corsola's coral branches break off easily but grow back in about three days, and people keep the most beautiful ones as charms for safe childbirth. You bounce back from anything. Good-natured and young at heart, you're bright company, practical about setbacks, and the people around you seem to do better simply for knowing you.",
  "Galarian Corsola": "Galarian Corsola died out long ago when the climate suddenly changed, and its ghost now lingers in the sea, cursing anyone careless enough to kick it. Your surroundings have left their mark on you. Young at heart but guarded, you're practical about protecting yourself, and you've learned exactly who's earned the right to come close.",
  "Remoraid": "Remoraid fires jets of water from its mouth with incredible accuracy, knocking down prey from over three hundred feet away. You've got a sharp aim in life. Grounded and adaptable, you stay cool and calm under pressure, and you know exactly how to hit a target, even one that seems impossibly far away.",
  "Octillery": "Octillery uses its suction-cup tentacles to grip prey, and it lives in rocky holes, spraying ink to blind enemies before escaping. You're calm, bold and warm in your tastes. Practical in a pinch, you know exactly when to hold on tight and when to make a smart, inky getaway from a situation that isn't worth it.",
  "Delibird": "Delibird carries food in its tail all day, and it's famous for sharing it with people lost in the mountains, like a gift-giving Santa. You're seasoned and warm, a bold giver at heart. You love to soar off on generous adventures, and people remember you as the friend who always shows up with exactly what they need.",
  "Mantine": "Mantine glides gracefully through the waves, and when it builds up enough speed, it can leap out of the sea and soar above the surface. You're calm and thoughtful most of the time. But your enthusiasm burns quickly when something excites you, and in those moments you launch yourself into the air and fly.",
  "Skarmory": "Skarmory's steel wings get battered and dented in battle, but they grow back once a year, sharper than before. You've been through some knocks. Warm-blooded yet cool in style, completely authentic, your passions flare up quickly, and every time life dents you, you come back with stronger, sharper edges.",
  "Mega Skarmory": "Skarmory's shed feathers are so sharp that warriors long ago used them as swords, and Mega Evolution hones that steel even further. You're city-minded and a little guarded. You love tech and sharp design, and when you transform, you become streamlined, focused and capable of cutting through any problem in your way.",
  "Houndour": "Houndour hunt in packs, communicating with each other using cries that sound like barking, and they coordinate perfectly to corner their prey. You're approachable and independent, with a fiery heart. Moody at times, you're also a loyal pack player, and you work brilliantly with the people you trust.",
  "Houndoom": "Houndoom's eerie howl is said to be a sign of approaching death, and its flames leave burns that ache for a long time. You've got a dark, light-hearted sense of humour. Authentic and mischievous, with moody spells, you have a presence that's impossible to forget once you've made an impression.",
  "Mega Houndoom": "Mega Evolution makes Houndoom's whole body generate heat, so much that its red claws and tail tips start to melt, which is painful even for Houndoom itself. You're light-hearted with a mischievous edge, and you're no stranger to moody spells. When you transform, you become fierce and fiery, burning brighter than anyone expected.",
  "Kingdra": "Kingdra sleeps quietly deep on the seafloor, and when it comes up to the surface, it creates a huge whirlpool that can swallow even ships. You're cool, calm and deep. A free spirit who keeps a low profile, you seem relaxed on the surface, but a single stretch of your influence can stir up something powerful.",
  "Phanpy": "Phanpy uses its long trunk to give itself a shower, and when others gather around, they all thoroughly douse each other with water. You're approachable and grounded, with a thoughtful, cool-toned style. You love simple pleasures and good company, and you're happiest when you're surrounded by friends having a good time.",
  "Donphan": "Donphan curls into a ball and rolls at high speed to charge, and it's strong enough to knock down a house in a single tackle. You're unhurried and outdoorsy, but bold when the moment comes. Moody at times, you take your time building momentum, and once you're rolling, nothing gets in your way.",
  "Porygon2": "Porygon2 was upgraded with the latest technology to explore space, and it has the ability to learn new behaviours on its own. You're bright and practical, always improving yourself. Sweet-natured but a little elusive, you're constantly learning and adapting, becoming a better version of yourself.",
  "Stantler": "Stantler's curved antlers create a strange distortion in the air, making it hard for people to see where it really is. You're elusive and bold, with a sweet nature. Moody at times, you keep people guessing, and your mysterious presence means you're hard to pin down.",
  "Smeargle": "Smeargle marks its territory using a fluid from its tail, and each one has its own unique artistic style. You're a seasoned, sweet-natured artist at heart. A little guarded and elusive, you express yourself in your own unique way, leaving your creative mark on everything you touch.",
  "Tyrogue": "Tyrogue is always bursting with energy, so it trains constantly to burn it off, and it'll pick a fight with opponents far bigger than itself. You're young at heart and fiery, with a cool, natural style. You never shy away from a challenge, and your boundless energy keeps pushing you to grow stronger every day.",
  "Hitmontop": "Hitmontop spins on its head like a top, delivering a flurry of kicks while it twirls, and it's an expert at defensive spinning. You're hands-on and quick, with a fiery spirit. Guarded but resilient, you know how to protect yourself while still staying in motion, and you never let anyone knock you off balance.",
  "Smoochum": "Smoochum checks its reflection constantly and loves to kiss anything with its sensitive lips, using them to explore. You're affectionate and level-headed, with a playful, edgy style. You love the city and the people in it, and you're never afraid to show people how much you care about them.",
  "Elekid": "Elekid generates electricity by whirling its arms, and when it's in a house, the electrical outlets serve as its baby bottles. You're always generating your own energy. Fiery but grounded, warm in your tastes and endlessly curious about tech, you keep finding new ways to spark your enthusiasm and share it around.",
  "Magby": "Magby's body is always burning with heat, and when it's healthy, yellow flames puff out of its mouth and nose with every breath. Your warmth shows in everything you do. Fiery yet grounded, you love natural, cosy things, and your enthusiasm is so contagious that people can't help but feel brighter around you.",
  "Miltank": "Miltank's milk is so nutritious that it's supported the lives of people and Pokémon since ancient times, and kids who drink it are said to grow up hearty and healthy. You're level-headed and sweet-natured, a bright source of comfort. A little guarded, you're also nurturing, and people always feel better after spending time with you.",
  "Blissey": "Blissey's eggs are so nutritious they're said to make anyone who eats them happy, and it can sense sadness through its fluffy fur. You're bright and affectionate, ambitious about caring for others. Grounded and nurturing, you're always there to lift up the people around you with your warmth and kindness.",
  "Raikou": "Raikou embodies the speed of lightning, and its roar is said to make the air shake like thunder. You're thoughtful and tech-minded, with a warm, legendary energy. You move fast when you have a purpose, and your presence is powerful enough to make everyone sit up and take notice.",
  "Entei": "Entei embodies the passion of magma and is thought to have been born in a volcanic eruption, and it's said that a new Entei is born every time a new volcano appears. You carry an old, deep fire. Thoughtful and natural, you're comfortable in busy cities and wild places alike, and your warm-blooded passion can ignite enthusiasm in everyone around you.",
  "Suicune": "Suicune embodies the purity of water, and it's said to be able to purify dirty water just by touching it. You're natural, cool and calm, with a good-natured spirit. You have a calming presence, and you have a knack for making messy situations clean and clear.",
  "Larvitar": "Larvitar is born deep underground, and it must eat its way through all the soil above before it can reach the surface and see its parents' faces. You're happy doing the hard work out of sight. Independent and hands-on, you love the outdoors, and you're a little elusive, quietly building yourself up before you're ready to break through.",
  "Pupitar": "Pupitar's shell is harder than bedrock, and it propels itself like a rocket by blasting out compressed gas. You're compact and adaptable, with a warm-blooded heart. You have moody spells, but you're gathering strength inside your shell, and when you launch yourself into something, you go with explosive force.",
  "Tyranitar": "Tyranitar is so powerful that it can knock down a mountain, and it's said that maps need redrawing when it rampages. You're bright and ambitious, with a mischievous independent streak. Unhurried but genuine, you're a force of nature, and when you set your mind to something, the world reshapes around you.",
  "Mega Tyranitar": "The colossal power of Mega Evolution splits Tyranitar's back right open, and it becomes so ferocious that it's unclear whether it can even hear its Trainer's orders. You're bright, ambitious and fiercely independent. When you transform, your mischievous energy turns into raw power, and nothing stands in your way.",
  "Lugia": "Lugia sleeps deep in the ocean because its power is too destructive, and it's said that a flap of its wings can cause a forty-day storm. You're a legendary, intuitive soul with classic values. Cool and guarded, you keep your power under control, but when you rise, everyone feels the storm.",
  "Ho-Oh": "Ho-Oh's feathers glow in seven colours, and it's said that anyone who sees it will be blessed with eternal happiness. You're legendary and good-natured, with an ambitious, warm heart. You bring hope and joy wherever you go, and your presence is a blessing to everyone who meets you.",
  "Celebi": "Celebi travels through time, and wherever it appears, the forest is said to be full of life and lush greenery. You're thoughtful and intuitive, a little guarded but full of ambition. You're quick and compact, and you seem to bring a sense of growth and renewal everywhere you go.",
  "Treecko": "Treecko has tiny hooks on the soles of its feet that let it scale sheer walls, and it stays calm and collected even when cornered. You keep your cool when things get tricky. Quick-thinking and bold, you love the outdoors, and though you're affectionate with friends, you stay a little elusive, always ready to climb over the next obstacle.",
  "Grovyle": "Grovyle leaps nimbly from branch to branch through dense jungles, and in a forest, no Pokémon can hope to catch a fleeing Grovyle, however fast it may be. You move through life quickly and gracefully. Thoughtful with classic values, you're affectionate with the people you care about, and you've got a knack for slipping past problems that slow everyone else down.",
  "Sceptile": "Sceptile's back is covered in seeds that are said to revitalise trees, and it nurtures the forest it calls home. You quietly help things grow. Quick and warm-blooded, you have moody spells, but your affection is deep, and the people around you flourish because you're looking after them in ways they barely notice.",
  "Mega Sceptile": "The leaves on Sceptile's arms are sharp enough to slice down thick trees, and in the jungle its power is without equal, even before Mega Evolution charges it further. You're bold and level-headed, with a warm, affectionate heart. When you transform, your care for others becomes something powerful and fierce, ready to burst out when needed.",
  "Torchic": "Torchic has a fire burning in its belly, and if you hug it, it feels as warm as a hot water bottle. You've got a big, warm heart. Ambitious and good-natured, you're a little elusive at first, but once people get close, they find a cosy, comforting warmth that's impossible to resist.",
  "Combusken": "Combusken's legs are so powerful it can deliver ten kicks a second, and it lets out a fierce cry to intimidate opponents. You're bold and hands-on, with a warm, enthusiastic energy. A little elusive, you're always ready to jump into action, kicking things into motion with your passion.",
  "Blaziken": "Blaziken's wrists burst into flames when it fights, and it can leap over a thirty-storey building with its powerful legs. You're fiery and authentic, with a light-hearted, affectionate side. When you're motivated, you leap over obstacles with ease, and your passion lights up everyone around you.",
  "Mega Blaziken": "Blaziken's wrist flames burn more intensely the stronger its foe is, and Mega Evolution sets that fire blazing even higher. You build momentum as you go. Understated and city-minded, you might start quietly, but your fiery determination means you only burn brighter the tougher the challenge gets.",
  "Mudkip": "Mudkip's fin acts like a radar, letting it sense movements in the water, and it can lift boulders with its powerful body. You're cool, calm and good-natured, but a little elusive. You've got a sixth sense for what's happening around you, and you're much stronger than your gentle exterior suggests.",
  "Marshtomp": "Marshtomp's body is covered in a sticky film that helps it move through mud, and it's more comfortable in the mud than in the water. You're hands-on and down-to-earth, with a natural good nature. Seasoned by experience, you're happiest getting stuck in, and you're comfortable in messy situations that others might avoid.",
  "Swampert": "Swampert is strong enough to tow a heavy ship, and it can sense subtle changes in the waves that warn it a storm is coming. You see trouble before it arrives. Level-headed and bright, you stay cool and calm when the weather turns, and your steady strength lets you pull the people you love through the roughest storms.",
  "Mega Swampert": "Swampert's arms are as hard as rock, strong enough to break a boulder with a single swing, and it can swim while towing a large ship. Your strength is quiet and dependable. Bright, level-headed and down-to-earth, you become truly formidable when you transform, carrying burdens that would sink anyone else without complaint.",
  "Poochyena": "Poochyena will chase anything that moves, and it's known for its stubbornness, never giving up on its prey. You're modest but edgy, a city-minded spirit with a natural tenacity. You don't let go of your goals easily, and people respect your determination to see things through.",
  "Mightyena": "Mightyena hunt in packs and follow their leader with absolute loyalty, and they won't attack unless the leader gives the signal. You're loyal to the people you trust. Unhurried and city-minded, with a moody, edgy streak, you thrive in a group with a clear leader, and you'd never let your pack down.",
  "Zigzagoon": "Zigzagoon walks in a zigzag pattern, sniffing out hidden items in the grass with its keen curiosity, and it's always discovering something new. You've got a curious, wandering spirit. Approachable and grounded, though a little guarded and moody at times, you're forever stumbling on hidden treasures in places others walk straight past.",
  "Galarian Zigzagoon": "Galarian Zigzagoon is thought to be the oldest form of Zigzagoon, and it's so restless that it'll purposely run into other Pokémon just to start a fight. You're approachable and level-headed, with a moody streak. You've been shaped by your surroundings, and your cheeky, provocative sense of humour keeps people on their toes.",
  "Linoone": "Linoone can sprint in straight lines at incredible speeds, but it's terrible at turning corners, so it often overshoots its target. You commit wholeheartedly. Sweet-natured and larger than life, with grounded, classic values, once you've chosen your direction you charge ahead at full speed, even if changing course isn't your strongest suit.",
  "Galarian Linoone": "Galarian Linoone charges at opponents with its tongue out, slamming into them with all its might, and it's said to be the original form of Linoone. Your surroundings gave you a bold, rebellious streak. Sweet-natured and larger than life, you're grounded in who you are, and you're not afraid to charge in head-first when something matters.",
  "Wurmple": "Wurmple uses the spikes on its rear to strip bark from trees so it can feed on the sap underneath, and it's a favourite target of bird Pokémon. You're bold and grounded, getting on with things at your own unhurried pace. Modest and hard-working, you know exactly how to dig past the surface to get to the good stuff.",
  "Silcoon": "Silcoon wraps its body in silk to protect itself while it evolves, and it peeks out through holes in its cocoon to watch the world. You're thoughtful and steady, protecting yourself while you grow. Modest but bright, you keep a careful eye on the world around you, waiting patiently until you're ready to emerge.",
  "Beautifly": "Beautifly's colourful wings are beautiful, but it's surprisingly aggressive, using its long mouth to drain the juice of flowers. You're a free spirit with a bold, seasoned edge. Thoughtful and determined, you might look delicate, but you're fierce about chasing the sweet things in life.",
  "Cascoon": "Cascoon is said to hold grudges, and it remembers anyone who attacked it while it was a cocoon. You're thoughtful and modest, protecting yourself while you grow. Light-hearted on the surface, you have a moody side, and people learn that you don't forget easily if someone crosses you.",
  "Dustox": "Dustox scatters toxic powder with every flap of its wings, and at night it's drawn to the bright lights of cities, gathering in swarms around streetlamps. You're pulled towards wherever the energy is. Bright yet grounded, your enthusiasm burns quickly and you love to soar, and you leave a lasting impression on every place you visit.",
  "Lotad": "Lotad floats on the surface of ponds under a leaf so wide that small Pokémon sometimes ride on it like a raft. You're a quietly supportive presence. Unhurried and bright, you stay cool and calm, and the people around you feel safe relying on you to carry them across difficult waters.",
  "Lombre": "Lombre loves mischief, and it's known for lurking underwater and tugging on anglers' fishing lines just to watch them panic. You've got a cheeky, playful humour. Young at heart and happiest outdoors, you stay cool and calm on the surface, but there's always a prank bubbling just underneath.",
  "Ludicolo": "When Ludicolo hears a cheerful rhythm, its cells become active and it can't stop dancing, and the energy makes it stronger. You come alive with the right music. Affectionate and practical, with a big personality and the occasional moody spell, you light up whenever there's something to celebrate, and you get everyone else dancing too.",
  "Seedot": "Seedot hangs from tree branches looking exactly like an acorn, and it absorbs nutrients from the tree until it's ready to drop. You're approachable and thoughtful, happiest outdoors. Warm and patient, you know how to blend in while you're still growing, soaking up everything you need before you're ready to make your move.",
  "Nuzleaf": "Nuzleaf makes a flute from the leaf on its head, and its haunting melody is said to unsettle anyone who hears it. You're modest and unhurried, with a practical, affectionate side. You might not be the loudest in the room, but people remember the unique tune you bring to their lives.",
  "Shiftry": "Shiftry lives quietly deep in the forest, and its leaf fans can create gusts of wind strong enough to blow away houses. You're bold and grounded, with an everyday, down-to-earth spirit. You prefer to keep to yourself in the great outdoors, but you've got a powerful presence when you need to use it.",
  "Taillow": "Taillow is young and brave, and it'll fearlessly take on much stronger opponents, even though it feels lonely when it's apart from its group. You're bright and sweet-natured, with a cool, soaring spirit. You're braver than you look, and you're always ready to stand up for what you believe in, even if you're scared.",
  "Swellow": "Swellow cleans its glossy wings constantly, and it's said that when it soars through the sky, it's flying in search of a warm climate. You're bold and city-minded, with a bright, cool-toned style. You take pride in yourself, and you're always flying towards a better, brighter future.",
  "Wingull": "Wingull rides the sea breeze with its long, narrow wings, soaring for hours without flapping, and it hides food in hollows along the cliffs. You glide through life with a light touch. Quick and light-hearted, you love soaring off on adventures, and your bright, breezy energy makes everyone around you feel a little freer.",
  "Pelipper": "Pelipper carries food and small Pokémon in its huge bill, and it acts like a flying delivery service, ferrying eggs and little Pokémon across the sea. You're dependable and seasoned. Warm but a little guarded, you love to soar off and help out, and people know they can trust you to carry what matters safely to its destination.",
  "Ralts": "Ralts senses people's emotions through the horns on its head, and if it picks up hostility, it hides away. You're deeply intuitive. Bold but sensitive, you love the energy of the city, but you have a cool, guarded side that steps back when the mood turns sour, protecting your delicate heart.",
  "Kirlia": "Kirlia's power grows when its Trainer is happy, and it dances joyfully when they share good feelings together. Your mood rises and falls with the people you love. Sweet-natured and intuitive, with a seasoned wisdom, you thrive on positive energy, and you light up whenever the people around you are happy.",
  "Gardevoir": "Gardevoir will risk its life to protect its Trainer, and it can create a small black hole to shield them from danger. You're fiercely protective of the people you love. Modest and unhurried, but deeply intuitive and independent, you'll stand between your loved ones and any threat without a second thought.",
  "Mega Gardevoir": "Gardevoir will dedicate itself to defending a master it has come to adore, and its psychic power peaks when it's protecting its Trainer, a power Mega Evolution magnifies even further. You're independent and bright, with a quietly understated elegance. When you transform, you blossom into someone graceful and powerful, ready to protect what matters with everything you've got.",
  "Surskit": "Surskit glides across the surface of ponds as if it were skating, secreting a sweet-smelling syrup from the tip of its head. You glide gracefully through life. Cool and calm, with a steady, larger-than-life presence, you make difficult situations look effortless, skating over problems that would drag others under.",
  "Masquerain": "Masquerain's antennae have eye-like patterns that scare off enemies, and it flies freely with four wings, even hovering like a helicopter. You're a light-hearted free spirit with a thoughtful mind. You love to soar, and you have a clever way of deflecting trouble while you float off towards your next adventure.",
  "Shroomish": "Shroomish lives in damp, dark forest floors, and it scatters toxic spores from the top of its head when it's threatened. You're light-hearted and warm, with a compact, classic charm. You're happiest in cosy, familiar places, but people learn not to underestimate you, because you can defend yourself.",
  "Breloom": "Breloom's arms stretch out when it punches, and it uses fast footwork to dodge attacks and deliver devastating blows. You're bold and seasoned, with a grounded, cool-toned style. You've learned how to move quickly and hit hard when it counts, and people respect your skill and experience.",
  "Slakoth": "Slakoth spends twenty hours a day lying down, and it moves so little that it only needs to eat three leaves a day. You're the master of conserving energy. Light-hearted and natural, with a big presence, you're wonderfully practical about doing as little as possible, and you're the most relaxing person to be around.",
  "Vigoroth": "Vigoroth is so restless that it can't stay still for even a minute, and it gets stressed if it isn't constantly moving. You're full of energy and good nature. Down-to-earth and city-minded, you're a bit guarded, but your relentless enthusiasm keeps you busy, always looking for the next thing to do.",
  "Slaking": "Slaking lies around all day, eating the grass within reach, and when it's finished, it simply shifts to a new spot. But it's one of the strongest Pokémon there is. You're sweet-natured and bold, with quick bursts of energy. Moody at times, you only move when you need to, but when you do, you're unstoppable.",
  "Nincada": "Nincada lives underground for years, feeding on tree roots with its sharp claws while it waits to evolve. You're quick and warm-blooded, with a big presence. Good-natured and patient, you're happy to spend time growing in the dark, knowing that when you finally emerge, you'll be ready to fly.",
  "Ninjask": "Ninjask moves so fast that it's almost invisible, and the buzzing of its wings is so loud that it can give people headaches. You're quick and bold, a free spirit who loves to soar. You're always on the move, zipping from one adventure to the next, and people often struggle to keep up with you.",
  "Shedinja": "Shedinja is the hollow shell left behind when Nincada evolves, and it's said to steal the soul of anyone who peeks into the hole in its back. You're grounded and steady, with a mischievous, authentic streak. You're full of mystery, and people are drawn to you, even if they can't quite figure you out.",
  "Whismur": "Whismur's cries are usually like quiet murmurs, but if it's frightened, it shrieks at the same volume as a jet plane. You're approachable and bold, with a thoughtful, practical nature. You might seem quiet on the surface, but when something surprises you, everyone hears about it.",
  "Loudred": "Loudred's shouts are so loud that they can shake houses, and it stamps its feet to increase the volume. You're approachable and grounded, with a moody, sweet-natured side. You've got a big voice, and when you feel strongly about something, you're not afraid to let everyone know.",
  "Exploud": "Exploud's howls can be heard over six miles away, and it communicates with others of its kind by emitting all sorts of sounds from the ports all over its body. You're level-headed and down-to-earth, but when you feel strongly, everyone hears it. Sweet-natured beneath the volume, with moody spells, your passion carries a very long way.",
  "Makuhita": "Makuhita never gives up, getting back on its feet no matter how many times it's knocked down, and it builds its strength by slamming into trees. You're young at heart, with a fiery, affectionate spirit. Unhurried in your training but endlessly determined, you keep getting back up until you've reached your goal.",
  "Hariyama": "Hariyama can knock a truck flying with a single slap, and it loves to test its strength in sumo-style shoving matches. You're bold and quick, with an edgy, moody streak. You love a friendly contest of strength, and people know you're not someone to be pushed around.",
  "Azurill": "Azurill swings its rubbery tail like a hammer, and it can hurl itself over ten metres by bouncing on it. You're good-natured and down-to-earth, with a city-minded spirit. A little elusive, you've got a bouncy, playful energy that lets you spring out of tricky situations.",
  "Nosepass": "Nosepass's magnetic nose always points north, and it's said to move just one centimetre a year. You're grounded and practical, with an approachable, guarded nature. You stay true to your own direction, slow and steady, and people trust your sense of where things should be heading.",
  "Skitty": "Skitty can't resist chasing anything that moves, and it often ends up chasing its own tail round and round until it gets dizzy. You're endlessly curious. Sweet-natured and bright, with a modest, thoughtful side, your playful energy makes people smile, even on the days you spend happily running in circles.",
  "Delcatty": "Delcatty is famously free-spirited, wandering wherever it likes and never staying in one place, and it's admired for its elegance. You're unhurried and sweet-natured, good-natured but a little moody. You go where your heart leads, and people are charmed by your graceful, independent way of moving through the world.",
  "Sableye": "Sableye lives in dark caves, digging up gems with its sharp claws and eating them, which is why its eyes sparkle like jewels. You're hands-on and seasoned, with a natural, mischievous streak. You love uncovering hidden treasures, and your eyes light up whenever you find something precious.",
  "Mega Sableye": "When Sableye Mega Evolves, the huge red gem it carries becomes a shield, and it hides behind it to defend itself. You're seasoned and edgy, with a cool-toned style. When you transform, you learn to protect yourself, using your greatest treasures as a shield against the world.",
  "Mawile": "Mawile's huge jaws are actually steel horns that it uses to trick opponents, while its cute face lures them in. You're hands-on and seasoned, with a cool-toned love of tech. You've got a sweet face, but people quickly learn not to underestimate you, because you've got a powerful bite.",
  "Mega Mawile": "Mega Mawile's two sets of jaws thrash about as if each had a will of its own, and one gnash from them can turn a boulder to dust. You've got classic charm with a hidden double bite. Unhurried and city-minded, you transform by doubling down on your strengths, and people suddenly discover just how formidable you really are.",
  "Aron": "Aron eats iron ore to build up its steel body, and when it's hungry, it has been known to chew on railway tracks. You've got a big appetite for life. Independent and outdoorsy, with a love of tech, you stay a little elusive while you steadily build yourself into something unbreakable.",
  "Lairon": "Lairon drinks spring water rich in minerals to strengthen its steel armour, and it fights fiercely to defend its territory. You're grounded and hands-on, quietly building up your strength. Elusive and fond of tech, you're protective of your space, and people learn that you're tougher than you first appear.",
  "Aggron": "Aggron claims an entire mountain as its territory, and it plants trees and restores the land after landslides or fires. You're outdoorsy and independent, with a tech-minded streak. Unhurried but deeply caring, you protect your space fiercely, and you work hard to repair the damage that others leave behind.",
  "Mega Aggron": "Aggron wears the gouges in its iron armour with pride as mementos of past battles, and Mega Evolution encases it in even tougher steel. You wear your history with pride. Practical and city-minded, cool in style but warm-blooded underneath, you transform into someone focused and unbreakable, carrying every lesson you've learned.",
  "Meditite": "Meditite meditates every day to boost its spiritual power, and it's said to be able to float in the air while it trains. You're bright and good-natured, with a guarded side. City-minded but centred, you know the value of taking time for yourself, and your calm presence helps you rise above stress.",
  "Medicham": "Medicham has developed a sixth sense through meditation, and it's said to be able to predict an opponent's move before they make it. You're bright and seasoned, with an edgy, intuitive mind. A little guarded, you read situations with uncanny accuracy, staying one step ahead.",
  "Mega Medicham": "Medicham elegantly avoids attacks with dance-like steps, then launches a devastating blow in the same motion, a style Mega Evolution sharpens even further. You're bright, quick and wonderfully hands-on. When you transform, your warm, fiery energy flows into one graceful motion, and you suddenly find yourself handling far more than anyone thought possible.",
  "Electrike": "Friction between the air and Electrike's fur produces static electricity, so it makes a crackling sound as it runs and gives off sparks when a storm approaches. You build energy from everything you do. Approachable and bright, with classic values and a love of gadgets, you pick up momentum from the world around you and share it with everyone.",
  "Manectric": "Manectric's mane collects electricity from the air, and it's said to make its home where lightning strikes, calling thunderclouds over its den. You draw energy from the atmosphere around you. Thoughtful and genuine, you never rush, and your unhurried, tech-minded calm hides a mane full of crackling ideas.",
  "Mega Manectric": "Mega Evolution fills Manectric's body with so much electricity that it can't fully control it, and while the build-up irritates it, its speed becomes equal to a lightning bolt. You're bright and thoughtful, with a love of tech. When you transform, all that stored-up energy becomes impossible to contain, and you crackle with ideas and drive.",
  "Plusle": "Plusle cheers its partners on by making pom-poms out of sparks, and it's said to soak up electricity from telephone poles to keep going. You're everyone's biggest cheerleader. Bright and good-natured, with a seasoned, slightly edgy wit, you lift the people around you, and your enthusiasm is genuinely electric.",
  "Minun": "Minun cares more about cheering on its partners than its own safety, and when its friends are losing, its body lets off more and more sparks. You're the loyal supporter in the background. Bright and tech-minded, but guarded with an edgy side, you feel your friends' wins and losses as if they were your own.",
  "Volbeat": "Volbeat's tail glows at night, and it uses the light to draw pictures in the sky as it communicates with others in its swarm. You're practical and ambitious, with a moody streak. Hands-on and expressive, you love to show people your ideas, painting them in bold strokes for everyone to see.",
  "Illumise": "Illumise leads Volbeat with its sweet aroma, guiding them to create elaborate patterns of light in the night sky. You're the thoughtful organiser behind the show. Ambitious and practical, with moody spells, you have a knack for bringing people together to create something beautiful and memorable.",
  "Roselia": "Roselia raised on clean water grow vividly coloured flowers whose aroma brings serenity, but the thorns on its head contain a vicious poison. You're outdoorsy and thoughtful, with a moody, mischievous side. You've got a soothing charm that draws people in, but you're not afraid to show your thorns if someone pushes you.",
  "Gulpin": "Gulpin's body is almost entirely stomach, and its powerful digestive juices can break down nearly anything, so it can swallow things as big as itself. Nothing seems too much for you to take on. Bright, with a cool style and classic tastes, your mischievous side means you'll happily bite off far more than anyone expects.",
  "Swalot": "Swalot has no teeth, so it swallows its food whole, and its mouth can open wide enough to gulp down an entire tyre. You're larger than life and deeply affectionate. Moody and mischievous, you take on everything wholeheartedly, and there's no situation you can't swallow down and deal with.",
  "Carvanha": "Carvanha swarm together and attack anything that strays into their territory, and their jaws are strong enough to bite through a boat's hull. You stay calm right up until someone crosses a line. Bold and warm in your tastes, you protect your space fiercely, and your cool exterior hides a surprisingly sharp bite.",
  "Sharpedo": "Sharpedo can swim at seventy-five miles per hour by jetting seawater out of its rear, and its fangs regrow if they break. You're bold and authentic, with a calm, mischievous edge. You move fast when you've set your sights on something, and nothing can slow you down for long.",
  "Mega Sharpedo": "Mega Sharpedo's yellow markings are scars from a long history of battles, and the moment it charges into an opponent, sharp spikes pop out of its head. You're calm until you've decided where you're going. Bold with a mischievous streak, you transform into an unstoppable force, charging headfirst towards your goals without a flicker of fear.",
  "Wailmer": "Wailmer stores seawater in its body to bounce like a ball, and it loves to shoot water from its blowhole for fun. You're light-hearted and good-natured, with a cool, tireless energy. You bring a playful sense of fun wherever you go, and your enthusiasm is infectious.",
  "Wailord": "Wailord is the largest Pokémon ever discovered, and it swims in pods, jumping out of the water to create massive splashes. You're bold and affectionate, with a tireless spirit. Moody at times, you have a huge presence, and you love to make a big splash with your friends.",
  "Numel": "Numel stores magma at temperatures of over two thousand degrees in its hump, and it's slow-witted but incredibly strong. You're light-hearted and warm, with a larger-than-life presence. Warm-blooded and steady, you carry a lot of passion inside you, and you're much tougher than people realise.",
  "Camerupt": "Camerupt has a volcano inside its body, with magma of eighteen thousand degrees coursing through it, and the humps on its back erupt when it becomes really angry. You're bright and hands-on, with a warm, unhurried nature. You're happiest outdoors, and while you're slow to anger, people learn that your passions run deep and hot.",
  "Mega Camerupt": "Camerupt lives in the craters of volcanoes, and if magma builds up in its body, it shudders, then erupts violently, a pressure Mega Evolution pushes to the limit. You're thoughtful and natural, with classic values. When you transform, your passion erupts into something powerful and impossible to ignore, burning away everything that stands in your way.",
  "Torkoal": "Torkoal burns coal inside its shell to generate energy, and it puffs black smoke from its nostrils when it's in danger. You're hands-on and unhurried, with an everyday, down-to-earth spirit. A little moody, you're a steady source of warmth, and you use your energy to keep yourself and others going.",
  "Spoink": "Spoink bounces constantly on its springy tail, because the bouncing keeps its heart beating, and if it ever stops, it's in serious trouble. You're always on the go. Grounded and city-minded, with an intuitive, sometimes moody side, your relentless energy keeps you springing through life's ups and downs without ever losing your rhythm.",
  "Grumpig": "Grumpig uses the black pearls on its head to amplify its psychic power, and it dances strangely to control its opponents' minds. You're grounded and intuitive, with an everyday, moody side. You have a quiet power, and you know how to use your intuition to steer situations in your favour.",
  "Spinda": "No two Spinda have the same pattern of spots, and its dizzy, tottering steps make it hard for opponents to aim. You're light-hearted and warm, with a guarded, practical side. You're one of a kind, and your unique, unpredictable way of moving through life keeps people guessing.",
  "Trapinch": "Trapinch digs a cone-shaped pit in the sand and waits patiently at the bottom, sometimes for days, until prey slips in. You know patience pays off. Unhurried and light-hearted, you're good-natured company with a bold streak, and you're happy to let the right opportunity come to you rather than chase it.",
  "Vibrava": "Vibrava's wings aren't fully developed, so it can't fly for long, but it vibrates them to create ultrasonic waves that knock out its prey. You're light-hearted and free-spirited, with a hands-on approach. You're always testing your wings, and you know how to make yourself heard.",
  "Flygon": "Flygon's wings create a song-like hum as they beat, and it whips up sandstorms that hide it from view, earning it the name 'the Desert Spirit'. You're seasoned and bright, with a cool, outdoorsy style. You have a mysterious, soaring presence, and people are drawn to the beautiful music of your personality.",
  "Cacnea": "Cacnea lives in the harshest deserts, and the drier and tougher its surroundings, the more beautiful and fragrant the flower it grows. You bloom brightest when things are hard. Bold and grounded, a little moody but deeply outdoorsy, you've learned to thrive in difficult places, and your best moments surprise everyone around you.",
  "Cacturne": "Cacturne stands perfectly still in the desert during the day, then moves at night, following travellers until they're too tired to go on. You're modest and practical, with an unhurried, independent streak. You conserve your energy until the time is right, and then you're incredibly persistent.",
  "Swablu": "Swablu can't stand dirt, so it's always wiping things clean with its fluffy, cotton-like wings, and it loves to perch on people's heads. You make everything around you a bit nicer. Sweet-natured and light-hearted, you love to soar, and your unhurried, caring way of tidying up people's lives makes them feel looked after.",
  "Altaria": "Altaria glides among the clouds on wings like soft cotton, singing in a beautiful soprano voice that soothes anyone who hears it. You've got a gentle, calming presence. Thoughtful and modest, with a practical streak and the occasional moody spell, people find real comfort in your calm, melodic way of being.",
  "Mega Altaria": "If Altaria bonds with a person, it gently envelops them in its soft, cotton-like wings and hums, and its melodic humming is said to make you feel like you're in a dream. You're thoughtful and ambitious, with an everyday, down-to-earth spirit. When you transform, you become a beacon of calm, soothing everyone around you.",
  "Zangoose": "Zangoose has a long-standing feud with Seviper, and its fur bristles with rage whenever it senses one nearby. You're level-headed and bold, with a natural, everyday style. You stand up for what you believe in, and you don't back down when someone's crossed the line.",
  "Seviper": "Seviper sharpens its bladed tail on rocks before battle, and its rivalry with Zangoose has gone on for many generations. You hold on to your convictions. Warm-blooded and edgy, with a moody, thoughtful side, you're always ready to defend what you believe, even if you've forgotten exactly when the argument started.",
  "Lunatone": "Lunatone was discovered at the site of a meteorite crash, and it's said to become active during the full moon, its red eyes glowing. You're thoughtful and intuitive, with a calm, good-natured spirit. Grounded but a little mystical, you seem to be tuned to cycles and rhythms that other people don't notice.",
  "Solrock": "Solrock absorbs sunlight to power itself, and it's said that when it spins, it gives off light and heat like the sun. You're hands-on and grounded, with an intuitive, good-natured warmth. You bring energy and light into every room, and people feel warmer and more motivated just by being near you.",
  "Barboach": "Barboach's body is coated in slime so slippery that it easily wriggles free of anything trying to grab it, and its whiskers sense food in muddy water. You slip through difficult situations effortlessly. Quick, compact and light-hearted, you adapt to whatever comes, and your instincts help you find what you need even when things get murky.",
  "Whiscash": "Whiscash is said to sense earthquakes before they happen, thrashing about wildly in its pond as a warning to anyone nearby. You've got a sixth sense for trouble. Bright and adaptable, you stay cool and calm, and you're always the first to warn the people you care about before things start to shake.",
  "Corphish": "Corphish was originally brought from overseas, but it's so tough that it thrived and took over rivers, eating anything it finds. You're hands-on and grounded, with a warm, steady nature. You can adapt to any environment, and your tough, resilient spirit lets you thrive wherever life takes you.",
  "Crawdaunt": "Crawdaunt has a fiery temper and loves to battle, and it uses its giant pincers to fling opponents out of its territory. You're calm and seasoned, with a warm, authentic heart. You've been through a lot, and you're not afraid to fight for what you want, but you'd rather stay calm and avoid unnecessary drama.",
  "Baltoy": "Baltoy was discovered in ancient ruins, and it spins on one foot to travel, moving like a spinning top. You're grounded and intuitive, with an outdoorsy, moody side. You've got an old soul, and you have a unique way of moving through the world that keeps people guessing.",
  "Claydol": "Claydol is said to have been made from clay by ancient people, and it's believed to have come to life through mysterious rays of light. You're guarded and intuitive, with a grounded, independent spirit. You have an air of ancient wisdom, and people trust your insight and knowledge.",
  "Lileep": "Lileep is an ancient Pokémon that anchored itself to rocks on the seabed, waving its petal-like tentacles to catch passing food. You're thoughtful and down-to-earth, with a big, natural presence. You like to stay rooted in one place, and you have a gentle way of drawing people towards you.",
  "Cradily": "Cradily lived in the shallows of warm, primordial seas, and when the tide went out, it came up onto the beach to search for prey. You're steady and bright, with a tireless, grounded spirit. You know how to ride out the tough times, and you always know exactly when the tide has turned in your favour.",
  "Anorith": "Anorith is an ancient Pokémon that swam through the sea using the eight wings on its sides, and it's thought to be an ancestor of bug Pokémon. You're bold and steady, with a compact, moody side. You've got an ancient, old-fashioned spirit, and you're always pushing forward through life's currents.",
  "Armaldo": "Armaldo was one of the first Pokémon to move from the sea onto land, and its tough armour let it charge through anything without getting hurt. You've weathered big changes. Level-headed and light-hearted, with a moody streak and a love of the outdoors, you're tough enough to take on whatever new terrain life throws at you.",
  "Feebas": "Feebas is so ugly that people ignore it, but it's incredibly hardy and can survive in almost any water. You're quick and youthful, with a light-hearted, grounded spirit. People might overlook you, but you're much more resilient than they realise, and you're quietly working on becoming something amazing.",
  "Milotic": "Milotic is said to be the most beautiful Pokémon in the world, and its graceful appearance can calm anyone who sees it. You're thoughtful and good-natured, with a larger-than-life presence. Down-to-earth and calm, you have a soothing effect on people, and your inner beauty shines through.",
  "Castform": "Castform's appearance changes with the weather, turning sunny, rainy or snowy, and it's thought to have gained this power to protect its tiny body. You read the room and adjust. Light-hearted and down-to-earth, with a good-natured, bold streak, you adapt to your surroundings effortlessly, matching your mood to what the moment needs.",
  "Kecleon": "Kecleon can freely change its body colour to blend in with its surroundings, but the zigzag pattern on its belly never changes. You're sweet-natured and approachable, with a guarded, seasoned side. You know how to blend in, but you never lose the core part of yourself that makes you unique.",
  "Shuppet": "Shuppet feeds on feelings like envy and resentment, and it's said to gather at the eaves of houses at night, waiting for negative emotions. You're cool and unhurried, with a mischievous, moody side. You've got a knack for picking up on the darker undercurrents in a room, and you're not afraid to have a little fun with them.",
  "Banette": "Banette was once a discarded doll, and its grudge against the child who threw it away brought it to life. You're seasoned and authentic, with an unhurried, mischievous side. You don't forget easily when someone hurts you, but you've turned your past into a source of strength and dark humour.",
  "Mega Banette": "When Banette Mega Evolves, its zip opens, unleashing its pent-up curses and turning its body into a force of dark energy. You're seasoned and mischievous, unhurried but transformative. When you finally let go of everything you've been holding inside, you become a force to be reckoned with.",
  "Duskull": "Duskull floats through walls at night, and it's said to come for children who misbehave, following them until morning. You're cool-toned and mischievous, a moody, independent spirit. You like to keep to yourself, but you have a quiet, watchful presence that people find a little bit spooky.",
  "Dusclops": "Dusclops has a hollow body, and it's said that anything that goes inside it will never come back out. You're unhurried and city-minded, with an authentic, youthful side. You have a mysterious presence, and people find themselves drawn into your orbit, unable to look away.",
  "Tropius": "Tropius grows sweet fruits around its neck, and children love to eat them, which is why it's often found in tropical forests. You're outdoorsy and hands-on, a free spirit with an unhurried nature. You love to share your gifts with others, and people know they can always count on you for a treat.",
  "Chimecho": "Chimecho's cries echo around its hollow body, turning into a soft, melodic tune, and it hangs from tree branches and eaves, swaying in the breeze. You have a beautiful, calming way about you. Affectionate and intuitive, with a seasoned, compact style, your gentle presence makes people feel at peace.",
  "Mega Chimecho": "Chimecho's cries can make the air shudder hard enough to knock foes flying, and it converses with others of its kind using seven different tones. You're affectionate and intuitive, with a moody, larger-than-life presence. When you transform, your voice becomes impossible to ignore, filling the air with your passion.",
  "Absol": "Absol appears before natural disasters, and people once blamed it for causing them, but it's actually trying to warn them of the danger. You're often misunderstood. Bright and genuine, you're everyday and hands-on in how you help, and you'll tell people hard truths because you care about keeping them safe.",
  "Mega Absol": "When Absol Mega Evolves, its fur fans out into what look like wings, though it can't fly, and its power to sense disaster grows even sharper. You're bright and grounded, unhurried even in a crisis. When you transform, your instincts become your greatest strength, helping you guide people away from trouble.",
  "Mega Absol Z": "Absol senses coming disasters with its horn and comes down from deep in the mountains to warn people, and in its Mega Absol Z form, that sense feels sharper than ever. You're bright and everyday, with lightning-quick reactions. When you transform, your instincts sharpen so much that you're moving before anyone else realises there's a problem.",
  "Wynaut": "Wynaut gather in groups on moonlit nights, squeezing each other to toughen up and endure counterattacks. You're young at heart, with a compact, affectionate nature. Intuitive and supportive, you love the people in your circle, and you grow stronger every time you stand together with them.",
  "Snorunt": "Snorunt is said to visit homes on snowy nights, and it's believed that a house it visits will prosper for generations. You're approachable and bold, with a thoughtful, good-natured spirit. You bring good luck wherever you go, and people feel lucky to have you around.",
  "Glalie": "Glalie's actual body is a rock that isn't particularly hard, so it absorbs moisture from the air and drapes itself in an armour of ice. You've built a tough exterior over the years. You stay cool and calm, seasoned by experience, but you're completely genuine underneath, and people respect your steady, unshakeable resilience.",
  "Mega Glalie": "When Glalie Mega Evolves, its jaw splits open with such force that it can't close its mouth, and it breathes out freezing air. You're cool, calm and seasoned. When you transform, you can't hold back any more, and you unleash your feelings in a powerful, icy blast that leaves no doubt about what you think.",
  "Spheal": "Spheal rolls across ice floes because it's faster than walking, and it claps its flippers when it's happy. You're bold and grounded, with a cool-toned, modest charm. You've got a cheerful, playful spirit, and you're always finding the quickest, most fun way to get around.",
  "Sealeo": "Sealeo spins things on its nose to learn about their texture and smell, and it plays by spinning Spheal on its nose. You're bold and grounded, with an ambitious, cool-toned spirit. You love to explore new ideas, and you're always testing things out to see how they work.",
  "Walrein": "Walrein's huge tusks can shatter blocks of ice weighing ten tons, and its thick blubber protects it from freezing water. You're classic and thoughtful, with a guarded side. Your quick-burning energy comes out when you need to break through a tough challenge, and your thick skin protects you from life's cold moments.",
  "Clamperl": "Clamperl's tough shell protects it while it grows a single beautiful pearl, which it makes only once in its whole life and which is said to boost psychic power. You keep yourself closed off at first. Grounded and calm, with a moody streak, you're quietly nurturing something precious inside, and the people who wait for it are rewarded.",
  "Huntail": "Huntail lives in the darkest depths of the sea, where it wiggles the tip of its tail, shaped like a small fish, to lure curious prey closer. You know how to draw people in. Bold and affectionate, with a moody, edgy side, your deep, mysterious nature keeps people coming back to find out more.",
  "Gorebyss": "Gorebyss lives deep in the sea, and its pink body becomes more vivid in spring, while its thin mouth sips the fluids of its prey. You've got a graceful, classic beauty. Affectionate, bright and thoughtful, you bring colour and elegance to the world, and there's more strength in your gentle approach than people assume.",
  "Relicanth": "Relicanth has stayed unchanged for a hundred million years, and its rock-hard scales let it survive the crushing pressure of the deep sea. You stay true to yourself while the world changes around you. Compact and adaptable, you keep cool and calm under pressure, and your quiet resilience has a kind of timeless wisdom to it.",
  "Luvdisc": "Luvdisc's heart-shaped body is a symbol of love, and couples who find one are said to be blessed with eternal love. You're quick and light-hearted, with a seasoned, grounded spirit. You bring love and joy wherever you go, and people feel lucky to have found someone like you.",
  "Bagon": "Bagon dreams of flying, and it leaps from cliffs every day, trying to fly, and its head has become as hard as steel from all the crashes. You're young at heart, with a warm-blooded determination. Level-headed and city-minded, you never give up on your dreams, no matter how many times you fall.",
  "Shelgon": "Shelgon's body is covered in a hard shell, and it stays still inside while its cells change, preparing to evolve. You're grounded and independent, with a natural, free-spirited heart. You know that growth takes time, and you're happy to wait patiently until you're ready to spread your wings.",
  "Salamence": "Salamence's longing to fly was so strong that its cells changed to grow wings, and it flies across the sky breathing fire when it's happy. You're bold and quick, with an authentic, everyday spirit. You've achieved your dreams through sheer willpower, and you celebrate every success with enthusiasm.",
  "Mega Salamence": "Mega Salamence tucks its forelegs inside its shell to streamline itself, then flies at high speed over any terrain, slicing through anything in its path without breaking its flight. You're bold and quick, an everyday hero with real power. When you transform, your energy becomes streamlined, and you race towards your goals faster than anyone thought possible.",
  "Beldum": "Beldum uses magnetic force to float, and it communicates with other Beldum by sending out magnetic pulses. You're young at heart and light-hearted, with an intuitive, guarded side. You connect with people in subtle ways, and your quiet, magnetic personality draws the right people towards you.",
  "Metang": "Metang forms when two Beldum fuse together, and its two brains link telepathically, making it far more intelligent than either was on its own. You're at your best in sync with someone. Young at heart and warm-blooded, a little guarded and fond of tech, you and the right partner can work out almost any problem together.",
  "Metagross": "Metagross has four brains that work together like a supercomputer, and it pins its prey down with its huge body. You're independent and steady, grounded with an edgy streak. You think things through from every angle, and once you've made a decision, nothing can move you.",
  "Mega Metagross": "Mega Metagross forms when one Metagross, one Metang and two Beldum link up, and Mega Evolution stimulates its brain until its intellect surpasses anything it had before. You're hands-on and larger than life, with a cool-toned, warm-blooded energy. When you transform, you become incredibly focused, always staying one step ahead.",
  "Regirock": "Regirock was sealed away long ago, and its body is made entirely of rocks, so if it's damaged, it repairs itself by attaching new ones. You're grounded and down-to-earth, with a legendary, guarded spirit. You're incredibly resilient, and you've got a knack for rebuilding yourself after a setback.",
  "Regice": "Regice's body was made during an ice age and can't be melted even by fire, and it cloaks itself in frigid air of minus three hundred and twenty-eight degrees. You're independent and level-headed, with a cool, natural composure. You stay calm no matter how heated things get, and your legendary resilience means nothing melts your resolve.",
  "Registeel": "Registeel's body is made of a mysterious metal that's harder than any known substance, and it's said to have been sealed away by people long ago. You're independent and tech-minded, with an edgy, legendary strength. You're incredibly tough, and nothing anyone says or does can dent your confidence.",
  "Latias": "Latias is highly intelligent and can understand human speech, and it uses its glass-like feathers to refract light and become invisible. You're thoughtful and ambitious, with an authentic, legendary heart. You're perceptive and kind, and you know when to stay hidden and when to reveal your true self.",
  "Mega Latias": "Latias is highly sensitive to people's emotions, and it can communicate with them telepathically and change its appearance using down that refracts light. You're thoughtful and bright, a legendary spirit who loves the city. When you transform, you connect deeply with the people around you, understanding them without words.",
  "Latios": "Latios is highly intelligent and can understand human speech, and it can share what it sees with others through telepathy. You're thoughtful and moody, with an intuitive, legendary mind. You've got a unique way of seeing the world, and you're always willing to share your perspective with the people you trust.",
  "Mega Latios": "Latios will only open its heart to a Trainer with a compassionate spirit, and by folding in its forelegs, it can fly faster than a jet plane. Ambition makes you quicker and sharper. Thoughtful by nature, with a legendary sense of purpose, you transform into someone focused enough to soar past obstacles that once seemed impossible.",
  "Kyogre": "Kyogre is said to have expanded the seas by summoning heavy rain, and it slept in an undersea trench after its legendary clash with Groudon. You're good-natured and genuine, with a larger-than-life, legendary presence. You can make huge waves when you need to, but you'd rather rest peacefully than pick a fight.",
  "Primal Kyogre": "Through Primal Reversion, Kyogre takes back its true form with nature's full power, and it can summon storms that cause the sea levels to rise. You're good-natured and larger than life, with a transformative, legendary power. When you return to your true self, your influence is overwhelming, and the whole world feels the change.",
  "Groudon": "Groudon is said to have raised the continents and expanded the land with its powerful magma, and it's believed to be able to evaporate water. You're ambitious and good-natured, with an authentic, outdoorsy spirit. You're a builder at heart, and you're always working to create something new and lasting.",
  "Primal Groudon": "Through Primal Reversion, Groudon takes back its true form with nature's full power, and it can make magma erupt to expand the landmass of the world. You're ambitious and good-natured, with a transformative, outdoorsy strength. When you show your true power, you change the landscape around you, leaving a legacy that lasts forever.",
  "Rayquaza": "Rayquaza lives in the ozone layer, feeding on water and particles in the atmosphere, and it's said to have calmed Kyogre and Groudon's fight. You're legendary and free-spirited, with an authentic, bold heart. You stay above petty conflicts, but you're always ready to step in and restore peace when things get out of hand.",
  "Mega Rayquaza": "Rayquaza flies forever through the ozone layer, consuming meteoroids for sustenance, and the many meteoroids in its body provide the energy it needs to Mega Evolve. You're legendary and free-spirited, with a quick-burning, transformative spirit. When you change, you become a force of nature, ready to protect the world from any threat.",
  "Jirachi": "Jirachi sleeps for a thousand years, waking for just seven days, and it's said to grant any wish written on the tags on its head. You're bright and practical, with a legendary, tech-minded spirit. You might be hard to find, but when you're around, you make people's dreams feel possible, and you bring a little bit of magic into their lives.",
  "Deoxys": "Deoxys was born from a virus that came to Earth on a meteorite, mutating when it was exposed to a laser beam. You're hands-on and bold, an independent spirit with an authentic heart. You're not afraid to be different, and you've learned to adapt and thrive in a world that wasn't built for you.",
  "Deoxys (Attack Forme)": "In its Attack Forme, Deoxys transforms into its aggressive guise, and it can even fool enemies by altering its appearance. You don't do half-measures. Hands-on, bold and fiercely independent, you transform when you've locked onto a goal, throwing every ounce of energy you have into reaching it.",
  "Deoxys (Defense Forme)": "When Deoxys changes form, an aurora appears, and in its Defense Forme it absorbs attacks by altering its cellular structure. You're quick to protect yourself, with a guarded, hands-on approach. Independent and resilient, you know how to build walls that keep you safe from harm.",
  "Deoxys (Speed Forme)": "Deoxys's body is configured for superior agility and speed, and it's said to appear wherever auroras are seen. You're quick and hands-on, guarded but independent. You know how to stay one step ahead, and you're always ready to dash away from danger or towards new opportunities.",
  "Turtwig": "Turtwig's shell is made of hardened soil, and it photosynthesises through the leaf on its head, which wilts when it's thirsty. You're light-hearted and bright, with a cool-toned, warm-blooded charm. You're happiest when you've got plenty of sunshine and water, and your growth is steady and natural.",
  "Grotle": "Grotle knows where to find pure springs of water, and it carries Pokémon on its back to the spring to drink. You're grounded and thoughtful, with a cool-toned, elusive charm. You quietly help the people around you find what they need, and you're happy to carry them to a better place.",
  "Torterra": "Small Pokémon sometimes gather on Torterra's unmoving back to build their nests, and ancient people imagined that a gigantic Torterra dwelled beneath the ground. You're outdoorsy and hands-on, with an unhurried, down-to-earth spirit. People look to you for stability, and you provide a safe, steady home for everyone around you.",
  "Chimchar": "Chimchar's tail flame is fuelled by gas made in its belly, and even rain can't put it out, though it goes out when it sleeps. You're fiery and light-hearted, with an everyday, moody side. Your enthusiasm is hard to dampen, and you keep your spark alive, no matter what life throws at you.",
  "Monferno": "Monferno skilfully controls the intensity of the fire on its tail to keep its foes at an ideal distance, and the bigger its flame, the higher its rank in its pack. You're modest and unhurried, with an affectionate, natural warmth. You're more powerful than you let on, and your passion only grows as you find what you love.",
  "Infernape": "Infernape's crown of fire reflects its fiery nature, and it uses unique fighting styles, dancing around its opponents with incredible speed. You're grounded and edgy, an everyday hero with a fiery spirit. You're always moving, and you take on challenges with a unique, passionate style.",
  "Piplup": "Piplup is so proud that it refuses food from people, and because it isn't good at walking yet, it often trips over while strutting about. You've got real self-respect. Young at heart and bold, you stay level-headed and grounded, and you'd rather do things your own way, even if it means stumbling a few times along the road.",
  "Prinplup": "Prinplup lives alone, away from others, because it's so proud that it believes it's the most important Pokémon, and it can break trees with its wings. You're cool-headed and authentic, with a calm, independent confidence. You know your own worth, and you're happy to forge your own path, even if it means being on your own.",
  "Empoleon": "The three horns on Empoleon's head represent its strength, and the leader of a colony always has the largest horns. You're level-headed and practical, with a moody, down-to-earth side. People naturally look to you for leadership, and you carry your responsibilities with pride and dignity.",
  "Starly": "Starly gather in huge flocks, and though each one is tiny, they beat their wings with surprising power and chirp loudly enough to be heard from far off. You thrive in a crowd. Bold and warm, unhurried but always ready to take off, your friendly chatter brings people together and creates a sense of community wherever you go.",
  "Staravia": "Staravia live in forests and fields in large flocks, and they're fiercely territorial, clashing noisily with rival flocks over the best feeding grounds. You're loyal to your crew. Sweet-natured and bright, with a warm, soaring spirit, you'll always stand up for the people and places you care about most.",
  "Staraptor": "Staraptor leaves its flock once it evolves, choosing to live alone, and it's so tough that it won't back down even when it's hurt. You're bold and city-minded, with a moody, warm-toned edge. You're independent and resilient, and you have the courage to face challenges on your own.",
  "Mega Staraptor": "Staraptor never stops attacking, even when it's injured, and it courageously challenges foes much larger than itself, a savage streak Mega Evolution only sharpens. You're city-minded and natural, with a guarded side. When you transform, your inner determination becomes visible, and you show everyone just how tough you really are.",
  "Bidoof": "Bidoof gnaws on trees and rocks to keep its front teeth from growing too long, and it's so calm that nothing seems to bother it. You're grounded and approachable, with an affectionate, sweet-natured heart. You take everything in your stride, and your easygoing, unflappable nature makes people feel relaxed around you.",
  "Bibarel": "Bibarel makes its nest by damming streams with bark and mud, and a river it has dammed will never overflow its banks, which the people living nearby really appreciate. You're a natural builder. Seasoned and sweet-natured, you stay cool and calm under pressure, and you love creating safe, comfortable spaces for the people you care about.",
  "Kricketot": "Kricketot shakes its head back and forth to make its antennae hit each other, creating a sound like a xylophone. You're guarded and thoughtful, with a warm, down-to-earth charm. You love to express yourself through creativity, and you have a unique way of making music in your own life.",
  "Kricketune": "Kricketune plays melodies using its arms like a violin, and it's said that its songs can communicate its feelings. You're down-to-earth and natural, with a good-natured, classic charm. You express your emotions through art and creativity, and your heartfelt melodies resonate with everyone who hears them.",
  "Shinx": "Shinx's fur glows with electricity when it's in danger, and it uses the bright light to blind its enemies before running away. You're modest and edgy, a city-minded spirit with a love of tech. You might be small, but you know how to protect yourself, and you're always ready to light up the room.",
  "Luxio": "Strong electricity runs through the tips of Luxio's sharp claws, so even the lightest scratch is enough to make an opponent faint. You're more powerful than you look. A little edgy and elusive, yet thoroughly good-natured, you love tech and quiet competence, and people quickly learn to respect your understated strength.",
  "Luxray": "Luxray's eyes can see through solid walls, letting it spot prey hiding behind objects, and its gaze gleams gold when it's found something. You see straight through to the truth. City-minded and down-to-earth, with a love of tech and a bold streak, you're never fooled by appearances, and you always find what's hidden.",
  "Budew": "Budew's bud is said to bloom when it's exposed to warm, sunny weather, and its pollen can cause sneezing fits if you get too close. You're bright and outdoorsy, a little guarded until you feel the warmth of friendship. Down-to-earth and gentle, you blossom when you're surrounded by people who care about you.",
  "Roserade": "Roserade moves with a dancer's grace, but the bouquets in its hands hide whips lined with poisonous thorns. You've got an elegant charm with real protection built in. Quick-witted and thoughtful, with a natural, practical style, you move through the world gracefully, but nobody who crosses you forgets the thorns.",
  "Cranidos": "Cranidos lived in jungles around a hundred million years ago, and its iron-hard skull lets it headbutt trees until they fall. You're young at heart and affectionate, with a level-headed, down-to-earth spirit. You're incredibly determined, and you'll keep pushing until you break through any obstacle in your way.",
  "Rampardos": "Rampardos's skull is as hard as iron, and in prehistoric jungles it charged straight through trees that stood in its way, never stopping to overthink. You meet problems head-on. Level-headed and bright, with warm-blooded, down-to-earth instincts, you'd rather tackle a challenge directly than circle it for days, and you're tougher than almost anyone you know.",
  "Shieldon": "Shieldon's face is shaped like a shield, protecting it from attacks, and it lived in jungles around a hundred million years ago. You're outdoorsy and affectionate, with an elusive, tech-minded side. You're happy to protect the people around you, standing in front of them to shield them from harm.",
  "Bastiodon": "Bastiodon line up side by side to form an impenetrable wall, protecting their young from attackers with their huge, shield-like faces. You're the protector your loved ones can rely on. Unhurried and outdoorsy, a little moody and fiercely guarded, you'll stand firm in front of the people you love, no matter what comes at them.",
  "Burmy": "Burmy covers itself with a cloak made from whatever is nearby, whether that's leaves, sand or even scraps of building materials, to protect itself from the cold. You make yourself at home wherever you are. Affectionate and bright, you're compact and unhurried, building a cosy little shelter from whatever life hands you.",
  "Wormadam": "Wormadam's cloak becomes a permanent part of its body when it evolves, so it's forever shaped by where it grew up. You carry your origins with you. Practical and good-natured, compact in your habits and seasoned by experience, you've turned the place that raised you into a lasting, protective part of who you are.",
  "Mothim": "Mothim loves floral honey but won't gather any itself, so instead of keeping a nest, it flies over fields and mountains plotting to steal honey from Combee. You're a bold free spirit with a seasoned, hands-on approach. You're not afraid to take shortcuts when they're there, and you've got a knack for finding the sweetest things in life.",
  "Combee": "Combee are born as a trio, and they spend their lives gathering honey to bring back to their queen, Vespiquen. You're guarded and quick, a free spirit with a grounded sense of duty. You work hard for the people you care about, and you love being part of a close-knit team.",
  "Vespiquen": "Vespiquen's abdomen is a honeycomb where its young grow, and it releases pheromones to command its loyal Combee, who'll defend it with their lives. You're a natural leader with a bright, soaring spirit. Guarded yet free-spirited, you inspire deep loyalty, and you look after your community with fierce dedication.",
  "Pachirisu": "Pachirisu stores electricity in its cheek pouches and shares it with friends by rubbing cheeks, and it hides berries in secret stashes for later. You look after your people. City-minded and down-to-earth, with a love of tech and a guarded streak, you always have something tucked away to share with the ones you trust.",
  "Buizel": "Buizel inflates the flotation sac around its neck to keep its head above water, and it spins its two tails like a propeller to swim fast. You're approachable and level-headed, with an edgy, city-minded energy. You keep your head above water no matter what, and you power through life with real momentum.",
  "Floatzel": "Floatzel's well-developed flotation sac lets it assist in the rescue of drowning people, and it's a common sight around fishing ports, carrying people on its back like a raft. You're thoughtful and moody, but cool and calm in a crisis. When someone's in trouble, you're the first to dive in, and people trust you to keep them afloat.",
  "Cherubi": "Cherubi's small ball is full of nutrients, and it's said to taste sweet, so birds love to peck at it. You're bold and light-hearted, with an unhurried, ambitious spirit. You've got a sweet, generous nature, and you're always sharing your energy to help others grow.",
  "Cherrim": "Cherrim closes its petals to protect itself in bad weather, but when the sun comes out, it opens up to reveal a cheerful face. You're unhurried and good-natured, with a moody, edgy side. You might keep to yourself when things are tough, but your warm, joyful spirit always shines through when the time is right.",
  "Shellos": "Shellos changes its colour and shape depending on where it lives, so the ones on the east and west sides of the same sea look completely different. You're shaped by the places you love. Good-natured and adaptable, you stay cool and calm, and you're always quietly in tune with the world around you, wherever you've washed up.",
  "Gastrodon": "Gastrodon's soft body squeezes out a purple fluid when it's grabbed, and like Shellos, its look depends entirely on which sea it lives beside. You adapt to your environment, but you keep your own colour. Cool and calm with a moody streak, you're happy to go with the flow, but people learn not to squeeze you too hard.",
  "Ambipom": "Ambipom's two tails are so dexterous that it rarely uses its arms anymore, and groups of them link tails to show friendship. You're level-headed and sweet-natured, with a guarded, moody side. You have a creative way of doing things, and you show your affection by linking yourself to the people you love.",
  "Drifloon": "Drifloon is formed from the spirits of people and Pokémon, and it's said that children who hold its string are carried away to the afterlife. You're approachable and light-hearted, with an edgy, mischievous charm. You love to float through life, and you have a playful, slightly spooky way of making friends.",
  "Drifblim": "Drifblim drifts silently on the wind at dusk, and it's said to carry people and Pokémon away, never to be seen again. You're bold and light-hearted, with a modest, mischievous streak. You love to drift off on adventures, and your mysterious, carefree spirit leaves people wondering where you'll go next.",
  "Buneary": "Buneary keeps its long ears rolled up, then slams foes by sharply uncoiling them, and the strike stings enough to make a grown-up cry in pain. You've got more punch than people expect. Level-headed and independent, you love the buzz of the city, and though you have moody days, you can spring into action the moment it's needed.",
  "Lopunny": "Lopunny's fluffy ear fur is incredibly soft, and it's extremely cautious, fleeing at the slightest hint of danger. You're warm-hearted and genuine, with a city-minded sense of style. You keep a careful eye out for trouble, but the people who earn your trust find you to be one of the most affectionate friends they'll ever have.",
  "Mega Lopunny": "Mega Evolution awakens Lopunny's combative instincts, so it sheds any fur that gets in the way of its attacks and strikes its enemies by swinging its ears like whips. You're warm and affectionate, a city-minded spirit with hidden strength. When you transform, your gentle exterior gives way to a fierce, protective energy that surprises everyone.",
  "Mismagius": "Mismagius chants incantations that sound like spells, and they can cause terrible headaches or bring good luck, depending on its mood. You're bold and seasoned, with a cool, mischievous charm. You have a mysterious, captivating presence, and people are never quite sure whether you're going to bring them luck or trouble.",
  "Honchkrow": "Honchkrow is a nocturnal Pokémon that commands groups of Murkrow, and it's said to never forgive a mistake made by its followers. You're grounded and natural, with a classic, soaring confidence. You have a natural authority, and people respect your high standards and commanding presence.",
  "Glameow": "Glameow purrs sweetly when it's happy, but if it gets angry, it scratches with its sharp claws. You're sweet-natured and light-hearted, with a larger-than-life presence. You're approachable and charming, but people know not to cross you, because you can show your claws when you need to.",
  "Purugly": "Purugly binds its waist with its forked tail to look bigger, and it's known to barge into other Pokémon's nests and make itself at home. You've got a big, bold presence and classic tastes. Quick on your feet and sweet underneath, you're never shy about claiming your space, and somehow people end up glad you did.",
  "Chingling": "Chingling has an orb in its throat that rattles and rings as it hops around, and it emits a high-pitched cry to stun its enemies. You're young at heart and light-hearted, with an intuitive, level-headed side. You bring a cheerful sound to every room, and you know just how to make your voice heard when it counts.",
  "Stunky": "Stunky defends itself by spraying a foul-smelling fluid from its rear, and the awful stench can linger for a whole day. You've got strong defences. Approachable with an edgy, moody streak and very natural tastes, you're easy to like, but people learn quickly that you're not someone to mess with.",
  "Skuntank": "Skuntank's spray can reach a hundred and sixty feet, and its stench gets worse the longer it's left to fester. You're unhurried and mischievous, with a classic, moody streak. You don't let things go easily, and people know that if they cross you, the consequences will stick around.",
  "Bronzor": "Bronzor has been found in ancient tombs, and people once believed the patterns on its back held mysterious powers, though nobody knows what they mean. You have a quiet, old-fashioned wisdom. Unhurried and grounded, you're good-natured and warm-blooded underneath, and people trust your steady presence long before they understand you.",
  "Bronzong": "Bronzong was once revered as a bringer of rain that made crops grow, and when it's angered, it lets out a warning cry that rings out like the tolling of a bell. You're modest and unhurried, with an intuitive, tech-minded mind. You have an ancient, otherworldly wisdom, and people seek you out for your calm, insightful advice.",
  "Bonsly": "Bonsly lives in dry places and cries constantly to get rid of excess moisture, which is why it always looks like it's crying. You're outdoorsy and hands-on, with an approachable, warm-toned charm. You wear your emotions openly, and you're happy to let people see how you feel.",
  "Mime Jr.": "Mime Jr. copies the movements of anyone it sees, and it uses this mimicry to confuse its opponents and slip away from danger. You learn by watching. Bright and intuitive, a little guarded, with a natural, easy style, you pick up new skills remarkably quickly simply by paying close attention to the people around you.",
  "Happiny": "Happiny carries a round white stone in its belly pouch, looking after it like an egg, and it sometimes gives it away to people it really likes. You show love through small, precious gestures. Bright and approachable, with a compact, affectionate charm, you're always happy to share the things that matter most to you.",
  "Chatot": "Chatot can mimic human speech, and when a flock gathers together, they all end up learning and repeating the same phrase. You're a born chatterbox. Good-natured and sweet, an everyday free spirit, your friendly, talkative nature makes it easy for you to connect with anyone and pick up their way of speaking.",
  "Spiritomb": "Spiritomb is made up of 108 spirits bound to a keystone, and it was sealed away as punishment for its wicked deeds five hundred years ago. You're unhurried and natural, with a warm-blooded, moody side. You've got a complex, mysterious personality, and people find themselves drawn to your many layers.",
  "Gible": "Gible reacts to anything that moves by flying right at it and biting, and though it sometimes injures itself in the process, it doesn't care too much. You're fearless and full of enthusiasm. Hands-on and city-minded, with an elusive, free-spirited energy, you throw yourself at challenges that would make others hesitate, and you usually come out grinning.",
  "Gabite": "Gabite collects shiny gems and stores them in its nest, and its shed scales are said to be used in medicine. You're young at heart and affectionate, with a level-headed, free-spirited outlook. You love to collect the things that make you happy, and you have a knack for helping the people around you feel better.",
  "Garchomp": "Garchomp can fly as fast as a jet plane, folding its wings back to cut through the air, and it never lets its prey escape. You're bright and level-headed, a free spirit with an authentic heart. When you set your sights on something, you pursue it with incredible speed and focus, and nothing can get away from you.",
  "Mega Garchomp": "When Garchomp Mega Evolves, its arms become huge, scythe-like blades, and its fierce instincts make it even more aggressive. You're bright and level-headed, a free spirit with a transformative edge. When you change, you become sharp and powerful, cutting through any problem that stands in your way.",
  "Mega Garchomp Z": "Garchomp is fast both underground and in the sky, quick enough to bring down prey and return to its den before its body has chilled, and Mega Garchomp Z hones that speed further still. You're ambitious and level-headed, with a practical approach. When you transform, you refine your strengths, becoming a sharper, faster and more focused version of yourself.",
  "Munchlax": "Munchlax hides food under its long fur, and it's said to eat its own body weight in food every day. You're approachable and sweet-natured, with a grounded, guarded side. You love the simple pleasures in life, and you've always got a little treat tucked away for when you need it.",
  "Riolu": "Riolu can sense the aura of other living things, and it uses this ability to read people's emotions. You're fiery and grounded, with a cool-toned, moody side. You're incredibly perceptive, and you have a knack for understanding what people are feeling, even if they don't say it out loud.",
  "Lucario": "Lucario can read people's thoughts and feelings by sensing their aura, and it's said to understand human speech. You're modest and unhurried, with an affectionate, tech-minded side. You have a deep, intuitive understanding of the people around you, and you use your insight to help them feel seen and supported.",
  "Mega Lucario": "When Lucario Mega Evolves, its aura becomes so powerful that it shows as black markings on its body, and its fighting spirit becomes fierce. You're affectionate and bold, with a fiery, unhurried spirit. When you transform, your feelings for the people you care about turn into incredible strength.",
  "Mega Lucario Z": "Lucario readies itself to face its enemies by focusing its mental energies, and in its Mega Lucario Z form, its aura expands further than ever. You're affectionate and bold, quick to act when it counts. When you transform, your deep feelings for others erupt into fiery action, and you move faster than anyone can follow.",
  "Hippopotas": "Hippopotas coats its body in sand to protect itself from germs, and it hates getting wet, so it lives in dry, dusty places. You know how to look after yourself. Grounded and thoughtful, with a warm, bold side, you're happiest in a comfortable space that's truly your own, and you guard it with surprising determination.",
  "Hippowdon": "Hippowdon blasts sand from the pores all over its body, whipping up sandstorms, and it opens its enormous mouth wide to intimidate rivals. You've got a big, dramatic presence. Hands-on and unhurried, with an edgy, light-hearted sense of humour, you know exactly how to make an impression when you want one.",
  "Skorupi": "Skorupi grips prey with the strong pincers on its tail, injecting poison and hanging on for days without ever loosening its hold. Once you've decided you want something, you hold on tight. Quick and warm-blooded, with a larger-than-life, mischievous energy, you're remarkably persistent, and people underestimate that at their peril.",
  "Drapion": "Drapion has the power in its clawed arms to make scrap of a car, and its head can rotate a hundred and eighty degrees, eliminating any blind spots. You've got an everyday toughness with a mischievous edge. Cool and guarded, you keep an eye on everything going on around you, and people know not to underestimate your strength.",
  "Croagunk": "Croagunk inflates the poison sacs on its cheeks to make an eerie croaking sound, and its knuckles are coated in toxins. You're approachable and bold, with a thoughtful, mischievous side. You've got a quirky, unpredictable charm, and you're always ready with a cheeky jab when people least expect it.",
  "Toxicroak": "Toxicroak's knuckle claws secrete a toxin so potent that even a scratch could be fatal, and its croaks echo from its cheek sacs. You're bold and affectionate, an everyday city-dweller with a sharp edge. You're warm with your friends, but you can be fiercely protective, and people learn not to cross you.",
  "Carnivine": "Carnivine attaches itself to trees in swamps, luring prey with its sweet-smelling saliva and swallowing them whole. You're light-hearted and grounded, with an unhurried, adaptable nature. You're happy to wait patiently for what you want, and you've got a sweet charm that draws people in.",
  "Finneon": "Finneon lures prey with the patterns on its tail fins, which softly shine at night, but when it leaps from the sea, Wingull swoop down to grab it on the fly. You're young at heart and natural, with an edgy, grounded side. You love to shine, and your vibrant personality is hard to miss, even if it occasionally attracts unwanted attention.",
  "Lumineon": "Lumineon lives deep in the sea, where its fins shine brightly to attract prey, and it crawls along the seabed with its four fins. You're calm and guarded, with a quick-burning, moody side. You shine in the dark, and your bright, beautiful presence makes you stand out, even in the deepest depths.",
  "Mantyke": "Mantyke swims along with schools of Remoraid, and when attackers come, they all fight together to drive them off. You're young at heart, with a practical, classic outlook. A little guarded, you're happiest when you're part of a close team, and you know that you're stronger together than apart.",
  "Snover": "Snover lives on snowy mountains, and in spring, berries grow around its belly, attracting hungry Pokémon from all around. You're bold and good-natured, with a cool-toned, youthful charm. You've got a generous spirit, and people are drawn to the warmth you share, even in the coldest seasons.",
  "Abomasnow": "Abomasnow creates blizzards to hide itself, and it's called 'the Ice Monster' by people living in snowy mountains. You're larger than life, with a bright, classic charm. Despite your big presence, you're modest at heart, and you prefer to keep yourself hidden until you're ready to show who you really are.",
  "Mega Abomasnow": "A single shake of Abomasnow's massive body is enough to cause whiteout conditions, and it's powerful enough to split huge boulders with ease. You're bright and ambitious, with an edgy, natural style. When you transform, your power becomes undeniable, and you can make a huge impact on the world around you.",
  "Weavile": "Weavile is a crafty hunter that lives in snowy places, and it carves symbols into trees and ice to communicate with its group. You're seasoned and quick, with a mischievous, city-minded edge. You've got a sharp, strategic mind, and you're always one step ahead of everyone else.",
  "Magnezone": "Magnezone's unique magnetism allows it to sense radio waves, and it's believed that it came from another planet. You're affectionate and grounded, an everyday hero with a guarded side. You've got a unique way of seeing the world, and you're always picking up on things that others miss.",
  "Lickilicky": "Lickilicky's tongue can stretch to grab anything nearby, and its saliva contains a substance that numbs whatever it licks. You've got a big, independent appetite for life. Bright and ambitious, you stay grounded, and you reach out and grab the opportunities others leave sitting on the table, savouring every single one.",
  "Rhyperior": "Rhyperior can fire rocks from its palms like cannonballs, and its armour is tough enough to withstand the heat of a volcano. You've been tempered by experience. Unhurried with a moody, edgy streak, you're incredibly hard to rattle, and when you finally push back, you do it with real force.",
  "Tangrowth": "Tangrowth's arms are bundles of vines that grow back right away if they're cut, so even losing one to a predator doesn't trouble it. Nothing keeps you cut back for long. Level-headed and down-to-earth, with a moody, edgy side, you bounce back from setbacks with even more strength, reaching further every time life cuts you back.",
  "Electivire": "Electivire pushes the tips of its two tails against its opponent and unleashes over twenty thousand volts of electricity. You're genuine and grounded, a city-minded spirit who loves tech. You've got enormous energy, and when you decide to put your power into something, the results are electrifying.",
  "Magmortar": "Magmortar fires fireballs of over three thousand degrees from the tips of its arms, and its body is surrounded by heat haze. You're modest but fiery, with a down-to-earth, natural style. You don't brag about your talents, but when you let your passion out, it burns brighter than anyone expected.",
  "Togekiss": "Togekiss is said to appear only where people respect each other and live in peace, sharing many blessings with them. You're thoughtful and bright, an everyday, city-minded spirit. You bring good things to the people around you, and you're happiest in places where everyone gets along and looks after one another.",
  "Yanmega": "Yanmega can carry an adult on its back as it flies, and the rapid beating of its four wings creates shockwaves powerful enough to damage its surroundings. You're thoughtful and practical, with a moody, genuine depth. You carry more than people realise, and your quiet strength has a way of making waves wherever you go.",
  "Leafeon": "Leafeon photosynthesises like a plant, so it's always surrounded by clean, fresh air, and it prefers to spend its days napping in the sun. You're light-hearted and good-natured, understated but quietly refreshing to be around. You've got an edgy side, but most people just feel calmer and happier after spending time with you.",
  "Glaceon": "Glaceon can control its body temperature to freeze its fur into sharp ice needles, and it creates diamond dust by freezing the moisture in the air. You're grounded and thoughtful, guarded with a cool, edgy style. You keep your defences sharp, but you can also create something beautiful when you let your guard down.",
  "Gliscor": "Gliscor observes prey while hanging upside down from branches, then swoops in soundless flight to carry it off with its long tail. You're seasoned and outdoorsy, with a guarded, moody side. You see things from a unique perspective, and you know exactly when to swoop in and make your move.",
  "Mamoswine": "Mamoswine has been around since the last Ice Age, and its thick fur and huge icy tusks let it survive in the most freezing conditions. You're a timeless, resilient spirit. Hands-on and quick when action's needed, you stay cool and calm under pressure, and you handle whatever life throws at you without breaking a sweat.",
  "Porygon-Z": "Porygon-Z was given extra programming to help it travel through other dimensions, but something went wrong and it started acting strangely. You're grounded and sweet-natured, an everyday spirit with an authentic glitch or two. You march to the beat of your own drum, and people love your quirky, unpredictable personality.",
  "Gallade": "Gallade extends the blades on its elbows to fight, and it's a gallant Pokémon that protects others with honour, never fighting the weak. You're city-minded and intuitive, with a cool-toned, warm-blooded sense of justice. You stand up for what's right, and you use your strength to protect people who can't protect themselves.",
  "Mega Gallade": "Gallade can sense what its foe is thinking, so its attacks burst out first, fast and fierce, and Mega Evolution sharpens that instinct even further. You're seasoned and good-natured, with a natural, intuitive edge. When you transform, your sense of honour sharpens, and you become a true protector, always one step ahead.",
  "Probopass": "Probopass controls three small units called Mini-Noses using magnetism, and its huge moustache is made of magnetic iron. You're thoughtful and larger than life, with a guarded, tech-minded side. You've got a quirky, unique style, and you're happiest when you're surrounded by your little team.",
  "Dusknoir": "Dusknoir is said to receive messages from the spirit world through the antenna on its head, and it guides lost souls to the afterlife. You're unhurried and seasoned, a genuine, city-minded spirit. You have a calm, steadying presence, and you're the person people turn to when they need guidance through difficult transitions.",
  "Froslass": "Froslass is said to be the spirit of a woman lost on a snowy mountain, and it breathes air cold enough to freeze anything solid. You have a chilly, elegant beauty. Bright and practical, you stay cool and calm whatever is going on, and people are fascinated by your mysterious, slightly otherworldly charm.",
  "Mega Froslass": "Froslass brings the things it freezes back to its den and lines them up neatly as decorations, and Mega Evolution makes that icy elegance even more striking. Your elegance deepens when you change. Affectionate and light-hearted, an everyday spirit with a guarded side, you transform into someone so graceful it takes people's breath away.",
  "Rotom": "Rotom's body is made of plasma, and it loves to slip inside electrical appliances and cause harmless mischief. You're bold and light-hearted, with a thoughtful streak and a love of busy cities. You've got a curious, playful energy, and you're always poking your nose into new gadgets, ideas and adventures just to see what happens.",
  "Fan Rotom": "Fan Rotom possesses an electric fan, and it loves to whip up strong gusts that send things flying, giggling all the while. You keep things breezy. Good-natured and light-hearted, with a cool style and a love of tech, you have a talent for blowing away tension and leaving everyone feeling refreshed.",
  "Frost Rotom": "Frost Rotom has entered a refrigerator, and it leaps around gleefully after using cold air to freeze everything nearby, even turning a freshly filled bath to solid ice. You're cooler than people expect. Thoughtful and a little guarded, you keep a composed exterior, but there's a gleeful prankster underneath who loves catching your friends off guard.",
  "Heat Rotom": "Heat Rotom inhabits a microwave oven, and it can heat things to scorching temperatures in an instant. You warm people up quickly once you let them in. Thoughtful and a little guarded, with warm tastes and a warm-blooded heart, you're the friend who turns a cold evening into something cosy.",
  "Mow Rotom": "Mow Rotom takes over a lawnmower, mows down grass and flowers alike, then swaggers around with pride at its accomplishments. You take real pride in getting things done. Thoughtful and a little guarded, warm-blooded with a cool sense of style, you love seeing the results of your work, and you're never shy about enjoying a job well finished.",
  "Wash Rotom": "Wash Rotom has entered a washing machine, and it nods with satisfaction after flooding the whole area around it with water. You've got a playful streak that surprises people. Thoughtful and a little guarded, you stay cool and calm most of the time, but once you're comfortable with someone, your mischievous sense of fun comes pouring out.",
  "Uxie": "Uxie is known as 'the Being of Knowledge', and legend says anyone who meets its gaze will have their memory wiped. You're bright and intuitive, with a guarded, light-hearted side. You keep your eyes closed to most of the world, but you know far more than you let on, and your knowledge runs deep.",
  "Mesprit": "Mesprit is known as 'the Being of Emotion', and it's said to have taught people the joys and sorrows of life. You feel things deeply. Bright and intuitive, light-hearted on the surface but guarded with your heart, you understand what others are feeling, and you help them make sense of it all.",
  "Azelf": "Azelf is known as 'the Being of Willpower', and it's said to have given people the determination to take on new challenges. You're full of drive. Light-hearted and good-natured, with an ambitious, legendary spirit, you inspire everyone around you to push forward and believe in themselves.",
  "Dialga": "Dialga is said to have the power to control time, and its heart is believed to make time flow forward. You're bright and genuine, with a legendary, tech-minded sense of purpose. You have a strong grasp of how things fit together, and you have a knack for keeping everything moving in the right direction.",
  "Dialga (Origin Forme)": "Radiant light caused Dialga to take on its Origin Forme, which bears a striking resemblance to the creator Pokémon and lets it wield truly colossal strength. You're bright and tech-minded, with a legendary, transformative power. When you return to your true self, you become an even more powerful, timeless version of who you are.",
  "Palkia": "Palkia is said to be able to distort space itself, and it's believed to live in a parallel dimension. You're ambitious and practical, with an authentic, down-to-earth heart. You have a big vision for the world, and you're always finding ways to make room for new possibilities.",
  "Palkia (Origin Forme)": "In its Origin Forme, Palkia soars across the sky in a shape that greatly resembles the creator of all things. You're a free spirit with big ambitions. Light-hearted on the surface, you transform into someone expansive when you're in your element, opening up new space for everyone around you.",
  "Heatran": "Heatran dwells in volcanic caves, and its body is made of rugged steel that's partially melted in spots because of its own heat. You've got a moody, thoughtful intensity. Genuine and legendary in your own way, you're constantly reforging yourself under pressure, coming out stronger every time the heat rises.",
  "Mega Heatran": "Boiling blood like magma circulates through Heatran's body, and its molten-steel form is said to have been birthed from the magma within Mount Coronet. You're moody and thoughtful, with a legendary depth. When you transform, the passion you've held inside finally pours out, reshaping everything it touches.",
  "Regigigas": "Regigigas is said to have towed the continents into place with ropes, and it created the other Regi Pokémon from clay, ice and magma. You're ambitious and good-natured, a big-hearted builder who loves the city. You've got a sweet, generous spirit, and you're always creating things that bring people together.",
  "Giratina": "Giratina was banished to the Distortion World for its violence, and it's said to watch silently over the ordinary world from the other side. You're moody and genuine, down-to-earth despite your legendary depth. You've known what it's like to be an outsider, and that's given you a quiet, steady perspective.",
  "Giratina (Origin Forme)": "Giratina loses its legs when it changes into its Origin Forme, and it's thought to hail from a world where the heavens and the earth are as one. You're down-to-earth but moody, with a legendary presence. When you're somewhere you truly belong, you transform into your most powerful, unfiltered self.",
  "Cresselia": "Cresselia is said to bring sweet dreams, and those who sleep holding one of its feathers are protected from nightmares. You're the comforting presence people reach for. Bright and affectionate, down-to-earth despite your legendary glow, you make the people you love feel safe enough to rest properly.",
  "Phione": "Phione drifts through warm seas, and it always returns to the place where it was born, however far it's wandered. You're modest and practical, with a moody side and a deep sense of home. Wherever life carries you, you never forget your roots, and you always find your way back to them.",
  "Manaphy": "Manaphy is born on a cold seafloor and will swim great distances to return to its birthplace, and it's born with a wondrous power that lets it bond with any kind of Pokémon. You're ambitious and practical, with a moody, legendary depth. You connect with people instantly, and your journey always circles back to the places and people you love.",
  "Darkrai": "Darkrai can lull people into a deep sleep and give them terrible nightmares, though it's said to do this to protect its territory rather than out of cruelty. You're independent and genuine, with a mischievous, legendary edge. People sometimes misunderstand you, but your intentions are more protective than they realise.",
  "Mega Darkrai": "Darkrai is active on nights of the new moon, and folklore says that on moonless nights it makes people see horrific nightmares. You're independent and moody, with a legendary presence. When you transform, your mystery deepens, and people feel your influence even when you've slipped out of sight.",
  "Shaymin": "Shaymin is said to be able to dissolve toxins in the air, instantly turning ravaged land into a field of flowers. You're hands-on and quick, with a legendary love of the outdoors. You have a remarkable ability to heal and renew the places and people around you, leaving them greener and brighter than before.",
  "Arceus": "Arceus is said to have emerged from an egg in a place of nothing and shaped the universe with its thousand arms. You're bright and sweet-natured, with a natural, legendary grace. You carry a quiet sense of creation, and you love building something meaningful out of nothing for the people around you.",
  "Victini": "Victini is said to bring victory to anyone it shares its infinite energy with, and it creates endless energy inside its body. You're bright and fiery, grounded with real intuition. You're the friend who makes people believe they can win, and your boundless enthusiasm gives everyone around you a boost.",
  "Snivy": "Snivy soaks up sunlight through its tail to boost its speed, and its tail droops when it's feeling unwell. You're level-headed and affectionate, happiest outdoors. A little guarded until you trust someone, you draw energy from the good things around you, and people can tell straight away when something's wrong.",
  "Servine": "Servine hides in thick foliage to dodge attacks, then strikes back with whip-like vines from the shadows. You're affectionate and light-hearted, with a modest, outdoorsy charm. You don't need to be the centre of attention, but people learn that you're far more capable than your quiet nature suggests.",
  "Serperior": "Serperior can stop opponents in their tracks with a single glare, and it only uses its full power against those it respects. You're warm-blooded and affectionate, an everyday spirit who loves the outdoors. You save your best for the people who deserve it, and your quiet dignity commands respect.",
  "Tepig": "Tepig blows fireballs out of its snout, and when it has a cold, it breathes out black smoke instead. You're light-hearted and good-natured, with a compact, edgy charm. You've got a lively, fiery spirit, and even on your off days, you're still unmistakably full of personality.",
  "Pignite": "Whenever Pignite's fire burns more intensely, its movements get faster and sharper, and it eats a lot to keep that inner fire stoked. You're young at heart and bold, with a bright, fiery energy. The more fired up you get, the quicker you move, and your enthusiasm is impossible to dampen once it's lit.",
  "Emboar": "Emboar has a fiery beard and a strong sense of loyalty, and it's said to be deeply devoted to its friends, using its powerful fists to protect them. You're seasoned and bold, with a bright, fiery heart. You're a loyal friend, and you'll stand up for the people you care about with all your strength.",
  "Mega Emboar": "When Emboar Mega Evolves, its fiery beard blazes even brighter, and its devotion to its friends fuels an even greater strength. You're bright and good-natured, with a fiery, transformative spirit. When you change, your loyalty becomes a powerful, unstoppable force that burns away anything threatening the people you love.",
  "Oshawott": "Oshawott fights using the scalchop on its belly, which it can also use as a blade to cut through hard berries. You're young at heart and practical, with a level-headed, light-hearted charm. You've always got a handy tool for the job, and you're ready to cut straight through any problem.",
  "Dewott": "Dewott trains hard every day to master its swordsmanship, and each one has its own unique fighting style. You're compact and practical, with a moody, elusive side. You've developed your own unique way of doing things, and your dedication to your craft is genuinely impressive.",
  "Samurott": "Samurott can strike down its opponents with a single slash from the sword in its armour, and its glare alone can silence enemies. You're classic and thoughtful, with a quick-burning, bold intensity. You don't need to raise your voice to command respect, and when you act, you do it decisively.",
  "Hisuian Samurott": "Hard of heart and deft of blade, Hisuian Samurott is a rare form of Samurott shaped by its evolution in the region of Hisui. You've been shaped by your surroundings into someone calm and thoughtful, with an edgy sharpness. You know how to survive in a tough world, and you've got a quiet, strategic intensity that people respect.",
  "Patrat": "Patrat stores food in its cheek pouches and takes turns standing guard for hours, raising the alarm if danger comes near. You take your responsibilities seriously. Bold and hands-on, yet modest and sweet-natured, you're the friend who quietly keeps watch, and people know they can rely on you to look out for them.",
  "Watchog": "Watchog makes the patterns on its body glow to threaten predators, and when it spots an enemy, its tail stands high and it spits berry seeds stored in its cheeks. You're quick and level-headed, with a warm, approachable charm. You're always watching out for the people around you, ready to stand up and protect them when needed.",
  "Lillipup": "Lillipup uses the long fur on its face to sense its surroundings, and it faces strong opponents fearlessly despite its small size. You're approachable and light-hearted, with a guarded, moody side. You might be small, but your courage is huge, and you're always ready to stand your ground.",
  "Herdier": "Herdier's black fur is like a cape, and it's very loyal, following its Trainer's orders faithfully. You're sweet-natured and light-hearted, with a larger-than-life, elusive charm. You're a devoted friend, and the people around you know they can always count on you to have their back.",
  "Stoutland": "Stoutland is so smart that it's often used in mountain rescues, and its long fur keeps it warm even in freezing weather. You're unhurried and sweet-natured, a city-minded spirit with moody moments. You're the person people turn to when they're lost, and your steady, comforting presence helps them find their way home.",
  "Purrloin": "Purrloin steals things from people for fun, and it lures them in with an adorable act before making its getaway. You've got classic charm with a mischievous twist. Approachable and level-headed, with the occasional moody spell, you know exactly how to win people over, even when you're up to something.",
  "Liepard": "Liepard's beautiful spotted coat helps it vanish in the dark, and it moves silently, appearing and disappearing without a sound. You're elegant and mischievous, with a level-headed, classic poise. You have a mysterious edge, and you know how to make an entrance, and an exit, that people won't forget.",
  "Pansage": "Pansage shares the leaves on its head with weary Pokémon, and they're said to relieve stress when eaten. You're thoughtful and good-natured, happiest outdoors. Moody now and then, you're always happy to share what you have, and your kindness helps the people around you feel calmer and more refreshed.",
  "Simisage": "Simisage is wild-tempered and fights by swinging its thorn-covered tail around, and unlike its gentle pre-evolution's, the leaf growing on its head is very bitter. You're bold and light-hearted, modest despite your strength. You're quick to stand up for yourself and you don't sugar-coat things, but your good-natured heart always shines through in the end.",
  "Pansear": "Pansear lives in caves in volcanoes, and when it's angered, the fire in the tuft on its head can reach six hundred degrees. You're young at heart, bright and natural, with a fiery spirit. Your feelings heat up quickly, and you light up everyone around you with your passion.",
  "Simisear": "Simisear loves sweets, and it burns the energy it gets from them to keep its head and tail aflame. You're bold and light-hearted, modest but fiery. You've got a sweet tooth and a big heart, and your fiery energy is fuelled by the simple pleasures that make you happy.",
  "Panpour": "Panpour stores nutrient-rich water in the tufts on its head, and it sprays it on plants to help them grow. You're affectionate and level-headed, with a moody, city-minded side. You quietly nurture the people around you, giving them exactly what they need to flourish, even if you don't always say much.",
  "Simipour": "Simipour's tail sucks up water, and it fires it out with enough force to break through concrete. You're bold and light-hearted, modest but level-headed. You keep your power under wraps most of the time, but when you need to, you can make a big splash and break through any barrier.",
  "Munna": "Munna eats dreams and gives off a pink mist that shows the dream it's just eaten. You're grounded and affectionate, with an edgy, intuitive side. You have a gentle, dreamy quality, and you're always tuned in to what's going on beneath the surface, picking up on people's hopes and fears.",
  "Musharna": "The mist coming from Musharna's forehead is packed with dreams, changing colour depending on the dream it has eaten and even taking the shapes of things from them. You're bright and compact, a little elusive but deeply intuitive. You bring a sense of calm and wonder to the people around you, and your presence feels like a pleasant dream.",
  "Pidove": "Pidove live in cities and are so accustomed to people that when someone scatters food, several hundred of them can gather at once. You're light-hearted and steady, practical with moody moments. You're easy to be around, and you have a down-to-earth charm that makes you feel like an old friend.",
  "Tranquill": "Tranquill can find its way home from anywhere in the world, no matter how far away it is. You're quick and sweet-natured, with a soaring spirit and a moody side. You've got a great sense of direction, and you always find your way back to the people and places you love.",
  "Unfezant": "Male Unfezant have flamboyant head plumage while females are faster fliers, and they're said to only bond with their Trainer. You're bold and city-minded, with a cool style and moody streak. You don't give your loyalty easily, but once you do, the person you've chosen has a devoted, fiercely protective friend for life.",
  "Blitzle": "Blitzle's mane flashes when it discharges electricity, and the frequency and pattern of the flashes is how it talks to its herd. You're approachable but edgy, with a moody side and a love of tech. You've got your own way of communicating, and the people who understand you get a lot of sparkling conversation.",
  "Zebstrika": "Zebstrika gallops as fast as lightning, and when it's angry, its mane glows and it can fire lightning in every direction. You're good-natured and practical, with classic values and an edgy temper. You move quickly through life, and when something sets you off, everyone knows about it straight away.",
  "Roggenrola": "Roggenrola has a hexagonal ear that helps it hear sounds, and its body is as hard as steel, formed in underground caves. You're grounded and hands-on, approachable but cool in style. You're steady and tough, and you have a way of listening carefully to what people say before you respond.",
  "Boldore": "When Boldore overflows with power, the orange crystals on its body glow, and that overflowing energy has hardened into crystals tough enough to smash diamonds. You're bold and grounded, with a warm-blooded core. You adapt to whatever comes, but you also know when to let your stored-up energy out, and the people nearby feel it when you do.",
  "Gigalith": "Gigalith soaks up sunlight through the orange crystals on its body, then compresses that energy and fires it out as a powerful beam. You draw strength from the good things around you. Bright and grounded, tireless when you're focused, you adapt to circumstances and turn what you've absorbed into something truly powerful.",
  "Woobat": "Woobat's nose is shaped like a heart, and when it sticks it onto something, it leaves a heart-shaped mark that's said to bring good luck. You're young at heart and light-hearted, with an edgy, intuitive side. You have a way of leaving your mark on the people you meet, and they remember you with a smile long after you've gone.",
  "Swoobat": "When Swoobat courts, it sends out heart-shaped ultrasonic waves, and anyone caught in them is said to fall into a blissfully happy mood. You have a gently uplifting influence. Thoughtful and intuitive, modest with the odd moody moment, you make the people you care about feel lighter simply by being near them.",
  "Drilbur": "Drilbur digs through the ground by spinning its body like a drill, and it can travel at around thirty miles per hour underground. You're hands-on and grounded, an outdoorsy spirit with a moody side. When you set your mind to something, you power through it, and nothing stays in your way for long.",
  "Excadrill": "Excadrill can bore through a steel plate, and it's been used to dig tunnels for subways because it's so skilled at it. You're level-headed and bold, with a genuine love of tech. You're a natural problem-solver, and you've got the strength and focus to tunnel straight through difficult challenges.",
  "Mega Excadrill": "Excadrill is known as the Drill King, tunnelling through the ground at over ninety miles per hour, and many tunnels that seem to have formed naturally are actually the result of its digging. You become unstoppable once you're focused. Level-headed and bold, with a love of tech, you transform into a problem-solver who drills straight through obstacles others would walk around.",
  "Audino": "Audino listens to heartbeats with the feelers on its ears, and it can tell how someone is feeling, or even whether a baby is about to hatch. You've got a keen sense of what people need. Bright yet modest, practical and quietly independent, you're always ready to step in and help without needing to be asked.",
  "Mega Audino": "Audino has a kind heart, and with just a touch of its feelers, it can gauge other creatures' feelings and physical condition. You're bright and light-hearted, with an ambitious caring streak. When you transform, your kindness becomes a powerful, caring force, and people feel calmer just by being near you.",
  "Timburr": "Timburr always carries a squared log, and once it starts carrying logs about three times its own size, it's nearly ready to evolve. You're bold and young at heart, with a good-natured, warm-blooded energy. You build your strength steadily, carrying a little more weight each time until you're ready for the next big challenge.",
  "Gurdurr": "Gurdurr carries a steel beam around to build its muscles, and it's so strong that a group of wrestlers can't make it budge. You're approachable and bold, seasoned by experience with an edgy streak. You've worked hard to get where you are, and people respect your strength and determination.",
  "Conkeldurr": "Conkeldurr uses concrete pillars like walking sticks, and it's said that people learned to make concrete by watching it. You're bold and fiery, with an elusive, moody side. You're a natural innovator, and people look to you for new ideas and inspiration on how to build something better.",
  "Tympole": "Tympole sends out high-pitched sound waves to communicate with its friends, sounds that people can't hear at all. You're on your own wavelength. Quick, practical and young at heart, you love the bustle of the city, and you stay connected to your people in ways that outsiders never quite pick up on.",
  "Palpitoad": "Palpitoad vibrates the bumps on its head to make waves in water or earthquake-like tremors on land, and it lives in water and on land alike. You're grounded and bold, with a moody, edgy side. You're happy in more than one world, and when you want to be heard, you make sure the ripples spread.",
  "Seismitoad": "Seismitoad can turn a boulder to rubble with one punch by vibrating the bumps on its fists, yet the elderly love it because those same vibrations are great for massages. You've got power and a soft side. Good-natured and outdoorsy, you stay cool and calm, and you're as good at easing tension as you are at shaking things up when something needs to move.",
  "Throh": "Throh ties its belt tighter when facing a strong opponent, and when it meets someone bigger than itself, it feels an irresistible urge to throw them. You're happy to take on challenges larger than you. Elusive and fiery, guarded but warm-blooded, you keep your intensity tied in until the moment really calls for it.",
  "Sawk": "Sawk trains alone deep in the mountains, and tying its belt makes it focus so completely that its karate chops can shatter boulders. You're dedicated to self-improvement. Quick and fiery, guarded but good-natured, you keep honing your skills quietly, and your discipline lets you break through obstacles that stop everyone else.",
  "Sewaddle": "Sewaddle makes its own clothes by chewing up leaves and stitching them together with the sticky silk from its mouth. You're resourceful and practical. Light-hearted and unhurried, a little guarded, you like to make things yourself, and your homemade, creative approach to life is quietly charming.",
  "Swadloon": "Swadloon wraps itself in leaves to keep warm, and it processes fallen leaves into nutrients, helping the forest stay healthy. You're hands-on and warm-blooded, a little elusive with a cool sense of style. You quietly look after the world around you, turning what others throw away into something that helps everyone grow.",
  "Leavanny": "Leavanny makes clothes for small Pokémon by cutting leaves with its blade-like arms and stitching them with silk. You're a natural caregiver. Good-natured and outdoorsy, guarded at first but warm-blooded underneath, you love making things for the people you care about, and they feel wrapped up in your kindness.",
  "Venipede": "Venipede's bite is poisonous, and it uses the feelers on its head and tail to sense its surroundings, keeping a lookout for enemies. You're quick and down-to-earth, with a guarded, mischievous side. You're always alert to what's going on, and people learn quickly that you can bite back.",
  "Whirlipede": "Whirlipede stays still inside its hard shell while preparing to evolve, but if it's attacked, it spins like a wheel and rams into its opponent. You're thoughtful and steady, with an ambitious, mischievous streak. You bide your time while you're growing, but you can spin into action in an instant.",
  "Scolipede": "Scolipede is fast and aggressive, chasing down its targets and finishing them with a poisonous strike from the claws on its neck. You're hands-on and level-headed, with a warm, warm-blooded drive. Once you've chosen your target, you go after it with speed and certainty, and you rarely miss.",
  "Mega Scolipede": "Scolipede latches onto prey with the claws on its neck, slams it into the ground and jabs it with toxic spikes, and Mega Evolution makes it even more relentless. You're grounded and steady, with a mischievous streak. When you transform, you become formidable, and everyone suddenly sees just how sharp you can be when it matters.",
  "Cottonee": "Cottonee drift on the wind in groups, shooting out cotton when they're threatened, and that cotton is gathered to stuff soft pillows. You're gentle and quick on your feet. Compact and steady, with a light-hearted easiness, you drift through life with an easy charm, and people find it very comfortable to be around you.",
  "Whimsicott": "Whimsicott slips through gaps like the wind, leaving behind a trail of cotton and mischief in its wake. You're affectionate and ambitious, with a natural, outdoorsy spirit. You love playful pranks, and your light, breezy energy means you can get into places other people can't.",
  "Petilil": "The leaves on Petilil's head are very bitter, but chewing them is said to cure fatigue, and it thrives in clean water and soil. You're affectionate and bright, with a big, unhurried presence. You might not be sweet to everyone at first, but your company leaves people feeling refreshed and restored.",
  "Lilligant": "Lilligant's flower gives off a fragrance that relaxes anyone who smells it, and even skilled Trainers struggle to make it bloom. You're light-hearted and quick, with grounded, classic elegance. You bloom when you're properly looked after, and your calming presence makes people feel instantly at ease.",
  "Hisuian Lilligant": "Hisuian Lilligant developed powerful legs from living high in the mountains, and it dances gracefully while delivering kicks strong enough to topple foes. Tough surroundings shaped your strength. Light-hearted and quick, you stay grounded and graceful, combining elegance with surprising power, so nobody ever sees your kick coming.",
  "Basculin": "Red-striped and blue-striped Basculin are always fighting each other, and they're so violent that they're often avoided by other Pokémon. You're good-natured and youthful, with a compact, classic charm. You might be small, but you're fiercely loyal to your own group, and you'll defend them against anyone.",
  "Hisuian Basculin (White-Striped)": "Unlike its quarrelsome cousins, White-Striped Basculin is mild-mannered and travels in calm schools, swimming far upstream together. You've found a gentler way to live. Good-natured and young at heart, shaped by where you come from, your easygoing presence brings a sense of peace to the people swimming alongside you.",
  "Sandile": "Sandile buries itself in desert sand with only its eyes and nose showing, which keeps it warm and hides it from predators. You're approachable and level-headed, with an outdoorsy, mischievous side. You know how to blend in when you need to, and you've always got your eye on what's going on around you.",
  "Krokorok": "Krokorok's eyes are covered by a dark membrane that lets it see in the dark and protects them from sand, and it lives in groups of a few. You're bold and elusive, with a moody, edgy streak. You see clearly where other people struggle, and you know how to protect yourself in difficult conditions.",
  "Krookodile": "Krookodile's jaw is so powerful it can crush a car, and its eyes can see objects many miles away, even in a desert sandstorm. You're level-headed and guarded, an everyday spirit with an edgy side. You keep your eyes on the horizon, and when something's worth fighting for, you hold on with an iron grip.",
  "Darumaka": "Darumaka's internal fire is so lively that while it's burning, Darumaka can't calm down and runs around, and even when it sleeps with its limbs pulled in, the fire stays at eleven hundred degrees. You're young at heart, hands-on and warm-blooded. Your enthusiasm burns brightly, and even when you rest, there's a fire inside you that never goes out.",
  "Galarian Darumaka": "Galarian Darumaka lived in snowy areas for so long that its fire sac atrophied, and the colder it gets, the more energetic it becomes, freezing its breath into snowballs for playful fights. You're young at heart, shaped by your surroundings, cool and calm. You've adapted to life in a cold climate, and the chillier things get, the more playful you become.",
  "Darmanitan": "Darmanitan's inner fire burns at over two thousand degrees, and a single punch from it is said to be enough to wreck a dump truck. You've got boundless energy. Bright and hands-on, quick to react and seemingly tireless, when you set your mind to something you pursue it with incredible, burning power.",
  "Galarian Darmanitan": "Galarian Darmanitan is calm and gentle, and it stores food inside the big snowball on its head, so it's never caught without a snack. You're always prepared. Hands-on and level-headed, with a bold streak shaped by where you've lived, you're practical and resourceful, ready for whatever the cold months bring.",
  "Galarian Darmanitan (Zen Mode)": "Anger reignites Galarian Darmanitan's atrophied flame sac, and in Zen Mode it won't stop spewing flames until its rage has settled, even if its body starts to melt. You're bold and hands-on, with a fiery temper shaped by your surroundings. You keep your cool most of the time, but when you're pushed too far, your passion comes bursting out.",
  "Maractus": "Maractus dances rhythmically to scare away bird Pokémon, and when it moves, its flowers make a maraca-like sound. You're bold and grounded, a steady, natural presence with a playful rhythm. You know how to protect yourself while still having fun, and you bring a little music to wherever you go.",
  "Dwebble": "Dwebble carves out a hole in a rock to use as its home, and if its rock is damaged, it searches for a new one. You're quick and down-to-earth, guarded but good-natured. You know how to make yourself at home anywhere, and you're always ready to rebuild after a setback.",
  "Crustle": "Crustle carries a heavy slab of rock on its back, and it fights fiercely to protect its territory. You're unhurried and grounded, steady with a moody streak. You carry a lot of responsibility, and you're determined to protect the people and places you care about.",
  "Scraggy": "Scraggy pulls up its baggy skin to protect itself, and it headbutts anyone who looks at it the wrong way. You're independent and mischievous, guarded with a warm-toned style. You've got a tough exterior, and you're quick to stand your ground if someone tries to push you around.",
  "Scrafty": "Scrafty can spit acidic fluid from its mouth, and it uses its crest to show its rank, with the biggest crest belonging to the boss. You're independent and genuine, a city-minded spirit with warm-toned style. You've got a strong sense of who you are, and you're not afraid to show the world your colours.",
  "Mega Scrafty": "Scrafty may have the temperament of a rude ruffian, but it takes very good care of its family, its friends and its turf, and Mega Evolution only adds to its swagger. You're independent and city-minded, with a warm-toned confidence. When you transform, you step fully into your own style, and people can't help but respect the way you own the room.",
  "Sigilyph": "Sigilyph is said to have guarded an ancient city, and it flies along the same routes every day as if still on patrol. You're thoughtful and intuitive, an everyday spirit with moody moments. You're loyal to your routines and your duties, and there's something old and steady about the way you watch over things.",
  "Yamask": "Yamask carries a mask that's said to be its face from when it was human, and it sometimes looks at it and cries. You're cool-toned and affectionate, with a mischievous, moody side. You hold on to your memories, and your sentimental heart makes you a loyal, caring friend.",
  "Galarian Yamask": "Galarian Yamask formed when a clay slab with cursed engravings took possession of a Yamask, and the slab is said to be absorbing its dark power. You're bright and mischievous, with a cool-toned style shaped by your surroundings. You carry a lot of history, and you've learned to turn your past into a source of strength.",
  "Cofagrigus": "Cofagrigus is said to look like a golden coffin, and it traps grave robbers inside its body. You're unhurried and natural, warm-blooded with a bright, gilded charm. You protect what you value most, and anyone who tries to take advantage of you quickly finds themselves in trouble.",
  "Tirtouga": "Tirtouga was revived from an ancient fossil, and it's said to have dived to depths of over half a mile, hunting in the dark sea. You've got hidden depths. Elusive and natural, you stay cool and calm, and you're comfortable exploring the deeper, murkier parts of life that other people would rather leave alone.",
  "Carracosta": "Carracosta lives both in the ocean and on land, and its jaws are so terrifyingly powerful that it could eat Omastar whole without being bothered in the slightest by the shell. You adapt to any environment. Level-headed and bright, you stay cool and calm under pressure, and you have the quiet strength to chew through problems others can't get a grip on.",
  "Archen": "Archen is thought to be the ancestor of all bird Pokémon, but it couldn't fly, so it hopped from branch to branch. You're bold and youthful, a free spirit who loves to soar. You're always trying to reach higher, even if you haven't quite worked out how to fly yet.",
  "Archeops": "Archeops is a better runner than flier, and it needs to sprint at around twenty-five miles per hour to build up enough speed to take off. You need a running start, but then you soar. Outdoorsy and bright, warm in style and completely genuine, once you finally get airborne you go higher than anyone expected.",
  "Trubbish": "Trubbish was born when a rubbish bag soaked up industrial chemicals, and it prefers to live in unclean, forgotten corners of the city. You've got an unconventional charm. Bright and city-minded, a little guarded with a mischievous streak, you're happiest doing things your own way, and you find treasure where others see junk.",
  "Garbodor": "The garbage Garbodor eats turns into poison inside its body, and the main component of that poison depends on what sort of trash it ate. You're affectionate and light-hearted, genuine with a mischievous side. You've learned to make the best of whatever life gives you, and you know how to turn things around to your advantage.",
  "Gigantamax Garbodor": "Gigantamax energy has made Garbodor's toxic gas so much thicker that it congeals into masses shaped like discarded toys. You're city-minded and mischievous, with a transformative, dramatic presence. When you change, you become an unstoppable force, and you leave a lasting impression wherever you go.",
  "Zorua": "Zorua is timid by nature, so when it isn't around friends, it basically always stays transformed into some other person or Pokémon. You're shy until you trust someone. Elusive but modest, with a warm heart and a classic sense of mischief, you keep up a disguise around strangers, but your true self comes bounding out once you're among friends.",
  "Hisuian Zorua": "Hisuian Zorua is a once-departed soul returned to life in Hisui, and it draws power from resentment, which rises atop its head and takes on the forms of its foes. You've been through a lot. Elusive and modest, but warm-blooded underneath, your surroundings taught you to protect yourself by keeping your true self carefully hidden.",
  "Zoroark": "Zoroark protects its pack by casting illusions, and it's said to show terrifying visions to anyone who threatens its home. You'll do whatever it takes to keep your people safe. Thoughtful yet bold, with a seasoned, practical streak, you're incredibly resourceful when it comes to looking after the ones you love.",
  "Hisuian Zoroark": "With its dishevelled white fur, Hisuian Zoroark looks like an embodiment of death, and heedless of its own safety, it attacks its nemeses with a bitter, fearsome energy. You don't forget easily. Quick and thoughtful, shaped by everything you've been through, you're surprisingly sweet-natured with the people who treat you well, and fiercely loyal to them.",
  "Minccino": "Minccino can't stand dust, and it uses its fluffy tail like a broom to sweep everything around it spotless. You love making things nice for others. Sweet-natured and seemingly tireless, you're always ready to tidy up, lend a hand and make the people around you feel genuinely cared for.",
  "Cinccino": "Cinccino's white fur is coated in a special oil that keeps off dust and static, and it uses that fur to polish things and protect itself. You've got a polished, elegant style. Quick on your feet with classic tastes, you're sweet-natured underneath, and you always manage to look your best, whatever life throws at you.",
  "Gothita": "Gothita stares intently at things that no one else can see, and it's said to be watching something only it can perceive. You're good-natured with classic tastes, but there's a moody, intuitive depth to you. You notice things others miss, and you're always tuned in to a world beneath the surface.",
  "Gothorita": "Gothorita is said to use psychic power to control sleeping people, and on starry nights it moves around in the dark. You're intuitive and light-hearted, seasoned with moody moments. You have a mysterious, dreamy quality, and you seem to be most alive in the quiet hours when everyone else is asleep.",
  "Gothitelle": "Gothitelle reads the future in the movements of the stars, and its psychic power can warp space enough to reveal galaxies thousands of light-years away. You have a deep, almost mystical wisdom. Modest and unhurried, with a natural intuition, people come to you when they want to understand where life is heading.",
  "Solosis": "Solosis is protected by a special liquid that lets it survive in any environment, even the vacuum of space. You're unhurried and light-hearted, with an edgy, intuitive side. You've got a resilient spirit, and you can adapt to any situation, no matter how strange or difficult.",
  "Duosion": "Duosion's body holds two brains, and when they disagree, it can't decide what to do, but when they think as one its psychic power is formidable. You often weigh up two sides at once. Light-hearted, steady and intuitive, you'd rather explore every option before committing, and you're powerful when your mind is made up.",
  "Reuniclus": "When Reuniclus shake hands, their brains link into a network that amplifies their psychic power enough to crush boulders. You're strongest when you're connected. Bold, compact and a bit elusive, with moody moments, you have a powerful mind that truly comes alive alongside people who understand you.",
  "Ducklett": "Ducklett are better swimmers than fliers, and they dive underwater to hunt for their favourite food, peat moss. You're light-hearted and practical, with a bright, soaring spirit. You're still finding your wings, but you're happy to make the most of what you're good at in the meantime.",
  "Swanna": "Swanna flocks begin to dance gracefully at dusk, and the one dancing in the very centre is the flock's leader. You lead with grace rather than force. Modest and bright, you stay cool and calm when others fluster, and people naturally follow your quiet, elegant example without you ever needing to raise your voice.",
  "Vanillite": "Vanillite is said to have been born from an icicle bathed in the energy of the morning sun, and it uses its breath to make snow. You're grounded and bright, with a cool, calm composure. You bring a gentle sweetness to everything you do, and you have a knack for cooling down heated situations.",
  "Vanillish": "Vanillish lives high on snowy mountains, where it breathes out icy particles that crystallise and freeze anything they touch. You're happiest when things are chilled out. Young at heart and bright, you keep a cool and calm composure, and your sparkling, frosty personality is very hard for people to resist.",
  "Vanilluxe": "Vanilluxe has two heads, and when it gets angry, it creates blizzards by swallowing water and blowing out snow clouds. You're down-to-earth and cool-toned, with a calm exterior. You might seem chilled out, but when someone pushes you too far, you can whip up a storm.",
  "Deerling": "Deerling's fur changes colour with the seasons, and it's said that people can tell what season it is just by looking at it. You're approachable and level-headed, with a sweet, city-minded charm. You adapt to your surroundings with ease, and you're always in tune with the changes going on around you.",
  "Sawsbuck": "Sawsbuck's antlers sprout different plants as the seasons change, and it migrates with the seasons to wherever life is most abundant. You change with the times while staying true to yourself. Sweet-natured and approachable, you've got a big, outdoorsy presence, and people look forward to seeing how you've grown each time they meet you.",
  "Emolga": "Emolga glides through the air on its stretchy membrane, releasing electricity it stores in its cheeks as it soars. You're a free spirit with a warm-blooded heart. City-minded and tech-minded, you love gliding between projects and places, sparking a bit of excitement wherever you land.",
  "Karrablast": "Karrablast spits an acidic liquid to drive attackers away, and for some mysterious reason, it evolves when it receives electrical energy while it's in the same place as a Shelmet. You learn a lot from other people. Hands-on and outdoorsy, light-hearted with a moody side, you're happy to borrow a good idea if it helps you grow.",
  "Escavalier": "Escavalier wears the shell it took from Shelmet like a suit of armour, and it charges at opponents with the sharp lances on its arms. You're a brave defender. Unhurried and outdoorsy, with an affectionate heart and a love of well-made tech, you'll charge straight into a fight to protect the people you care about.",
  "Foongus": "Foongus has a pattern on its cap that looks just like a Poké Ball, and it's thought to use the disguise to lure people close before releasing its spores. You've got a clever, tricky streak. Bold and outdoorsy, with a bright, cool style, you're always ready to surprise the people who think they've figured you out.",
  "Amoonguss": "Amoonguss waves the Poké Ball-patterned caps on its arms to lure prey closer, then sends out a cloud of poisonous spores. Your charm makes a very effective lure. Bright and grounded, a little elusive with a mischievous streak, you're full of charm, and you always keep one more side of yourself in reserve.",
  "Frillish": "Frillish wraps its veil-like arms around prey and drags it down to the depths of the sea, where it lives in deep, dark caves. You're light-hearted and bright on the surface, with a cool, mischievous streak underneath. People find you easy to like, but you've got hidden depths that pull them in further than they expected.",
  "Jellicent": "Jellicent is said to sink ships that wander into its territory, and the deep sea where it lives is littered with the wrecks. You're calm and thoughtful, with grounded instincts. Your enthusiasm burns quickly when something matters, and you guard your territory with a quiet, powerful determination that people shouldn't underestimate.",
  "Alomomola": "Alomomola gently holds injured and weak Pokémon in its fins, and the special membrane enveloping its body heals their wounds. You're the one people turn to when they're hurting. Calm and tireless, a little guarded but deeply natural in your kindness, you quietly help others heal and get back on their feet.",
  "Joltik": "Joltik can't make its own electricity, so it clings to larger Pokémon and soaks up their static, storing it in a little electric pouch. You draw energy from the people around you. Bright and bold, quick on your feet but grounded, you're small yet resourceful, and you make the most of every spark you catch.",
  "Galvantula": "Galvantula spins electrically charged webs to trap prey, and it can throw up barriers of crackling electricity to protect itself. You build safety nets. Quick-thinking yet grounded, steady and thoughtful, you plan ahead for yourself and the people you love, so you're always prepared when trouble finally comes.",
  "Ferroseed": "Ferroseed sticks its spikes into cave ceilings to absorb iron from the rock, and it shoots spikes to defend itself. You're unhurried with a big presence and a love of tech. Moody at times, you take what you need from your surroundings and build yourself into something incredibly tough.",
  "Ferrothorn": "Ferrothorn attaches itself to cave ceilings and fires steel spikes at targets passing beneath, and a hit from its three spiky feelers can reduce a boulder to rubble. You're hands-on and level-headed, adaptable with a love of tech. You've built strong defences, and you can stand your ground against anything that comes your way.",
  "Klink": "Klink's two gears mesh together perfectly, and if they're separated, they'll only fit back together with each other. You're hands-on and bright, grounded with a cool-toned style. You value the people who fit with you perfectly, and you work best when you're in sync with someone you trust.",
  "Klang": "When Klang goes all out, its minigear links up perfectly with the outer part of its big gear, and its rotation speed increases sharply. You're grounded and level-headed, with an affectionate, tech-minded heart. You work best in tandem with the people you love, and together you can generate a remarkable amount of momentum.",
  "Klinklang": "Klinklang's red core charges with energy and fires it through its spikes, and its three gears spin at high speed to attack. You're good-natured with a love of tech, cool-toned with moody moments. When you've got all your parts working together, you're a powerhouse that can take on anything.",
  "Tynamo": "Tynamo lives in groups, and though one alone produces only a weak charge, a group of them together can generate as much electricity as a lightning bolt. You're bright and light-hearted, cool in style and grounded. You might seem small on your own, but you're incredibly powerful when you're with your people.",
  "Eelektrik": "Eelektrik wraps its long body around prey and paralyses it with electricity released from the round spots along its sides. You know how to hold on to an opportunity. Young at heart and bold, warm-blooded yet practical, you've got a powerful spark that helps you get exactly what you're after.",
  "Eelektross": "Eelektross crawls out of the sea to attack prey on land, latching on with its sucker mouth and delivering powerful electric shocks. You're bold and affectionate, quick-burning with moody spells. You're not afraid to step out of your comfort zone, and when you get excited about something, you dive in headfirst.",
  "Mega Eelektross": "Eelektross sucks prey in with its sucker mouth, then sinks in its fangs to shock it with electricity, and Mega Evolution only makes that grip harder to escape. You're an everyday, city-minded spirit, seasoned by experience. When you transform, you become an electrifying presence that holds on to what matters with an unbreakable grip.",
  "Elgyem": "Elgyem was discovered about fifty years ago, and rumours link its origin to a UFO crash site in the desert from around that time. You're approachable and bold, with a thoughtful, intuitive mind. You've got an otherworldly quality, and you leave people thinking about their conversations with you long after they're over.",
  "Beheeyem": "Beheeyem can rewrite people's memories with its psychic power, and it communicates by flashing the coloured lights on its three fingers in different patterns. You've got a mysterious, magnetic presence. Bold and compact, elusive with moody moments, you communicate in ways other people can't quite explain, yet somehow always understand.",
  "Litwick": "Litwick shines a light that seems to guide people, but it's actually draining their life force to fuel its flame. You're grounded and warm-blooded, with a cool-toned, mischievous streak. You've got a warm, welcoming glow, but people learn to keep an eye on your playful, slightly spooky side.",
  "Lampent": "Lampent appears near hospitals, waiting for people's spirits to leave their bodies so it can absorb them and fuel its flame. You're affectionate and modest, a city-minded spirit with a mischievous edge. You've got a slightly spooky, gothic charm, and you're always hanging around in unexpected places.",
  "Chandelure": "Chandelure's eerie flames sway hypnotically, and it's said that anything its fire touches has its spirit absorbed and burned as fuel. You're captivating without trying. Guarded and grounded, practical about what you let people see, you stay a little elusive, and people find themselves drawn to your glow without understanding why.",
  "Mega Chandelure": "Chandelure haunts dilapidated mansions, swaying its arms to hypnotise opponents with the ominous dance of its flames, and Mega Evolution makes that display even more dazzling. Your glow becomes impossible to ignore. Usually guarded, with a light-hearted streak and a cool sense of style, you transform into someone so mesmerising that nobody can look away.",
  "Axew": "Axew uses its tusks to crush the berries it eats, and though they have a tendency to break, each time they grow back harder and sturdier. You're level-headed and independent, a free spirit with a warm-blooded heart. You bounce back from setbacks with even more strength, and you're always carving out your own space in the world.",
  "Fraxure": "Fraxure's tusks will never grow back if they break, so after every battle it diligently sharpens them on river rocks. You look after your skills. Young at heart and thoroughly good-natured, you're an independent free spirit, and you keep polishing your talents because you know some things can't be replaced.",
  "Haxorus": "Haxorus has tusks that can slice through steel without a chip, yet it's known to be kind and gentle until it's provoked. You're kind at heart with a hidden edge. Modest and level-headed, you love the city and live as a free spirit, and people learn quickly that your gentleness shouldn't be mistaken for weakness.",
  "Cubchoo": "Cubchoo always has a runny nose, which is a sign of good health, and it sniffs the frozen drip back up to fire icy attacks. You've got a quirky, playful sense of humour. Hands-on and cool in style, you stay calm about life's little messes, and you turn even the silly things into something useful.",
  "Beartic": "Beartic freezes its own breath into fangs and claws of ice, and it swims through freezing northern seas hunting for prey. You thrive where others would struggle. Calm with classic values, hands-on and bold, you're incredibly resilient, and you make something strong out of even the coldest, harshest situations life throws at you.",
  "Cryogonal": "Cryogonal is born in snow clouds, its body a lattice of ice crystals, and it catches prey with chains of ice it stretches from its body. You've got an intricate, crystalline beauty. Bright and thoughtful, you're bold in busy cities, and people are fascinated by how many facets there are to your personality.",
  "Shelmet": "Shelmet shuts the lid of its shell tight when it's attacked, and it spits poison through the gap to fight back. You're a careful self-protector. Unhurried and practical, with your feet firmly on the ground, you keep a lid on things until you're sure it's safe, and you can still defend yourself perfectly well from behind it.",
  "Accelgor": "After losing its shell to Karrablast, Accelgor became incredibly fast, wrapping its body in membranes so it doesn't dry out. You've turned a loss into freedom. Grounded and level-headed, good-natured with an edgy streak, you adapted brilliantly to change and now move through life far faster than you ever used to.",
  "Stunfisk": "Stunfisk buries itself in mud at the seashore, and when prey steps on it, it smiles and gives off a jolt of electricity. You're unhurried and light-hearted, with an adaptable, tireless patience. You don't rush, and you seem perfectly content to wait, but people who stumble over you soon discover your hidden spark.",
  "Galarian Stunfisk": "Galarian Stunfisk lies in wait in the mud, luring prey with its conspicuous lips, then clamps its jagged steel fins down on anything that gets close. Your surroundings made you sharper. Thoughtful and ambitious, you adapt patiently to tough conditions, and once you've got hold of something you want, you don't let go.",
  "Mienfoo": "Mienfoo practises its flowing martial arts every morning, and a well-trained Mienfoo can chop with its arms more than a hundred times in one minute. You're dedicated and disciplined. Bold and warm, with a hands-on energy that's easy to approach, you keep training at the things you care about, getting a little sharper every single day.",
  "Mienshao": "Mienshao uses the long fur on its arms like whips, striking so fast that its attacks are almost impossible to see. You've mastered your craft. Seasoned and good-natured, with a natural, practical grace, you make difficult things look effortless, and people are amazed by how quickly you get things done.",
  "Druddigon": "Druddigon warms its body by soaking up sunlight through its wings, and it uses its hard, rough head to smash into opponents. You're a free spirit who draws energy from the good things in life. Level-headed and bright, with a warm-blooded intensity, you don't back down from a challenge.",
  "Golett": "Golett was made from clay by an ancient civilisation, and it's powered by a mysterious energy source that makes it walk around. You're bold and young at heart, with a cool-toned, mischievous streak. You've got an old soul in a new body, and you're always curious about the world around you.",
  "Golurk": "Golurk was built in ancient times to protect people and Pokémon, and if the seal on its chest comes off, its energy runs wild. You're a natural protector. Genuine and grounded, at home outdoors and down-to-earth, you've been built to look after others, and you keep your powerful energy carefully sealed until it's needed.",
  "Mega Golurk": "When Golurk Mega Evolves, the seal on its chest gives way and the ancient energy inside floods through its body, lighting it up from within. You're outdoorsy and natural, with a mischievous streak. When you transform, everything you've kept bottled up pours out, and people discover the true power you've been guarding.",
  "Pawniard": "Pawniard's body is covered in blades, and it fights as part of a group led by a Bisharp, sharpening its edges for battle. You're bright and young at heart, with a level-headed, mischievous streak. You're happy being part of a team, and you're always keeping your skills sharp so you can step up when it counts.",
  "Bisharp": "Bisharp leads a group of Pawniard and battles to become the boss, but if it loses, it's driven from the group, and if the blade on its head is ever chipped, it retires as leader. You're young at heart and independent, down-to-earth with a mischievous edge. You've got natural leadership skills, and you're determined to earn the respect of the people around you.",
  "Bouffalant": "Bouffalant charges headfirst, and its afro-like fur absorbs the impact, so it can crash into things without getting hurt. You're sweet-natured and unhurried, with a hands-on, slightly elusive charm. You've got a soft side that cushions you, and when you do charge into something, you're tougher than people expect.",
  "Rufflet": "Rufflet picks fights with anyone, no matter how strong, and it grows stronger each time it battles, even if it loses. You're good-natured and grounded, with a warm-blooded, soaring spirit. You're never afraid to take on a challenge, and you learn something new every time you try, whatever the outcome.",
  "Braviary": "Braviary is known as the valiant sky warrior, and it fights bravely for its friends, even if it gets hurt in the process. You're bold and city-minded, with a bright, warm-toned spirit. You'll stand up for the people you love without hesitation, and your courage inspires everyone around you.",
  "Hisuian Braviary": "Hisuian Braviary hunts with a bloodcurdling battle cry, blasting lakes with psychic shock waves and scooping up the prey that floats to the surface. You've adapted to a harsh world with real cleverness. Affectionate and bright, thoughtful in how you approach things, you use your ingenuity to look after the people who matter most.",
  "Vullaby": "Vullaby's wings are too tiny for it to fly yet, so it guards its rear with bones gathered for it by Mandibuzz, jumping around and dreaming of wide open skies. You're grounded and resourceful, with a warm, mischievous charm. You might not be soaring yet, but you're making the best of what you've got while you grow into your wings.",
  "Mandibuzz": "Mandibuzz circles high in the sky, watching for weak prey, and it decorates itself with the bones it collects. You're a free spirit with a guarded, mischievous edge. Warm in style, you see the bigger picture from above, and you've got a distinctive look that people definitely remember.",
  "Heatmor": "Heatmor sucks in air through its tail to fuel the fire inside, and it uses its flaming tongue to melt Durant's steel bodies. You're fiery and natural, practical with moody moments. You've got a fierce passion, and you know exactly how to melt through the toughest defences when you need to.",
  "Durant": "Durant dig mazes of complicated, interconnected tunnels into mountains, and each one plays a different role in driving Heatmor, their natural predator, away from the colony. You're a hard-working team player. Bold yet grounded, steady under pressure and fond of good engineering, you're always ready to defend your group against anything that comes its way.",
  "Deino": "Deino can't see, so it explores by biting and bumping into things, and its body is covered in scratches from its adventures. You're ambitious and mischievous, a free spirit who's a little elusive. You don't need to see the whole path ahead to dive in, and you learn about the world by throwing yourself into it.",
  "Zweilous": "Zweilous's two heads don't get along, and they compete for food so fiercely that it's always eating, though it never feels full. You're edgy and elusive, with a mischievous, free-spirited energy. There's a constant tug-of-war in your head, but it keeps you hungry for more, and you're always chasing the next thing.",
  "Hydreigon": "Hydreigon travels the skies on its six wings, attacking anything that moves, and the heads on its arms don't even have brains. You're modest and level-headed, down-to-earth in everyday life. But you've got a fierce, wild side, and people know not to stand in your way when you're determined.",
  "Larvesta": "Larvesta's five horns spout fire, and it was once believed to have been born from the sun, worshipped as a symbol of sunshine. You're hands-on and bright, grounded but quick to catch fire. You've got a warm, sunny spirit, and you bring light and energy to everyone around you.",
  "Volcarona": "When volcanic ash once blotted out the sky, Volcarona's flames are said to have taken the sun's place, keeping people and Pokémon warm. You're the sunshine in hard times. Thoughtful and bright, you stay down-to-earth and love the outdoors, and you quietly step in to bring warmth and light when everything feels dark.",
  "Cobalion": "Cobalion is said to have protected Pokémon from people long ago, and its stern glare can make even rowdy Pokémon obey. You're thoughtful and cool-toned, a tech-minded, legendary spirit. You've got a strong sense of justice, and people naturally listen when you speak up for what's right.",
  "Terrakion": "Terrakion is said to have charged into castles to rescue Pokémon caught in human wars, smashing through walls with its body. You're hands-on and practical, a legendary spirit who loves the outdoors. When someone needs help, you don't wait for permission, you charge straight in and get them out.",
  "Virizion": "Virizion's horns are as sharp as blades, and it moves so quickly and gracefully that it can confuse its opponents. You're thoughtful and natural, with a warm-blooded love of the outdoors. You move through life with grace, and you protect the people around you with quiet, swift skill.",
  "Tornadus": "Tornadus flies around at two hundred miles per hour, creating storms with the energy that pours from its tail. You're bold and level-headed, a modest free spirit. You move quickly through life, and while you don't make a fuss about it, you can stir up a whirlwind of change wherever you go.",
  "Tornadus (Therian Forme)": "Tornadus's Therian Forme is a strange avian guise that some researchers suspect to be its true form, hidden behind its more humanlike appearance. You're a free spirit who keeps things understated and modest. When you transform, you reveal a wild, powerful side, and people are amazed at the force of nature you become.",
  "Thundurus": "Thundurus flies across the sky raining down lightning bolts, and it's said to cause forest fires that destroy everything in its path. You're modest and fiery, a free-spirited, genuine soul. You don't go looking for trouble, but your passionate, electric energy can't be ignored when it bursts out.",
  "Thundurus (Therian Forme)": "In its Therian Forme, Thundurus materialises out of nowhere, quick as a flash, and pulverises foes with showers of devastatingly powerful lightning bolts. You're a free spirit with a lot of hidden charge. Modest most of the time, fiery underneath, you transform into someone electrifying when your true nature finally breaks through.",
  "Reshiram": "Reshiram is said to appear before people who seek the truth, and its tail flares with flames that can set the world ablaze. You're practical and good-natured, warm-blooded with a cool style. You value honesty above everything, and you'll help anyone who's sincerely searching for what's real.",
  "Zekrom": "Zekrom is said to appear before people who hold strong ideals, and its tail works like a generator, powering the lightning it unleashes. You back people who chase big dreams. Grounded and ambitious, a legendary free spirit at heart, your belief in a better future is genuinely electrifying to everyone around you.",
  "Landorus": "Landorus is worshipped by farmers because the land it visits produces bountiful crops, and it's known as 'the Guardian of the Fields'. You're bold and natural, a legendary spirit with an affectionate heart. You help the people around you flourish, and your presence brings abundance and growth wherever you go.",
  "Landorus (Therian Forme)": "In its Therian Forme, Landorus takes the shape of an orange beast, and it's said to bring rich harvests to the lands it walks across. You're level-headed and bold, a natural, legendary spirit. When you show your true self, you bring a sense of plenty and security to the people around you.",
  "Kyurem": "Kyurem's body is frozen solid, and this legendary ice Pokémon waits for a hero to fill in the missing parts of its body with truth or ideals. You're ambitious and genuine, a practical free spirit. You're always searching for the missing pieces of yourself, and that drive to become whole is what pushes you forward.",
  "Keldeo": "Keldeo crosses the oceans and races over the surface of water by jetting it from its hooves, and it's known for its courage. You're bright and natural, a legendary spirit with an edgy streak. You're brave and determined, and you'll gallop straight towards whatever challenge is waiting for you.",
  "Meloetta": "Meloetta's melodies are said to control people's emotions, and its songs can make listeners happy or sad. You're bright and practical, a natural, legendary talent. You have a gift for moving people with your words and your art, and your creativity touches everyone who experiences it.",
  "Genesect": "Genesect was revived and modified into a powerful cannon-wielding Pokémon by an evil organisation, but it fights to find its own path. You're independent and genuine, good-natured despite everything. You've been shaped by forces outside your control, but you're determined to forge your own destiny.",
  "Chespin": "Chespin's quills are usually soft, but when it flexes them, the points become hard and sharp enough to pierce rock. You're affectionate and hands-on, a little elusive with a love of the outdoors. You're soft on the outside, but people who mess with your friends quickly discover your sharp side.",
  "Quilladin": "Quilladin relies on its sturdy shell to deflect predators' attacks and counterattacks with its sharp quills, yet it's very kind and won't start a fight itself. You've got a sturdy, reliable presence. Affectionate yet modest, grounded and happiest outdoors, you're the person people know they can count on to protect them when things get tough.",
  "Chesnaught": "Chesnaught's Tackle is forceful enough to flip a fifty-ton tank, and it shields its allies from danger with its own body. You're a fiercely loyal friend. Fiery, genuine and happiest outdoors, you'll put yourself between your loved ones and danger, no matter what it costs you.",
  "Mega Chesnaught": "When Chesnaught takes a defensive posture with its fists guarding its face, it could withstand a bomb blast, and Mega Evolution makes that guard even tougher. You're fiery and guarded, outdoorsy with a transformative strength. When you change, you become an unbreakable wall of protection for the people you love.",
  "Fennekin": "Fennekin munches on a twig as it walks, the way you'd nibble a snack, and its roomy ears vent air hotter than three hundred and ninety degrees. You're guarded and a little elusive, but there's a quick-burning fire inside you. You keep yourself fuelled with the things you love, and when you're passionate about something, everyone can feel the heat.",
  "Braixen": "Braixen keeps a twig stuck in its tail, and when it plucks it out, the friction from its fur sets the twig alight, letting it send signals to its allies. Bold yet thoughtful, you take things at a warm, unhurried pace. You've always got the right tool for the job, and you know exactly how to spark your creativity when you need it.",
  "Delphox": "Delphox gazes into the flame at the tip of its wand, and it's said to be able to see the future in the flickering fire. Down-to-earth but deeply intuitive, you're fiery and genuine underneath. You have a deep, almost mystical wisdom, and people trust your insight to guide them through uncertain times.",
  "Mega Delphox": "Delphox uses psychic power to generate a fiery vortex of fifty-four hundred degrees, and Mega Evolution only makes its mystical flames burn brighter. You're down-to-earth and intuitive, with a fiery, transformative spirit. When you change, your inner wisdom shines brighter than ever, lighting the way for everyone around you.",
  "Froakie": "Froakie protects itself with frothy bubbles that it secretes from its chest and back, cushioning it from attacks. You're modest and affectionate, keeping a cool, calm head. You have a gentle way of protecting yourself and others, softening life's blows so the people around you feel looked after.",
  "Frogadier": "Frogadier can throw pebbles coated in bubbles with such precision that it can hit an empty can from over a hundred feet away. You've got remarkable focus. Affectionate and modest, with a good nature and a love of city life, you rarely boast, but when you take aim at something, you almost never miss.",
  "Greninja": "Greninja creates throwing stars out of compressed water, and it moves with the speed and stealth of a ninja, appearing and vanishing. You're affectionate underneath a cool, calm exterior, with moody spells. You move through life with quiet precision, always appearing exactly where you're needed most.",
  "Mega Greninja": "Greninja appears and vanishes with a ninja's grace, and Mega Evolution makes its swift, toying movements even harder to follow. You're bold and level-headed, keeping cool and calm. When you transform, you become lightning-quick and razor-sharp, striking at exactly the right moment with complete confidence.",
  "Bunnelby": "Bunnelby uses its large ears like shovels and will dig the whole night through, managing a nest thirty-three feet deep in a single night. You quietly get things done. Practical and sweet-natured, modest about your efforts with the odd moody day, you're a hard worker, and people appreciate just how dependable you are.",
  "Diggersby": "Diggersby's ears are so strong they can lift boulders weighing over a ton, and it's often used to help clear land on construction sites. You're practical and sweet-natured, an everyday hero with the occasional moody day. You've got hidden strength, and you're always willing to lend a hand with the heavy lifting.",
  "Fletchling": "Fletchling's song is beautiful and melodic, but it's fiercely territorial and will relentlessly chase off any intruder that wanders too close. You've got a cheerful voice that lifts people's spirits. Bright and warm, you love to soar, but you're guarded about your space and you'll defend it fiercely if someone oversteps.",
  "Fletchinder": "Fletchinder's body heat rises as it flies, and the hotter it gets, the faster it can fly, chasing prey with blazing speed. You're young at heart and warm, with an edgy, natural streak. The more fired up you get about something, the faster you move towards it, and nobody can keep up.",
  "Talonflame": "Talonflame zooms at its prey at close to three hundred and ten miles per hour, while fiery embers scatter from the gaps in its feathers. You're city-minded and genuine, guarded with an edgy streak. When you see an opportunity, you commit to it instantly and completely, and nobody can match your speed or focus.",
  "Scatterbug": "Scatterbug spews a poisonous black powder when bird Pokémon attack, and the powder covering its body regulates its temperature so it can live in any climate. You're unhurried and compact, moody with an edgy streak. You've been quietly shaped by your environment, and you have your own ways of protecting yourself while you grow.",
  "Spewpa": "Spewpa's hard body is covered in fur that it bristles to scare off enemies, and it stays still while it prepares to evolve. You're thoughtful and modest, grounded with moody moments. You're quietly working on yourself, and while you might seem prickly, you're on the verge of something beautiful.",
  "Vivillon": "Vivillon's wing patterns differ depending on where it was born, and there are over a dozen different patterns around the world. You're thoughtful and bright, a free spirit who loves the outdoors. You carry a little bit of your home with you wherever you go, and your unique colours make you stand out.",
  "Litleo": "Litleo is kicked out of its pride once it can hunt on its own, and the more it trains by battling mighty enemies, the hotter its mane grows. You're approachable and sweet-natured, with a fiery, guarded independence. You're ready to strike out on your own, and when something lights you up, everyone can see the glow.",
  "Pyroar": "The male Pyroar with the largest mane of fire is the leader of the pride, and during battle that mane heats up to over thirty-six hundred degrees. You're thoughtful and genuine, an everyday leader with moody moments. You protect your people fiercely, and when you're fired up, everyone feels the heat.",
  "Mega Pyroar": "Male Pyroar are usually lazy, but when a strong foe attacks, a male will protect its friends with no regard for its own safety. Your confidence becomes undeniable when you step up. Thoughtful and genuine, a down-to-earth leader with moody moments, you transform into someone people rally behind without hesitation.",
  "Flabébé": "Flabébé finds a flower it likes and stays with it for life, floating on the breeze while holding its stem. You're good-natured and light-hearted, bright with classic charm. Once you've found something or someone you love, you stay loyal to them forever, drifting through life side by side.",
  "Floette": "Floette flutters around fields of flowers and cares for the ones that are starting to wilt, giving its own power to them. You're the quiet caretaker. Bright and practical, a little guarded with a natural gentleness, you notice when something or someone is struggling, and you patiently help them bloom again.",
  "Mega Floette": "Floette pours its heart into caring for flowers and never forgives anyone who messes up a flower bed, and Mega Evolution draws out even more of the hidden power of flowers. You're grounded and sweet-natured, an everyday soul with remarkable depth. When you transform, your nurturing spirit becomes something truly powerful and life-giving.",
  "Florges": "Florges creates beautiful flower gardens and is said to live for hundreds of years, protecting its gardens fiercely. You're bright and genuine, ambitious with a light-hearted touch. You put your heart into building something beautiful and lasting, and you protect what you've created with real devotion.",
  "Skiddo": "Skiddo was one of the first Pokémon to live alongside people, and it can make energy from sunlight using the leaves on its back. You're approachable and level-headed, a good-natured soul who loves the outdoors. You draw energy from the simple, natural things in life, and people find your company easy and uplifting.",
  "Gogoat": "Gogoat can sense the feelings of the person riding it by reading their grip on its horns, and it lives in mountain herds. You're thoughtful and warm-blooded, with an edgy, moody side. You read people closely, often understanding what they need before they say a word, and you carry them steadily up the steepest paths.",
  "Pancham": "Pancham does its best to look intimidating, glaring at opponents, but it can't help breaking into a smile when it's patted on the head. You like people to think you're tough. Bold, hands-on and full of fiery brightness, you put on a stern face, but your warm, playful side always slips out eventually.",
  "Pangoro": "Pangoro is short-tempered but loyal, and it holds a leaf in its mouth to sense the movements of its opponents. You're bold and bright, fiery with a mischievous edge. You might seem a little rough around the edges, but you're incredibly loyal, and you'll always have your friends' backs.",
  "Furfrou": "Furfrou's fur can be trimmed into different styles, and in the past it was given the job of guarding royalty. Warm-blooded and city-minded, you have a natural, classic elegance. You know how to present yourself beautifully, and people trust you with the things and people that matter most.",
  "Espurr": "Espurr's psychic power is so strong that it has to fold its ears down to keep it in, otherwise it would leak out uncontrollably. You're young at heart and light-hearted, with an intuitive, moody depth. You feel things more intensely than people realise, and you've learned to keep a lid on it most of the time.",
  "Meowstic": "Meowstic keeps the eye-patterned organs in its ears folded down, because when it opens them, it unleashes psychic power strong enough to crush things. You're an everyday, light-hearted soul with a moody, intuitive side. You keep your full power tucked away, revealing it only when it's truly needed.",
  "Mega Meowstic": "When Meowstic is in danger, it raises its ears and releases enough psychic power to grind a ten-ton truck into dust, and Mega Evolution sets that power even freer. You're light-hearted and ambitious, an everyday spirit with deep intuition. When you transform, you let your inner power out at last, and people are amazed by what you can do.",
  "Honedge": "Honedge was born when a spirit possessed an ancient sword, and it wraps its blue cloth around people's arms to drain their energy. You're young at heart and warm-blooded, unhurried with a love of tech. You've got an old soul in a sharp, modern form, and you know how to hold on to people.",
  "Doublade": "When Honedge evolves, it splits into two swords, and the pair communicate telepathically, working together in perfect coordination. You're seasoned and warm-blooded, unhurried with a love of tech. You've learned that two minds are better than one, and you work best when you're in perfect sync with someone you trust.",
  "Aegislash": "Legend says whoever Aegislash recognises is destined to become king, and generations of kings were attended by it, though it used its spectral power to manipulate people. You're steady and warm-blooded, tech-minded with warm tastes. You have a regal, dependable presence, and people trust your judgement about who has what it takes to lead.",
  "Spritzee": "Spritzee gives off a fragrance that noblewomen once wore in place of perfume, and its scent changes depending on what it's been eating. You leave a lasting impression. Bright, approachable and quietly independent, you have a presence that lingers in a room long after you've moved on to the next one.",
  "Aromatisse": "Aromatisse can produce scents ranging from sweet smells that bolster its allies to foul ones that sap an opponent's will to fight. Approachable and grounded, with a bright, ambitious streak, you know how to set the mood in any room, and you have a natural gift for making people feel exactly what you want them to.",
  "Swirlix": "Swirlix eats its weight in sugar every day, and its fur is so sweet and sticky that it smells like cotton candy. You're light-hearted and compact, sweet-natured with a cool style. You've got a sweet tooth for life's simple pleasures, and your sugary, cheerful energy makes everyone around you smile.",
  "Slurpuff": "Slurpuff's sense of smell is a hundred million times better than a human's, and pastry chefs rely on it to sniff out the finest ingredients. You've got an incredible nose for quality. Approachable, light-hearted and sweet, with plenty of experience, you're the person everyone trusts to tell them what's genuinely good.",
  "Inkay": "Inkay flashes the glowing spots on its body to confuse foes, and the strange lights are said to drain away their will to fight. You've got a disarming charm. Light-hearted, bright and intuitive, you adapt quickly, and you know how to defuse tense situations with playful, unpredictable energy before they ever turn into conflict.",
  "Malamar": "Malamar uses hypnotic flashing lights to control the minds of its prey, and it's said to be the most powerful hypnotist of all Pokémon. You're grounded and genuine, quick with a warm-blooded intensity. You've got an incredibly persuasive presence, and people find themselves agreeing with you before they even realise it.",
  "Mega Malamar": "Malamar wields the most compelling hypnotic powers of any Pokémon, luring prey close with hypnotic motions, and it's said to have played a role in certain history-changing events. You keep your influence understated most of the time. Quick and warm-blooded, when you transform, your persuasive, magnetic presence becomes almost impossible to resist.",
  "Binacle": "Two Binacle adhere themselves to one rock and live together, cooperating to gather food at high tide, but if they fight, one of them moves to a different rock. You're unhurried and grounded, with a cool, calm patience. You know how to share your space with others, and you're happy to compromise to keep the peace.",
  "Barbaracle": "Barbaracle is made up of seven Binacle working together, with the head giving orders to the limbs, though they don't always listen. Good-natured and practical, you're seasoned and down-to-earth. You're happiest leading a team, and you know how to bring different personalities together to get things done.",
  "Mega Barbaracle": "Barbaracle's hands and legs have minds of their own and can move independently, but they usually follow the head's orders, and in a pinch they all act to ensure the enemy's defeat. You're good-natured with classic, warm tastes. When you transform, you bring every part of yourself into alignment, and you become far stronger than the sum of your parts.",
  "Skrelp": "Skrelp disguises itself as rotten kelp to hide from enemies, drifting along until it's strong enough to evolve. You're unhurried and grounded, with a warm, mischievous streak. You're happy to lie low while you're still finding your feet, quietly biding your time until you're ready to show what you can do.",
  "Dragalge": "Dragalge's poison is so potent it can corrode the hulls of ships, and it's said to attack any boat that strays into its waters. You're warm-blooded and natural, genuine with warm tastes. You guard your territory fiercely, and anyone who crosses your boundaries quickly learns how serious you are.",
  "Mega Dragalge": "Tales are told of ships that wander into seas where Dragalge live and never return, and Mega Evolution only adds to that fearsome reputation. You're warm-blooded and natural, with a transformative strength. When you change, your protective instincts become powerful, and nobody dares to cross the lines you draw.",
  "Clauncher": "Clauncher fires pressurised water from its oversized claw with enough force to knock down flying prey. Good-natured and steady, you keep a cool and calm head. You might seem quiet, but you've got remarkable aim, and when you speak up, your words land exactly where you meant them to.",
  "Clawitzer": "Clawitzer's right arm is a cannon that launches projectiles of seawater powerful enough to sink a tanker, and it uses the feelers on its claw to detect prey first. You've built up real power through experience. Seasoned and ambitious, with a cool style, you adapt to whatever challenge comes your way, and when you finally act, people feel the impact.",
  "Helioptile": "Helioptile lives in the desert, and it soaks up sunlight with the frills on its head, turning it into enough electricity to survive without food. You're young at heart and bright, fiery with a love of tech. You draw energy from the sunny side of life, and you're endlessly resourceful in making the most of it.",
  "Heliolisk": "Heliolisk spreads its frill to generate electricity from sunlight, and a single one can power a whole skyscraper. You're quick and thoughtful, genuine with a love of tech. You've got enormous potential, and when you open yourself up to the world, you have the power to light up everything around you.",
  "Tyrunt": "Tyrunt's huge jaws can crunch through cars, and it throws tantrums when it doesn't get its own way, earning it a reputation as a little tyrant. You're young at heart and level-headed, with a warm-blooded love of the outdoors. You've got a strong will and a powerful bite, but you're learning to channel that energy wisely.",
  "Tyrantrum": "Tyrantrum ruled the ancient world like a king, its powerful jaws able to tear through thick metal as if it were paper. You carry yourself with a natural authority. Genuine and grounded, a free spirit who loves the outdoors, you don't need to boast about your strength, because everyone can already feel it.",
  "Amaura": "Amaura was revived from a fossil frozen in ice, and it lived in cold lands where there were no predators, so it's very calm. You keep a cool, calm head and a cool sense of style. A little elusive, you move through life gently and peacefully, untroubled by the things that make other people anxious.",
  "Aurorus": "Aurorus's diamond-shaped crystals can instantly create a wall of ice to block attacks, and it's said that when this usually quiet and kindly Pokémon howls, auroras appear in the night sky. You've got a classic, thoughtful grace. Tireless and happiest outdoors, you create something beautiful wherever you go, and people find your quiet radiance hard to look away from.",
  "Sylveon": "Sylveon wraps its ribbon-like feelers around the arm of its Trainer, using them to sense feelings and calm anyone who's upset. You're sweet-natured and thoughtful, with an unhurried, slightly elusive charm. You have a gift for soothing people's worries, and you instinctively know when someone needs a little comfort.",
  "Hawlucha": "Hawlucha is a natural showman that always strikes a pose before its finishing move, leaping from high places to deliver dramatic aerial attacks. You're modest at heart, but you know how to put on a show. City-minded and a little guarded, you're a free spirit who loves a bit of flair, and you always give the crowd something to remember.",
  "Mega Hawlucha": "Hawlucha uses its wings to control its position in the air and likes to attack from above, a manoeuvre that's difficult to defend against. You're bold and approachable, with a fiery competitive streak. When you transform, you step into the spotlight with total confidence, and the crowd can't help but cheer.",
  "Dedenne": "Dedenne uses its whiskers like antennae to communicate over long distances, and it sneaks into homes to steal electricity from sockets. You're bright and sweet-natured, with a seasoned, tech-minded curiosity. You're always connected to the people you care about, and you've got a cheeky knack for finding energy wherever you go.",
  "Carbink": "Carbink was born deep underground from intense heat and pressure, and it's thought to have slept there for hundreds of millions of years. You've been shaped by pressure into something beautiful. Compact and steady, guarded with moody moments, you have an enduring, timeless quality that people find quietly fascinating.",
  "Goomy": "Goomy is said to be the weakest Dragon Pokémon, and it covers itself in a slimy membrane so that attacks slide right off. You're light-hearted and modest, a grounded free spirit. People might underestimate you, but you've got a way of letting criticism slide off you, and you're quietly growing into something much stronger.",
  "Sliggoo": "Sliggoo's eyes devolved, so it can't see anything, and instead its four horns act as a high-performance radar that senses sounds and smells. You're light-hearted and ambitious, a grounded free spirit. You find your way in life by trusting your instincts rather than what's right in front of you.",
  "Hisuian Sliggoo": "Hisuian Sliggoo is prone to melancholy, and its metal shell is thought to have formed when its slime reacted with the iron in Hisui's water. Your surroundings gave you armour. Grounded and independent, with a love of tech, you've grown a tough exterior to protect your softer side, and people learn to respect your boundaries.",
  "Goodra": "Goodra is incredibly affectionate, hugging its Trainer so tightly that they end up covered in its slime. You're a free spirit, genuine and approachable with a level head. You show your love openly and wholeheartedly, and the people around you never doubt how much you care.",
  "Hisuian Goodra": "Hisuian Goodra can freely control how hard its metal shell is, yet underneath it hates being alone and is famously clingy with the people it loves. You've got armour and a soft heart. Independent on the surface, an everyday soul who loves tech and was shaped by where you live, you secretly thrive on closeness and company.",
  "Klefki": "Klefki collects keys and never lets them go, and it's said to use them to protect itself and to keep valuables safe. You're quick and grounded, sweet-natured with a love of tech. You're the trustworthy keeper of secrets, and people know their precious things are safe with you.",
  "Phantump": "Phantump is said to be the spirit of a child lost in the forest, and it lures adults deeper into the woods with a childlike cry. You're hands-on and warm, elusive with an edgy streak. You've got a playful, slightly spooky charm, and people find themselves following you down unexpected paths.",
  "Trevenant": "Trevenant controls trees by plugging its roots into them, and it's said to protect the forest, cursing anyone who harms it. You're a mischievous, everyday soul who's hands-on and adaptable. You're fiercely protective of the places and people you love, and anyone who disrespects them will regret it.",
  "Pumpkaboo": "Pumpkaboo's pumpkin body is inhabited by a spirit trapped in this world, and it's said to carry wandering spirits to the place where they belong so they can move on. You're steady and ambitious, with a moody, mischievous streak. You've got a spooky, playful side, and you're always lighting the way for people who feel a little lost.",
  "Gourgeist": "Gourgeist sings in an eerie voice on nights with a new moon, and it's said that anyone who hears its song is cursed. You've got warm, classic tastes with a mischievous, guarded edge. You have a haunting, unforgettable presence, and people can't help but be drawn to your mysterious charm.",
  "Bergmite": "Bergmite lives on snowy mountains, and it coats its body in ice that it creates by blowing cold air, so it can repair any cracks. You're grounded and practical, with an edgy, affectionate side. You know how to protect yourself, and you're always quietly patching yourself up after a tough day.",
  "Avalugg": "Avalugg's body is as solid as an iceberg, and it carries groups of Bergmite on its flat back as it crosses the frozen sea. You're the one people lean on. Calm, with classic values and a hands-on, guarded nature, you're a steady, dependable presence, carrying the people you love through the coldest stretches of life.",
  "Hisuian Avalugg": "The ice armour covering Hisuian Avalugg's lower jaw puts steel to shame and shatters rocks with ease, and it barrels along steep mountain paths, cleaving through everything in its way. Your surroundings made you tough. Calm and hands-on, a little guarded but always dependable, you're the person who forges ahead through difficult conditions so others can follow safely.",
  "Noibat": "Noibat lives in pitch-black caves, and it uses ultrasonic waves from its huge ears to find its way and stun its prey. You're unhurried and grounded, with a warm-blooded, soaring spirit. You trust your senses to guide you through uncertain times, and you're always ready to take flight when the moment is right.",
  "Noivern": "Noivern's ears emit ultrasonic waves that can pulverise boulders, and it flies through the darkness in search of prey. You're thoughtful and ambitious, an everyday hero who's completely genuine. You've got a powerful voice, and when you choose to use it, people can't help but listen.",
  "Xerneas": "Xerneas is said to give eternal life, and when its horns shine in seven colours, it's sharing its life energy with the world. You're bold and quick, a legendary spirit with a practical outlook. You bring energy and vitality to everything you do, and you give generously to the people around you.",
  "Yveltal": "When Yveltal's wings and tail feathers spread wide and glow red, it absorbs the life force of living creatures, and when its life ends, it turns into a cocoon once more. You're ambitious and warm-toned, a legendary spirit with a mischievous edge. You have an intense, powerful presence, and people feel the weight of your influence, even when you're quiet.",
  "Zygarde": "Zygarde watches over the ecosystem, and it's said to appear when the balance of nature is threatened. You're a legendary free spirit, genuine and a little guarded. You care deeply about keeping things in balance, and you step in quietly when you sense that something is going wrong.",
  "Mega Zygarde": "When Zygarde Mega Evolves, the cells that make up its body come together into its most complete form, ready to restore balance at any cost. You're a tireless, legendary free spirit. When you transform, you become an unstoppable guardian, using everything you've got to protect what matters.",
  "Diancie": "Diancie can instantly create many diamonds by compressing the carbon in the air between its hands. You're seasoned and sweet-natured, a legendary spirit who loves the outdoors. You have a gift for creating beauty out of the simplest things, and people are dazzled by your warmth.",
  "Mega Diancie": "Diancie is a sudden transformation of Carbink, and its pink, glimmering body is said to be the loveliest sight in the whole world, a sparkle that Mega Evolution only intensifies. You're hands-on and affectionate, a level-headed spirit with legendary warmth. When you transform, your inner brilliance shines through, and you light up every room you walk into.",
  "Hoopa": "Hoopa uses its rings to open portals to distant places, and it's said to steal anything it likes and hide it away. You're compact and intuitive, elusive with moody moments. You've got a mischievous, unpredictable streak, and you have a way of showing up in the most unexpected places.",
  "Volcanion": "Volcanion expels steam from the arms on its back with enough power to blow away a mountain, and it's said to live deep in mountains where humans never tread. You're hands-on and unhurried, a legendary soul with moody moments. You value your privacy, but when you do let off steam, it's powerful enough to blow everyone away.",
  "Rowlet": "Rowlet builds up energy through photosynthesis during the day, then flies silently through the night sky, on the prowl for prey. You're a free spirit, young at heart and a little guarded. You've got a quiet, observant nature, and you're always aware of everything happening around you.",
  "Dartrix": "Dartrix is a bit of a snob, obsessed with grooming its feathers, and it throws sharp feather blades at its opponents with precision. You're a free spirit with a seasoned, slightly moody side. You take pride in how you present yourself, and you're more precise and capable than people give you credit for.",
  "Decidueye": "Decidueye fires arrow quills with incredible precision, and it's said to be able to hit a pebble from over a hundred yards away. You're down-to-earth and natural, with a mischievous, moody edge. You're cool and composed, and when you take aim at something, you hit your mark every time.",
  "Hisuian Decidueye": "Hisuian Decidueye's feathers trap air inside them to insulate it against Hisui's bitter cold, which is seen as proof that environment shapes evolution. You've been shaped by where you come from. Down-to-earth and good-natured, with a natural toughness, you've grown exactly the protection you needed to thrive in difficult conditions.",
  "Litten": "Litten grooms itself constantly, and the fur it licks off is so oily that it can be set alight and spat out as fire. You're bold and natural, practical with an elusive streak. You keep yourself to yourself, but you've got a fiery spirit that comes out when you need it most.",
  "Torracat": "Torracat has a bell of fire at its throat, and it rings brightly every time it spits out flames. You're bold and bright, with an edgy, slightly elusive streak. You might seem a little prickly at first, but when you're fired up, everyone hears it, and you're fiercely loyal to the people who earn your trust.",
  "Incineroar": "Incineroar is a showman that loves to fight with flair, and its burning belt of flames gets brighter as it gets more fired up. You're bright and fiery, with a guarded, mischievous edge. You love to put on a good show, and when you're passionate about something, you blaze with an energy that's impossible to ignore.",
  "Popplio": "Popplio blows balloons out of water through its nose, using them to bounce around and practise tricks, and it works hard to perfect every one. You've got a playful, inventive streak. Bold but modest, you keep a cool, calm head, and you love entertaining people with your quirky ideas while quietly practising until they're perfect.",
  "Brionne": "Brionne dances and sings to show off its skills, and its water balloons can explode with surprising force. You're bold and ambitious, keeping cool and calm under pressure. You're a natural performer, and your talent and dedication make you shine in front of an audience.",
  "Primarina": "Primarina controls water bubbles with its voice, and it's known as a soloist whose singing leads its colony. You're bold and affectionate, sweet-natured with moody moments. You have a beautiful, captivating presence, and you use your voice to bring people together and lead them with grace.",
  "Pikipek": "Pikipek can peck a tree sixteen times a second, drilling holes where it stores berries to eat or use as ammunition. You're quick and soaring, with a cool-toned, moody side. You're always busy, and you've got a practical knack for stashing away resources for when you need them.",
  "Trumbeak": "Trumbeak can make over a hundred different sounds, and it fires seeds from its beak at opponents like bullets. You're quick and sweet-natured, a soaring spirit with moody moments. You've got a versatile voice and a sharp wit, and you know how to make yourself heard.",
  "Toucannon": "Toucannon's beak heats up to over two hundred degrees when it's fighting, and it can fire seeds powerful enough to shatter boulders. You're light-hearted and seasoned, a free spirit who loves to soar. You might seem easygoing, but when you're fired up, you can hit with surprising force.",
  "Yungoos": "Yungoos wanders around all day looking for food, and its strong teeth can crunch through almost anything, but it gets sleepy as soon as the sun sets. You're bold but modest, sweet-natured and hands-on. You throw yourself into each day with real energy, and you never pretend to be anything other than who you are.",
  "Gumshoos": "Gumshoos is incredibly patient, staking out its prey for hours on end and pouncing the instant it lets its guard down. Your persistence always pays off. Sweet-natured and approachable, compact in your habits and never in a rush, you know exactly how to wait for the right moment, and you rarely miss it.",
  "Grubbin": "Grubbin uses its powerful jaws to scrape away tree bark and dig into the ground, feeding on sap and storing up energy to evolve. You're building your foundations. Quick and compact, you stay grounded while your ambition quietly grows, and you're working hard now to become something much bigger later.",
  "Charjabug": "Charjabug stores electricity in its body like a battery, and campers have been known to carry one to keep their devices charged. You're incredibly useful to the people around you. Hands-on and adaptable, with a love of tech and a fiery spark, you're always ready to give your friends a boost when they're running low.",
  "Vikavolt": "Vikavolt concentrates electricity in its huge jaws and fires powerful beams, and it can fly by carrying a Charjabug as a battery. You're thoughtful and bold, with a big presence and a love of tech. You know how to channel your energy precisely, and when you finally let loose, your impact is enormous.",
  "Crabrawler": "Crabrawler punches trees to knock down berries, and it's so competitive that it'll challenge anything that crosses its path to a fight. You're quick and grounded, a moody spirit with a cool style. You've got a fierce competitive streak, and you love testing yourself against anyone willing to take you on.",
  "Crabominable": "Crabominable aimed for the top but got lost and ended up on a snowy mountain, and being forced to endure the cold, it evolved and grew fur. You keep striving for the peak. Affectionate and bright, you're hands-on and quietly understated, and even when life takes you somewhere unexpected, you adapt and make it work.",
  "Mega Crabominable": "Crabominable starts pummelling before it stops to think, and there are records of it turning back avalanches with a flurry of punches. Your quiet determination turns into real force. Calm and steady, always hands-on, you transform into someone whose sheer persistence nothing in the world can stop.",
  "Oricorio": "Oricorio changes its form and style of dance depending on the nectar it drinks, and it dances to build up its power. You're thoughtful and modest, bright with a warm-blooded heart. You adapt to whatever inspires you, and you express yourself through your own unique style of creativity.",
  "Cutiefly": "Cutiefly senses the auras of flowers to tell which are ready to bloom, and it often gathers around people whose auras are bright and flower-like. You're naturally drawn to cheerful people. Bold and light-hearted, quick yet steady, you've got a knack for spotting the best in others and buzzing around whatever is about to bloom.",
  "Ribombee": "Ribombee rolls pollen and nectar into puffs, some used as food and others in battle, and the most nutritious ones are even sold as supplements. You're quick and thoughtful, a down-to-earth soul who loves to soar. You've got a talent for making something nourishing out of simple things, and people benefit from your thoughtful care.",
  "Rockruff": "Rockruff is friendly and loyal, but it has a habit of biting, and it rubs the rocks on its neck against people to show affection. You're bold and approachable, with a natural, edgy charm. You show your love in your own unique way, and people learn to appreciate your rough-and-tumble affection.",
  "Lycanroc": "Lycanroc's mane contains sharp rocks that it uses as weapons, and it's fiercely loyal to its Trainer, always ready to protect them. You're hands-on and quick, edgy with a warm-blooded heart. You're a devoted friend, and you'll fight fiercely for the people who've earned your loyalty.",
  "Wishiwashi": "Wishiwashi is tiny and weak alone, but when danger approaches, hundreds of them gather to form a giant school that looks like a huge fish. You're seasoned and modest, adaptable with a cool style. On your own you're unassuming, but when you're with your people, you're formidable.",
  "Mareanie": "Mareanie lives on the beaches of Alola, and it attacks Corsola to eat the branches on their heads. You're mischievous with a cool style, keeping your head cool and calm. You've got a cheeky, playful side, and you're always on the lookout for something tasty to get your tentacles on.",
  "Toxapex": "Toxapex builds a dome of spiky legs to protect itself, and it's so poisonous that a single sting can cause pain for three days. Warm-blooded and bright, you've got an edgy, guarded side. You've built strong defences around yourself, and people know that if they get too close without care, they'll feel it.",
  "Mudbray": "The mud stuck to Mudbray's hooves enhances its grip, and it can be loaded with fifty times its own body weight and be totally fine. You're grounded and hands-on, with a warm, approachable nature. You don't mind getting your hands dirty, and your steady strength means people can always count on you to help carry the load.",
  "Mudsdale": "Mudsdale's hooves are covered in mud so hard it can crush a car with a single kick, and it's been used for heavy work for centuries. You're unhurried and grounded, hands-on with an edgy streak. You're incredibly dependable, and your powerful work ethic has earned you deep respect.",
  "Dewpider": "Dewpider carries a water bubble on its head, and it comes up onto land to search for food while keeping its head dry. You're approachable and cool-toned, keeping cool and calm. You bring a little bit of your comfort zone with you wherever you go, and that helps you explore new places with confidence.",
  "Araquanid": "Araquanid carries a bubble of water on its head, using it to protect its weaker friends or to headbutt and trap prey. You look after the vulnerable. Steady and affectionate, you stay cool and calm when others panic, and you create a safe space for the people you love, shielding them from whatever's going on outside.",
  "Fomantis": "Fomantis sleeps during the day, soaking up sunlight through its leaves, and moves at night to find a safe place to sleep the next day. You're bold and outdoorsy, with a bright, warm sense of style. You charge up on the good things in life, and you always plan ahead for your next safe haven.",
  "Lurantis": "Lurantis needs a lot of time and effort to keep the colours of its petals vivid, and it's so elegant that some call it the most glamorous Grass Pokémon of all. You're unhurried and outdoorsy, with a natural, bright charm. You take pride in your appearance, and you've got an effortless elegance that makes you stand out.",
  "Morelull": "Morelull scatters glowing spores at night, and anyone who watches the gentle, flickering light soon drifts off into a deep sleep. You've got a soothing presence. Unhurried and sweet-natured, compact with the occasional moody spell, you have a way of making people feel relaxed, safe and ready to rest whenever they're near you.",
  "Shiinotic": "Shiinotic's glowing spores are said to cause sleep, and people who get lost in the forest at night are often led astray by its light. You're light-hearted and genuine, with a cool, guarded charm. You've got a mesmerising quality, and people find themselves following you without quite knowing why.",
  "Salandit": "Salandit lives near volcanoes and releases a sweet-smelling toxic gas that makes anyone who breathes it dizzy, luring prey in close. You've got a magnetic, slightly dangerous charm. Approachable and affectionate, fiery with moody moments, people find themselves drawn towards your warmth, even when they suspect they should be careful.",
  "Salazzle": "Salazzle are always female, and each one leads a group of males, using its alluring pheromones to make them do its bidding. You've got a commanding presence. Classic in style and fiery in spirit, with an edgy, mischievous streak, you have people happily following your lead before they've even noticed they've agreed.",
  "Stufful": "Stufful hates being hugged or touched in any way, and when it gets angry and flails about, its arms and legs could knock a pro wrestler sprawling. You're light-hearted and compact, sweet-natured with a warm style. You might look cuddly, but you know your own mind, and you're stronger than anyone would guess.",
  "Bewear": "Bewear is immensely strong, and when it shows affection it waves its arms and hugs its friends so tightly that it can accidentally crush them. You love your people fiercely. Bright and level-headed, with a genuine, down-to-earth warmth, your enthusiasm and affection can be a little overwhelming, but nobody ever doubts that they're meant.",
  "Bounsweet": "Bounsweet's body gives off a sweet, fruity scent that's extremely appetising to bird Pokémon, but it's not intelligent enough to care. You're approachable and outdoorsy, with a cool style and a warm-blooded heart. You've got a naturally sweet nature that draws people in, and you're happiest when you're out in the sunshine.",
  "Steenee": "Steenee swings the calyx on its head like a weapon, and it's said that its sweet scent makes people feel happy and relaxed. You're modest and practical, with an edgy, moody streak. You've got a sweet side that people love, but you're not afraid to swing back when someone underestimates you.",
  "Tsareena": "Tsareena delivers powerful kicks with its long legs, and it's said to be proud and haughty, looking down on anyone who's weaker. You're quick and modest, with a moody, outdoorsy spirit. You hold yourself to high standards, and your elegant strength makes people sit up and take notice.",
  "Comfey": "Comfey collects flowers and weaves them into a garland, which gives off a soothing aroma that calms anyone who smells it. You're hands-on and compact, with a cool-toned, warm-blooded charm. You have a gift for creating something calming and beautiful, and people feel better just being near you.",
  "Oranguru": "Oranguru skilfully gives instructions to other Pokémon with waves of its leaf-and-fur fan, and if it comes across a wounded Pokémon, it gathers medicinal herbs to treat it. You're bright and modest, with an intuitive, sweet-natured heart. People come to you for advice and support, and your quiet wisdom helps them find their way.",
  "Passimian": "Passimian live in groups of about twenty, and they work together to hunt, with each one playing an important role. You're bright and genuine, good-natured with a fiery team spirit. You're happiest when you're working towards a shared goal, and you know how to bring out the best in everyone around you.",
  "Wimpod": "Wimpod is incredibly timid, running away at the slightest sign of danger, and it uses its many legs to scuttle off quickly. You've got a big presence, but you stay cool and calm, adaptable to any situation. You might prefer to avoid trouble, but you're quick on your feet when you need to be.",
  "Golisopod": "Golisopod spends most of its time quietly in underwater caves, but with one flash of its huge claws it can slice seawater, or even the air, clean in two. You're gentler than you look. Affectionate and light-hearted, with a genuinely good nature, you'd rather keep the peace, but you can act with startling speed when it counts.",
  "Mega Golisopod": "Golisopod's shell is as hard as diamond, and it will do anything to win, seizing every opening and finishing foes with the small claws on its front legs. You've got classic values with a love of good tech. When you transform, you step out of your shell and into the spotlight, revealing a sleek, powerful version of yourself.",
  "Sandygast": "Sandygast is born from the grudges of Pokémon that died on the beach, and it controls the people who put their hand in its mouth. You're ambitious and adaptable, mischievous with moody moments. You've got a quirky, slightly spooky side, and you have a surprising amount of influence over people.",
  "Palossand": "Palossand builds itself up by drawing people and Pokémon into its sandcastle body, and it gets stronger the more it absorbs. You're a mischievous, everyday soul who's adaptable and thoughtful. You keep building yourself up over time, and you draw strength from the people around you.",
  "Pyukumuku": "Pyukumuku lies around on warm beaches, and if anything threatens it, it shoots its internal organs out of its mouth and uses them to punch back. You've got an unconventional way of handling trouble. Light-hearted and down-to-earth, good-natured but a little guarded, you seem harmless right up until someone surprises you.",
  "Type: Null": "Type: Null is a synthetic Pokémon weapon developed for a specific mission, and it wears a heavy control mask to restrain its power in case it goes on a rampage. You're elusive and ambitious, a grounded spirit with a legendary potential. You've got a lot of power that you're still learning to control, and you're determined to find your true purpose.",
  "Silvally": "A strong bond of trust with its Trainer let Silvally destroy the control mask that held it back, awakening the hidden strength to change its type at will. You've learned to embrace who you really are. Level-headed and sweet-natured, unhurried with the odd moody day, you adapt to any situation with a quiet confidence that's been hard won.",
  "Minior": "Minior is formed from tiny particles in the ozone layer, and its core is protected by a hard shell that breaks open when it falls to the ground. You're good-natured and practical, a seasoned free spirit. You've got a colourful heart hidden beneath a tough exterior, and people are delighted when they finally see it.",
  "Komala": "Komala spends its whole life asleep, clinging to a log its parents gave it, and it even moves and eats in its sleep. You're affectionate and ambitious, a natural, city-minded soul. You've got an easygoing, dreamy charm, and you somehow manage to get things done while staying completely relaxed.",
  "Turtonator": "Turtonator's shell is covered in explosive spikes, and if anything touches its back, it explodes. You're seasoned and practical, guarded with an edgy streak. You've got strong defences, and people know not to poke at you, because you can explode if you're pushed too far.",
  "Togedemaru": "Togedemaru's spiky fur stands on end when it's charged with electricity, and it uses the tuft on its head as a lightning rod. You're fiery and tech-minded, a city-minded spirit with moody moments. You soak up energy from the world around you, and you're bristling with enthusiasm when you're fired up.",
  "Mimikyu": "Mimikyu hides under a rag disguised as Pikachu, because it longs to be loved, and anyone who sees its true form is said to fall ill. You're an everyday, city-minded soul, seasoned and genuine. You want to be loved for who you are, and you're working on finding the courage to show the world your true self.",
  "Bruxish": "Bruxish grinds its teeth with great force to stimulate its brain, then fires psychic energy from the protuberance on its head as the grating sound echoes all around. You're calm and bold, intuitive with warm tastes. You've got a striking presence, and when you put your mind to something, everyone hears about it.",
  "Drampa": "Drampa lives high in the mountains and rarely comes down, but it adores children and is known to fly into towns just to play with them. You've got a gentle, grandparent-like warmth. Seasoned, sweet-natured and completely genuine, you make people feel safe and cared for, and you never tire of making time for the young ones.",
  "Mega Drampa": "When Drampa Mega Evolves, its cloud-like mane billows out even further, and its breath grows strong enough to blow away anything that threatens the children it loves. Your protective side runs deep. Seasoned and sweet-natured, with a warm-blooded heart, you transform into a fierce guardian the moment someone you care about needs you.",
  "Dhelmise": "Dhelmise is the spirit of seaweed that possessed a sunken ship's anchor, and it swings the anchor to capture huge prey. You're bright and light-hearted, a grounded soul with a big presence. You've taken something heavy and made it a source of strength, and you carry it with surprising ease.",
  "Jangmo-o": "Jangmo-o smacks its scales to express its feelings, and it lives in mountains far from people, growing a little stronger each time it battles others of its kind. You're good-natured and city-minded, an elusive free spirit. You're dedicated to becoming the best version of yourself, and you're not afraid to put in the work.",
  "Hakamo-o": "Hakamo-o sheds and regrows its scales continuously, and each time they grow back harder and sharper than before. You're quick and level-headed, a free spirit with a cool style. You're always pushing your limits, and you're determined to grow stronger with every challenge you take on.",
  "Kommo-o": "Kommo-o's scales are so hard that they can be used as weapons, and it clangs them together loudly to intimidate opponents. You're a free spirit with big ambitions, guarded and city-minded. You've worked hard to become who you are, and you're not afraid to make some noise to let people know it.",
  "Tapu Koko": "Tapu Koko is the guardian deity of Melemele Island, and it's known for being curious and easily angered, though it forgets its anger quickly. You're seasoned and good-natured, a legendary spirit with a love of tech. You have a fiery spark, but you don't hold grudges, and you're always quick to forgive.",
  "Tapu Lele": "Tapu Lele is the guardian deity of Akala Island, and it scatters glowing scales that heal people and Pokémon, though it can be cruel and innocent at once. You're affectionate and intuitive, a legendary spirit with a guarded side. You have a healing presence, but you're complicated, and people don't always know which side of you they'll get.",
  "Tapu Bulu": "Tapu Bulu, the lazy guardian deity of Ula'ula, makes ringing sounds with its tail to let others know where it is and avoid unneeded conflicts, but it's violent enough to crush anyone it sees as an enemy. You're quick and ambitious, a legendary spirit who loves the outdoors. You might seem laid-back most of the time, but when something matters, you unleash an extraordinary amount of energy.",
  "Tapu Fini": "Tapu Fini, the guardian deity of Poni, lives deep within a thick fog, and people say it can create pure water that will wash away any uncleanness. You're affectionate and practical, a legendary spirit with a guarded side. You have a calming, healing influence, and people feel clearer-headed after spending time with you.",
  "Cosmog": "Cosmog is said to have come from another world, and it's so light and fluffy that the slightest breeze can blow it away. Young at heart and bold, you've got a warm-blooded, intuitive nature. You've got an otherworldly innocence, and you're endlessly curious about the world around you.",
  "Cosmoem": "Cosmoem hardly moves, but inside its hard shell, it's gathering the energy it needs to evolve into a legendary Pokémon. Young at heart but guarded, you're intuitive and grounded. You might seem still, but you're quietly preparing for something huge, and the world will be amazed when you're ready.",
  "Solgaleo": "Light radiates from Solgaleo's body so intensely that it can make the darkest night as bright as midday, and when its third eye activates, it departs for another world. You're bold and quick, a legendary spirit with deep intuition. You bring light and warmth into every room, and you have a way of opening up new possibilities for the people around you.",
  "Lunala": "Lunala is said to live in another world, and its wings absorb light, plunging the bright day into the darkness of night. You're intuitive and bold, with a cool style and classic values. You have a calming, mysterious presence, and you can turn even the most chaotic situation into a peaceful, quiet night.",
  "Nihilego": "Nihilego is an Ultra Beast that came from another world, and it can take over people's minds, making them act violently. You're thoughtful and independent, an everyday soul who loves the outdoors. You've got an otherworldly mystery about you, and people are fascinated by your quiet, enigmatic nature.",
  "Buzzwole": "Buzzwole is an Ultra Beast with incredible strength, and it's said to show off its muscles to anyone who'll watch. You're hands-on and independent, an everyday soul who loves the outdoors. You're proud of the work you've put into yourself, and you're happy to show people what you're capable of.",
  "Pheromosa": "Pheromosa is an Ultra Beast with incredibly fast, graceful movements, and it's said to be so wary of germs that it won't touch anything. You're independent and genuine, an everyday soul with a natural elegance. You've got your own way of doing things, and you hold yourself to incredibly high standards.",
  "Xurkitree": "Xurkitree is an Ultra Beast that's believed to have come from another world, and it absorbs electricity from power plants to fuel its body. You're modest and fiery, down-to-earth with a love of tech. You draw energy from the world around you, and you can light up a room with your electric personality.",
  "Celesteela": "Celesteela is an Ultra Beast that can fly at high speeds by expelling gas from its arms, and it's said to resemble a rocket. You're level-headed and free-spirited, tech-minded with moody moments. You're always reaching for the stars, and you've got the drive to blast off towards your dreams.",
  "Kartana": "Kartana is an Ultra Beast whose body is made of paper-thin blades, and it can slice clean through a steel tower with a single swing. You're sharp and decisive. Independent and bright, with real ambition and a hands-on approach, you cut straight through problems without hesitation, while others are still folding the plan.",
  "Guzzlord": "Guzzlord is an Ultra Beast with a bottomless appetite, said to devour everything in sight, from buildings to entire mountains, and still not feel full. You've got a huge appetite for life. Level-headed but free-spirited, natural with moody moments, you're always hungry for new experiences, and no challenge seems too big to take on.",
  "Necrozma": "Necrozma is said to have been born in another world, and it absorbs light to fuel its power, constantly searching for more. You're down-to-earth and intuitive, level-headed with moody moments. You're always seeking something brighter, and you have a deep, almost cosmic drive to find what you're missing.",
  "Ultra Necrozma": "Ultra Necrozma is the form it takes after absorbing overwhelming light energy, and the light pouring from its body affects living things and nature in all sorts of ways. When you're full of energy, you glow. Ambitious, genuine and deeply intuitive, you become warmly approachable, lighting up everything and everyone around you.",
  "Magearna": "Magearna is an artificial Pokémon built five hundred years ago, and the mechanical Soul-Heart inside it lets it sync with people and understand their feelings. You understand people better than they understand themselves. Independent and sweet-natured, a tech-minded soul with legendary depth, you have a uniquely caring heart.",
  "Mega Magearna": "Magearna's mechanised body is merely a vessel, and its true self is the Soul-Heart, an artificial soul that lets it synchronise with others to understand their feelings. You're bold and grounded, sweet-natured with a legendary heart. When you transform, your care for others becomes your greatest source of power.",
  "Mega Magearna (Original)": "Magearna's Original Colour reflects how it looked when it was first presented to a king's daughter five hundred years ago, its vivid decoration proof that it was a gift to royalty. You're bold and grounded, a legendary soul with a sweet nature. You honour where you came from, and your classic, timeless spirit shines through.",
  "Marshadow": "Marshadow hides in people's shadows, copying their movements and abilities, and it's rarely seen because it's so shy. You're bold and natural, an independent spirit with legendary depth. You learn by watching others, and you have a quiet, observant way of picking up skills that's truly remarkable.",
  "Poipole": "Poipole is an Ultra Beast that's said to be friendly and curious, and it fires a sticky poison from the needle on its head. You're level-headed and independent, down-to-earth with a mischievous streak. You've got a playful, inquisitive nature, and you're always curious about the world around you.",
  "Naganadel": "Naganadel stores hundreds of litres of poisonous liquid inside its body, and it fires that glowing, immensely adhesive venom from its needles. You're a bold free spirit, seasoned with a mischievous edge. You've grown into your power, and you love soaring through life with confidence and flair.",
  "Stakataka": "Stakataka appears to be made of many life-forms stacked on top of one another, and when stone walls once started moving and attacking, this mysterious creature turned out to be the culprit. You're level-headed and hands-on, with an edgy, moody streak. You're happiest when you're part of a solid team, but when your group is threatened, you'll band together to defend it.",
  "Blacephalon": "Blacephalon makes its own head explode to surprise its opponents, then absorbs their energy while they're stunned. You're quick and thoughtful, an independent spirit with classic taste. You love to make a dramatic impression, and you're always ready to surprise people with your unpredictable ideas.",
  "Zeraora": "Zeraora races at lightning speed, building up electricity in its body and releasing it through its claws in rapid, crackling strikes. You're quick and powerful. Bold and genuine, a tech-minded spirit with legendary energy, you strike like lightning once you've set your mind on something, and you rarely need a second attempt.",
  "Mega Zeraora": "Electricity sparks from the pads on Zeraora's limbs, so wherever it runs, lightning flashes and thunder echoes, and Mega Evolution makes that storm even fiercer. You're bold and tech-minded, with a legendary edge. When you transform, your energy becomes impossible to contain, and you move faster than anyone can follow.",
  "Meltan": "Meltan dissolves and eats metal, melting iron particles in the soil to absorb into its body of molten steel, and it generates energy by circulating that liquid metal. You're grounded and independent, classic with a love of tech. You've got a resourceful, practical spirit, and you're always finding creative ways to make something out of nothing.",
  "Melmetal": "Melmetal was revered long ago for its ability to create iron from nothing, and it's said to deliver the strongest punches of any Pokémon. You're a builder at heart. Grounded and down-to-earth, with a bold, legendary streak, you love sharing your skills and making things that help other people grow.",
  "Gigantamax Melmetal": "Legends in faraway lands tell of a cyclopean giant made of metal, and it turns out that giant was really a Gigantamax Melmetal. You're the stuff of stories. Light-hearted and level-headed, with legendary staying power, when you go big and dramatic, you leave a legacy that people keep telling for generations.",
  "Grookey": "Grookey drums constantly with a special stick it carries, and the rhythm of its beating is said to bring withered plants back to life. You've got a natural, restorative rhythm. Level-headed, independent and thoroughly good-natured, you stay down-to-earth, and you bring energy and life back to the people and places around you.",
  "Thwackey": "Thwackey drums with two sticks, and the troop member who can keep the most exciting beat earns the most respect from the others. You're happiest in the zone. Independent and hands-on, level-headed with the odd moody spell, your passion and rhythm get everyone around you moving and keep the whole group going.",
  "Rillaboom": "Rillaboom leads its troop by drumming on a special stump, and the rhythm lets it control the stump's roots to fight. You lead quietly through action. Modest and level-headed, happiest outdoors, you keep your style understated, and your steady beat keeps everyone around you perfectly in sync.",
  "Gigantamax Rillaboom": "Gigantamax energy has grown Rillaboom's stump into a drum set that resembles a forest, and the beats it lays down shake all of Galar. Your quiet confidence has a huge stage presence. Modest and level-headed in daily life, when you take centre stage dramatically, your rhythm moves everyone and everything around you.",
  "Scorbunny": "Scorbunny runs around to warm up its body, and once it's warmed up, the pads on its feet heat up enough to unleash fiery kicks. You're bright and fiery, a grounded soul with a cool style. You need a little warm-up time, but once you're going, your energy is unstoppable.",
  "Raboot": "Raboot's thick, fluffy fur protects it from the cold and lets it use hotter fire moves, and it practises its footwork by juggling berries it's kicked off the trees. You're independent and fiery. Hands-on with a moody streak, you've got a cool, slightly distant exterior, yet you burn with passion once something truly fires you up.",
  "Cinderace": "Cinderace juggles pebbles with its feet, heating them until they become flaming balls that it kicks at opponents like a star striker. You've got a showman's flair. Fiery and bold, with natural talent and a slightly elusive air, you love putting on a spectacular performance, and you make the difficult stuff look easy.",
  "Gigantamax Cinderace": "Gigantamax Cinderace's fireball swells to an enormous size, blazing like a falling comet as it's sent flying into its opponent. You rise to the big occasion. Modest in everyday life, with a natural, fiery passion, when the spotlight falls on you, you turn that passion into a dramatic spectacle everyone remembers.",
  "Sobble": "Sobble is timid and turns invisible when it touches water, and when it cries, its tears are as strong as tear gas, making everyone around cry too. You're modest and independent, keeping a cool and calm surface. You're sensitive and empathetic, and your feelings are so strong that they rub off on everyone around you.",
  "Drizzile": "Drizzile is highly intelligent but also very lazy, so it keeps enemies out of its territory by laying traps everywhere and battles with water balloons made from moisture in its palms. You're independent and good-natured, thoughtful with moody moments. You've got a clever, strategic mind, and you prefer to keep your cards close to your chest.",
  "Inteleon": "Inteleon's nictitating membranes let it pick out a foe's weak points, and then it blasts them precisely with water shot from its fingertips at Mach 3. You're quick and independent, understated with moody moments. You've got a sharp eye and a cool composure, and you always hit your mark.",
  "Gigantamax Inteleon": "Gigantamax Inteleon fires water at seven times the speed of sound, using the crest on its head to read the wind and temperature before it takes aim. You become a master of precision when it counts. Quick and independent, with moody moments, you go big and dramatic by hitting targets that everyone else thought were impossibly far away.",
  "Skwovet": "Skwovet stuffs berries in its cheeks, and it's so worried about not having enough that it keeps eating even when it's full. You're bold and good-natured, a city-minded soul with warm tastes. You like to be prepared, and you've always got something stashed away for a rainy day.",
  "Greedent": "Greedent stashes so many berries in its tail that they fall out constantly, but it's a bit slow-witted, so it never even notices the loss. You're approachable and sweet-natured, light-hearted but guarded. You love collecting the things that make you happy, and you're far too busy enjoying what you've got to worry about what you've dropped along the way.",
  "Rookidee": "Rookidee is a brave bird that challenges opponents much bigger than itself, and it's known for its cheeky, energetic attitude. You're bright and edgy, a soaring spirit with a cool style. You're not afraid to punch above your weight, and your plucky determination wins people over.",
  "Corvisquire": "Corvisquire is clever enough to use tools, picking up rocks and dropping or flinging them at opponents, and it's known for its sharp intelligence. You're a creative problem-solver. Good-natured and practical, a soaring spirit with a cool style, you always find a smart way to get the job done, often with whatever happens to be lying around.",
  "Corviknight": "Corviknight is the strongest bird in Galar, and it's used as a flying taxi service, carrying passengers across the region. You're warm-blooded and genuine, tireless with a cool sense of style. You're incredibly reliable, and people know they can count on you to get them where they need to go, safely and on time.",
  "Gigantamax Corviknight": "Gigantamax Corviknight's wings whip up winds stronger than any hurricane, and the gusts from a single flap can blow away nearly anything in their path. You're warm-blooded with a cool sense of style. Usually the dependable one, when you go big and dramatic, the force of your presence sweeps everyone along with you.",
  "Blipbug": "Blipbug is a constant collector of information, and the hairs on its body act like sensors, picking up everything happening around it. You're a keen observer. Independent and grounded, good-natured with the occasional moody day, you're always quietly gathering knowledge, and you know far more about what's going on than people realise.",
  "Dottler": "Dottler barely moves inside its shell, but hiding there without food or water seems to have awakened powerful psychic abilities. Your mind works overtime while you sit still. Unhurried and grounded, with a bright, bold intelligence, you might look like you're resting, yet you're quietly preparing for something big.",
  "Orbeetle": "Orbeetle is famous for its intelligence, and it's said to use its psychic power to observe everything happening within six miles. You're an everyday, down-to-earth soul with deep intuition. You keep your talents understated, but you're always paying attention, and you see far more than people expect.",
  "Gigantamax Orbeetle": "Gigantamax Orbeetle's brain grows to an enormous size, and its psychic power becomes so strong that it can control the minds of others from far away. Your insight becomes extraordinary when you go big. An everyday, intuitive soul who usually stays understated, your dramatic side lets your influence reach people far and wide.",
  "Nickit": "Nickit is cautious and cunning, and it steals food from other Pokémon, using its tail to brush away its tracks so it can't be followed. You're approachable and city-minded, practical with an edgy streak. You're resourceful and clever, and you always know how to cover your tracks.",
  "Thievul": "Thievul marks its targets with a scent and then steals their belongings when they least expect it, and it's said to be a skilled thief. You're light-hearted and bright, mischievous with warm tastes. You've got a playful, cheeky charm, and you have a knack for getting what you want without anyone noticing.",
  "Gossifleur": "Gossifleur whirls around in the wind while singing a joyous song, a display so delightful that it has charmed many people into raising one. You're light-hearted and steady, an unhurried soul with a good nature. You've got a gentle, cheering presence, and you have a knack for lifting people's spirits when they're under the weather.",
  "Eldegoss": "Eldegoss's cotton fluff is packed with seeds, and as it travels it scatters them so that plants spring up wherever it's been. You leave the world a little better than you found it. Thoughtful and ambitious, steady in your efforts and good-natured with everyone, you plant seeds of kindness everywhere you go.",
  "Wooloo": "Wooloo's curly fleece is such an effective cushion that it could fall off a cliff and stand right back up at the bottom, unharmed. You're approachable and sweet-natured, a bright, city-minded soul. You've got a soft, cushioning presence that makes people feel safe, and you bounce back quickly from life's little tumbles.",
  "Dubwool": "Dubwool's wool is so springy that a carpet woven from it ends up closer to a trampoline, and you'll start bouncing the moment you set foot on it. You're resilient and dependable. Light-hearted and sweet, with a down-to-earth good nature, you have a warm, comforting presence that cushions the people you love from life's harder knocks.",
  "Chewtle": "Chewtle bites anything that catches its eye, and it's said that once it latches on, it won't let go until it's done. You're ambitious and approachable, good-natured with classic values. You're tenacious and determined, and you don't give up on the things you've set your heart on.",
  "Drednaw": "Drednaw's jaws are strong enough to snap through steel rods, and it's said to have a short temper, biting anything that annoys it. Grounded and bold, you're natural and good-natured underneath. You've got a powerful bite, and while you're easygoing most of the time, people learn not to test your patience.",
  "Gigantamax Drednaw": "Gigantamax energy makes Drednaw rise up on two legs, crashing down on its opponents before finishing them with its massive jaws. You find a whole new stance when it counts. Light-hearted and good-natured most of the time, with an edgy streak, you go big and dramatic by standing tall and taking on challenges that seem insurmountable.",
  "Yamper": "Yamper is a popular herding dog in Galar, and as it runs, it generates electricity from the base of its wagging tail. Your energy never seems to run out. Grounded and independent, fiery with a love of tech, your enthusiasm is infectious, and you have a knack for rounding people up and getting everyone moving in the same direction.",
  "Boltund": "Boltund channels electricity into its legs to keep them going strong, so it can easily break fifty miles per hour and run nonstop for three full days. You're grounded and bold, fiery with a love of tech. You've got incredible stamina, and once you're running towards a goal, you can keep going far longer than anyone else.",
  "Rolycoly": "Rolycoly's body is made of almost the same material as coal, and it was first discovered rolling around deep in coal mines. You're independent and grounded, good-natured with moody moments. You've got a warm, comforting presence, and you've been quietly keeping people going for longer than they realise.",
  "Carkol": "Carkol forms coal inside its body, and in the past, the coal it dropped helped fuel people's homes and lives. You're light-hearted and warm-blooded, with a cool style and moody moments. You've got a fiery heart, and you're always on the move, adapting to whatever life throws at you.",
  "Coalossal": "Coalossal's body is a walking coal mine, and it's said to be gentle unless angered, when it burns hot enough to melt rock. You're independent and natural, fiery but understated. You're calm and dependable most of the time, but when someone pushes you too far, you burn with an intensity that surprises everyone.",
  "Gigantamax Coalossal": "Gigantamax Coalossal's body becomes a colossal stove, and with Gigantamax energy stoking it, its flames burn hotter than three thousand six hundred degrees. Independent and natural, you keep your fire understated most days. But when you go big, your passion becomes overwhelming, and you blaze with an intensity that lights up everything around you.",
  "Applin": "Applin spends its life inside an apple, and it hides from bird Pokémon by pretending to be an ordinary piece of fruit. You know how to blend in. Independent, light-hearted and adaptable, you're happy to stay tucked away until you're ready, then show the world exactly what's been growing inside.",
  "Flapple": "Flapple flies using wings made from its apple shell, and it spits a strongly acidic liquid to drive off anything that comes too close. You've got a sweet exterior with real defences. Bright and light-hearted, a soaring spirit who prefers to stay understated, you know exactly how to protect yourself when someone oversteps.",
  "Gigantamax Flapple": "Gigantamax Flapple produces so much sweet nectar that when it stretches its neck, the scent alone is overpowering enough to make other Pokémon faint. Your charm becomes irresistible when you go big. Bright and light-hearted, a soaring spirit with a dramatic side, people are drawn to you like bees to honey.",
  "Appletun": "Appletun's body gives off a sweet, nectar-like scent that wafts through the air, luring in the bug Pokémon it likes to eat. You draw people in without trying. Good-natured and free-spirited, a little guarded but always understated, your gentle sweetness is the thing people remember, long after they've wandered off again.",
  "Gigantamax Appletun": "Gigantamax energy makes Appletun's nectar so thick and sticky that it acts like armour, absorbing the damage from attacks. Your sweetness is also your shield. Good-natured and free-spirited, usually guarded, when you go big and dramatic your warmth becomes a protective layer around everyone you love.",
  "Silicobra": "Silicobra swallows sand as it digs and stores more than seventeen pounds of it in its neck pouch, and its large nostrils are specialised for spraying it. You're independent and light-hearted, adaptable with a big presence. You know how to protect yourself, and you're happy to disappear when things get too much.",
  "Sandaconda": "Sandaconda can store over two hundred pounds of sand in the pouch on its neck, then blast it out of its nostrils to whip up sandstorms. You've built up reserves over time. Hands-on and adaptable, with a natural, understated manner, when you finally release what you've stored, you make a very big impression.",
  "Gigantamax Sandaconda": "Gigantamax Sandaconda's sand pouch swells to a tremendous size, and more than a million tons of sand swirl around its body in a constant storm. Your influence becomes a force of nature. Hands-on, adaptable and understated day to day, when you go big and dramatic, you reshape everything around you.",
  "Cramorant": "Cramorant is so strong that it can knock out some opponents in a single hit, but it may also forget what it's battling partway through the fight. You're an everyday free spirit, good-natured with an edgy streak. You've got a lot going on, and while you might be a little scatterbrained, people love your carefree, quirky charm.",
  "Arrokuda": "Arrokuda takes down prey by charging into them with its hard, pointed jaw, but its eyesight is poor, so the tactic has a low success rate. You give your goals everything you've got. Warm, grounded and light-hearted, you adapt well, and even when you miss the mark, you shake it off quickly and line yourself up for the next attempt.",
  "Barraskewda": "Barraskewda spins its tail fins to propel itself at over a hundred knots, then rams into prey with a jaw as sharp as a spear and as strong as steel. You're good-natured and compact, seasoned with warm tastes. You're incredibly fast and focused, and you always know how to get ahead of the competition.",
  "Toxel": "Toxel stores poison in a special sac inside its body, and it manipulates the chemicals in that poison to produce electricity. You're young at heart and fiery, with a cool style and a love of tech. You've got more energy than you know what to do with, and you're still working out how to turn your raw feelings into real power.",
  "Toxtricity": "Toxtricity plays its chest like a guitar, creating a sound that's said to be like a punk rock song, and it releases electricity with every strum. You're fiery and tech-minded, with a moody, understated cool. You express yourself through creativity, and your music, whatever form it takes, has the power to electrify people.",
  "Gigantamax Toxtricity": "Gigantamax Toxtricity can build up more electricity than any thundercloud, and that excessive electric energy is its weapon. You're a rock star at heart. Fiery and tech-minded, with a moody, dramatic flair, when you take centre stage your passion fills every corner of the room.",
  "Sizzlipede": "Sizzlipede stores flammable gas in its body, and it coils around prey, heating itself up until it's hot enough to roast them. You turn up the heat when it counts. Bold and light-hearted, quick on your feet and highly adaptable, you have a fiery energy that warms up everyone around you.",
  "Centiskorch": "When Centiskorch heats up, its body reaches around fifteen hundred degrees, and it lashes its long body like a whip before launching itself at enemies. You've got a quiet heat. Quick but grounded, adaptable and understated, people don't always notice your warmth at first, yet you can turn up the intensity in an instant.",
  "Gigantamax Centiskorch": "The heat pouring off a Gigantamax Centiskorch is so intense that it can throw the air currents out of balance and sometimes even whip up storms. You change the weather when you go big. Quick and grounded, adaptable with a dramatic side, your passion can shift the whole atmosphere of a room.",
  "Clobbopus": "Clobbopus is endlessly curious, but its way of investigating anything new is to punch it with its tentacles, and hunger for food is what lures it onto land. You learn by getting stuck in. Light-hearted and natural, adaptable with moody moments, you explore the world through trial and error and don't mind the bruises.",
  "Grapploct": "Grapploct's body is made of nothing but muscle, which makes the grappling holds it performs with its tentacles tremendously powerful. You know how to hold your own. Independent and down-to-earth, adaptable with an edgy streak, once you've got hold of something you care about, nothing can make you let go.",
  "Sinistea": "Sinistea lives in a valuable antique teacup, but however precious it is, it still tastes awful, and it drains the life force of anyone who drinks it before they can spit it out. You're thoughtful and unhurried, grounded with a warm-blooded heart. You might seem ordinary at first glance, but there's far more to you than meets the eye.",
  "Polteageist": "Polteageist's tea is risky to drink but tastes delicious, so fearless gourmets drink it day after day, while only Trainers it trusts are allowed to sample a tiny bit. You're an acquired taste, and proud of it. Light-hearted and down-to-earth, with a thoughtful mind and a mischievous streak, your slightly spooky charm wins people over once they get to know you.",
  "Hatenna": "Hatenna can sense people's emotions through the bump on its head, and it avoids anyone with strong feelings because it finds them overwhelming. You're approachable and city-minded, with an edgy, intuitive side. You're incredibly sensitive to the moods of others, and you need your own space to recharge after busy days.",
  "Hattrem": "Hattrem uses the tresses on its head to strike anyone with strong emotions, and it seeks out calm, quiet places to live. You're seasoned and intuitive, with an edgy, warm-toned style. You value peace and quiet, and you're not afraid to push back against people who bring too much drama into your life.",
  "Hatterene": "Hatterene is known as the Forest Witch, and anyone who makes too much noise near its quiet home risks a lashing from the claws on its tentacle. You treasure your peace. Independent and steady, sweet-natured but understated, you're gentle with people who respect your calm, and firm with those who don't.",
  "Gigantamax Hatterene": "Gigantamax Hatterene shoots beams like lightning down from its tentacles, and it's known to some as the Raging Goddess. Your calm hides tremendous power. Independent and steady, sweet-natured most of the time, when you go big and dramatic, nobody who sees it ever forgets the sight.",
  "Impidimp": "Impidimp sneaks into people's homes, stealing small things and feeding on the negative energy of the frustrated people it leaves behind. You've got a cheeky, troublemaking streak. Bold and city-minded, with warm tastes, your mischief is mostly playful, and people can't help but laugh even while they're looking for their keys.",
  "Morgrem": "Morgrem drops to all fours as if begging for forgiveness, but it's really luring opponents in close so it can stab them with its spear-like hair. You're more cunning than your sweet face suggests. Bright, experienced and naturally sweet-natured, you know exactly how to disarm people, and they rarely see your next move coming.",
  "Grimmsnarl": "Grimmsnarl wraps its hair around its body like muscle, letting it overpower even Machamp, and it uses its hair to subdue opponents. You're level-headed and down-to-earth, city-minded with moody moments. You've got a tough, imposing exterior, and people learn to respect your strength and resilience.",
  "Gigantamax Grimmsnarl": "Gigantamax energy makes more hair sprout all over Grimmsnarl's body, and the extra muscle lets it leap clean over the world's tallest building. You surprise people with how high you can go. Light-hearted and level-headed, an everyday soul with a dramatic side, when you go big you clear obstacles everyone assumed were impossible.",
  "Obstagoon": "Obstagoon raises its arms in an X shape to block attacks and intimidate opponents, and its booming voice can stop people in their tracks. You're guarded and city-minded, down-to-earth with a mischievous streak. You've got a tough, rebellious attitude, and you're always ready to stand up for yourself.",
  "Perrserker": "What looks like an iron helmet on Perrserker's head is actually hair that's hardened over many battles, and dangerous claws extend from its paws when it gets serious. You've been toughened by experience. Hands-on and seasoned, with a love of tech and warm tastes, you keep your claws hidden until something is really worth fighting for.",
  "Cursola": "Cursola's soul is surrounded by an ectoplasmic body overflowing with otherworldly energy, and anyone who touches it will become stiff as stone. You're bold and seasoned, light-hearted with a cool style. You've been through a lot, and while you've got a playful side, people know to treat you with respect.",
  "Sirfetch’d": "Sirfetch'd wields a leek as a sword and uses its other leaf as a shield, and once its leek wilts, it retires from battle. You're seasoned and steady, with a cool style and a quick-burning fighting spirit. You give everything you've got to the things you care about, and you know when it's time to step back gracefully.",
  "Mr. Rime": "Mr. Rime is highly skilled at tap-dancing, waving its cane of ice in time with its graceful movements, and its amusing antics make it very popular. You're level-headed and intuitive, down-to-earth with moody moments. You've got a unique sense of humour, and you know how to put on a show that leaves everyone smiling.",
  "Runerigus": "Runerigus was once an ancient painting woven with a powerful curse, and it began to move after it absorbed the spirit of a Yamask. You carry the weight of history with dignity. Hands-on and steady, independent with a mischievous streak, you've turned something old and heavy into a presence that people genuinely respect.",
  "Milcery": "Milcery was born from sweet-smelling particles drifting in the air, and its body is made entirely of soft cream. You've got a gentle, comforting presence. Unhurried, light-hearted and grounded in what matters, you make people feel a little happier just by being around, and you never seem to be in any rush.",
  "Alcremie": "When Alcremie is content, the cream it makes from its hands becomes sweeter and richer, and it treats Trainers it trusts to berries decorated with cream. Your mood sweetens the whole room. Grounded, light-hearted and experienced, you love sharing the good things in life with the people who've earned your trust.",
  "Gigantamax Alcremie": "Gigantamax Alcremie launches swarms of cream missiles, each loaded with a hundred thousand kilocalories, and one hit is enough to make your head swim. You share sweetness on a huge scale. Warm-blooded and quick, when you go big and dramatic, you fill everyone around you with joy and energy.",
  "Falinks": "Falinks is a group of six Pokémon that act as one, and they form a line to attack, following the orders of their leader. You're independent and steady, edgy with a light-hearted side. You know how to work in a team, but you're also happy to take the lead when it's needed.",
  "Mega Falinks": "When Falinks Mega Evolves, its six members move in even tighter formation, their combined fighting spirit burning hot as they march as one. You're hands-on and fiery, with warm tastes. When you transform, you bring every part of your team together, and the result is an unstoppable, perfectly synchronised force.",
  "Pincurchin": "Pincurchin scrapes seaweed off rocks with its teeth, and electric current flows from the tips of its spines, zapping anything that touches it. You're light-hearted and adaptable, with moody moments and a love of tech. You've got a prickly exterior, but you're resourceful, and you always find ways to keep yourself going.",
  "Snom": "Snom eats the snow that piles up on the ground, and the more it eats, the bigger and more impressive its icy spikes grow. Independent and grounded, you're bright and adaptable too. You grow stronger by taking in the world around you, and you're constantly building yourself up.",
  "Frosmoth": "Frosmoth flies gracefully, scattering icy scales from its wings, and it's said to protect its territory from anyone who harms the environment. You're bold and grounded, steady with a soaring spirit. You're fiercely protective of the things you care about, and you'll fight to keep them safe.",
  "Stonjourner": "Once a year, on a specific date and at a specific time, Stonjourner gather out of nowhere to form a circle, and each one spends its life gazing at the setting sun. You're good-natured and down-to-earth, with a cool, outdoorsy style. You're grounded in tradition and nature, and you have a steady, timeless sense of rhythm that people find reassuring.",
  "Eiscue": "Eiscue keeps its heat-sensitive head cool inside a block of ice, and it fishes in the freezing sea by dangling its hair like a line. You're approachable and guarded, a city-minded spirit with classic values. You've found a creative way to protect yourself, and you're happy to keep your cool in any situation.",
  "Indeedee": "Indeedee are said to be like butlers, and they use their psychic power to sense people's feelings and take care of them. Guarded but grounded, you're deeply intuitive and affectionate. You have a natural instinct for caring for others, and people feel looked after when they're with you.",
  "Morpeko": "Morpeko's mood changes from Full Belly Mode to Hangry Mode when it's hungry, and it carries seeds in a pouch to keep its energy up. You're bright and seasoned, edgy with a mischievous streak. You've got a lot of energy, but you need to keep yourself fuelled, otherwise your mood can take a turn.",
  "Cufant": "Cufant can lift five tons with its trunk, and it's often seen helping people with heavy work in mines and on building sites. You're grounded and independent, level-headed with a love of tech. You're quietly strong and incredibly dependable, and people know they can lean on you when there's heavy lifting to be done.",
  "Copperajah": "Copperajah came to Galar from another region long ago to work alongside people, and its trunk grips so powerfully that it can crush giant rocks. You've got enduring, unshowy strength. Bold but unhurried, with a love of good engineering and an understated manner, your presence only grows more impressive as the years go by.",
  "Gigantamax Copperajah": "So much power is packed into Gigantamax Copperajah's trunk that if it ever unleashed it fully, the blast could level mountains and change the landscape. You hold a lot of power in reserve. Bold and unhurried, with a love of tech, when you go big and dramatic, you can genuinely reshape the world around you.",
  "Dracozolt": "Dracozolt's powerful lower body made it unbeatable in ancient times, yet it still went extinct after eating up all the plants it relied on. You're a mix of strengths that shouldn't work together, but do. Modest yet fiery, a tech-minded free spirit, you make your unusual combination of qualities work brilliantly in your own way.",
  "Arctozolt": "Arctozolt is a fossil Pokémon whose upper half is frozen solid, and it shivers so much that it can't keep still, creating electricity. Modest but fiery, you're down-to-earth and quietly fascinated by how things work. You might not be the most graceful, but you turn your quirks into a source of energy, and you make the best of whatever you've got.",
  "Dracovish": "Dracovish's powerful jaws and legs, able to run at over forty miles per hour, made it the top predator of its time, until it overhunted its prey into extinction. You never do anything by halves. Grounded and hands-on, guarded with an edgy streak, you pursue your goals with a fierce bite, though you're learning that pacing yourself matters too.",
  "Arctovish": "Arctovish can freeze its surroundings to catch prey, but its mouth is on top of its head, so it has real trouble actually eating what it's caught. You find workarounds for awkward situations. Calm and hands-on, you stay adaptable and grounded, turning challenges other people never have to face into something you handle with ease.",
  "Duraludon": "Duraludon's body looks like polished metal, light and incredibly strong, though its one weakness is that it rusts easily in the rain. You're strong with a softer spot you know to protect. Independent and genuine, an everyday soul who loves tech, you've built yourself into someone people rely on, while quietly looking after yourself too.",
  "Gigantamax Duraludon": "Gigantamax Duraludon has grown to resemble a skyscraper, parts of its towering body glowing with a profusion of energy, and its body structure even resists earthquakes. You're independent and bright, with a transformative, dramatic presence. When you go big, you stand tall above everything around you, and your energy shines out for everyone to see.",
  "Dreepy": "Dreepy was once an ancient Pokémon that lived in the sea, and it's said that its ghost now wanders the old places it used to swim. You're an everyday, city-minded soul, young at heart with classic values. You hold on to the past, and you love exploring old haunts and finding new meaning in familiar places.",
  "Drakloak": "Drakloak carries Dreepy on its head and flies at high speed, taking care of them as they grow. You're young at heart and independent, a free spirit with a mischievous streak. You love to look after the people around you, and you're always taking them on exciting adventures.",
  "Dragapult": "Dragapult keeps Dreepy tucked in the holes in its horns, and in battle it launches them like supersonic missiles, which the Dreepy seem to thoroughly enjoy. You make life feel like a thrill ride. Ambitious and quick, an everyday spirit with a mischievous streak, you bring exciting energy to everything, and the people around you love coming along.",
  "Zacian": "Zacian is known as a legendary hero, and it absorbs particles of metal from its surroundings, forging them into a gleaming sword. You're level-headed and sweet-natured, quick with moody moments. You've got a heroic spirit, and you're always ready to stand up and protect the people you care about.",
  "Zamazenta": "Zamazenta is known as a legendary hero, and it absorbs particles of metal to forge them into armour and a shield that can deflect almost any attack. You're fiery and natural, a legendary spirit with moody moments. You're a steady protector, and people feel safe knowing you're standing in front of them.",
  "Eternatus": "Eternatus came from a meteor that fell to Earth twenty thousand years ago, and it's said to be the source of the Dynamax phenomenon. You're quick and mischievous, a legendary spirit with a cool style. You've got an otherworldly power, and you have a huge impact on the world around you.",
  "Kubfu": "Kubfu trains hard every day to become strong, and the fighting style it masters decides which of two forms it will take when it evolves. You're fiery and light-hearted, a legendary spirit with moody moments. You're dedicated to your growth, and you know that the path you choose will shape who you become.",
  "Urshifu": "Urshifu races across sheer mountain cliffs to train its legs and refine its moves, and each one masters either single, devastating strikes or nonstop blows that flow like a river. You're light-hearted and understated, a legendary spirit with moody moments. You've honed your own unique approach to life, and you're incredibly skilled at what you do.",
  "Gigantamax Urshifu (Rapid Strike)": "As Gigantamax Urshifu of the Rapid Strike style waits for the right moment to unleash its power, it holds a perfect one-legged stance and won't even twitch. You're light-hearted and good-natured, fiery with a dramatic side. When you go big, you show people your skill and poise, and you strike at exactly the right moment.",
  "Gigantamax Urshifu (Single Strike)": "The energy released by the fists of Gigantamax Urshifu of the Single Strike style forms shock waves that can blow away Dynamax Pokémon in just one hit. You're light-hearted and mischievous, fiery with a dramatic side. When you go big, you put everything you've got into one decisive moment, and the impact is unforgettable.",
  "Zarude": "Zarude lives in packs deep in dense forests and is so aggressive that the other Pokémon fear it, yet the vines that tear off its body nourish the soil and help the forest grow. You're ambitious and mischievous, quick with legendary energy. You're fiercely protective of your territory, and people quickly learn that you're not someone to be messed with.",
  "Regieleki": "Regieleki is a living cluster of electrical energy, and it's said that removing the rings around its body would unleash its full, hidden power. You hold a lot of charge in check. Grounded with an edgy, fiery streak and legendary energy, you're learning to channel that power into something focused rather than letting it scatter.",
  "Regidrago": "One theory says that Regidrago's arms were once the head of an ancient dragon Pokémon, though it's never been proven. You carry a mysterious legacy. Bold but modest, level-headed yet free-spirited, you're determined to live up to the strength of whatever, or whoever, came before you, while still forging your own path.",
  "Glastrier": "Glastrier gives off intense cold from its hooves, and it's a belligerent Pokémon that simply takes whatever it wants by force. You know what you want and go for it. Hands-on and good-natured with your own people, a city-minded spirit with legendary strength, you're fiercely independent, and you don't wait for permission.",
  "Spectrier": "Spectrier explores its surroundings using every sense except sight, which it doesn't use at all, yet it still perceives everything around it. You understand things beyond what's visible. Level-headed and thoughtful, edgy with moody moments, you're perceptive in ways others can't explain, and people trust your judgement completely.",
  "Calyrex": "Calyrex is said to have ruled Galar long ago, healing wounds and helping plants grow, and it was known as the King of Bountiful Harvests. You're modest and intuitive, a legendary spirit with moody moments. You have a nurturing, healing influence, and you help the people around you grow and flourish.",
  "Wyrdeer": "The black orbs on Wyrdeer's antlers glow with an uncanny light when it raises invisible barriers, and the fur shed from its beard is prized for warm winter clothing. You're both mysterious and practical. Bold but unhurried, natural with a cool style, you quietly protect the people around you and keep them warm without fuss.",
  "Kleavor": "Kleavor fells towering trees with its crude stone axes and shields itself with hard stone, and anyone who chances upon it in the wild has no recourse but to flee. You make good use of what you have. Quick and down-to-earth, hands-on with a soaring spirit, you're resourceful and practical, and you always get the job done.",
  "Ursaluna": "Hisui's swampy terrain is thought to have given Ursaluna its burly body and its ability to manipulate peat at will. Where you grew up made you strong. Good-natured and down-to-earth, an outdoorsy soul with warm tastes, you have a deep connection to nature, and you shape your surroundings to look after the people you love.",
  "Basculegion": "Basculegion clads itself in the souls of comrades that perished before they could complete their journey upstream. You're calm and bold, practical with a cool style. You honour the people who came before you, and you're dedicated to protecting the people who rely on you.",
  "Sneasler": "Sneasler scales sheer cliffs with its hooked claws, and with its virulent poison and fearsome strength, nothing else can match it on the frozen highlands. You've got grit and determination. Fiery and bold, yet approachable and genuine, you're always ready to take on a challenge, and you keep climbing until you reach the top.",
  "Overqwil": "Overqwil's lance-like spikes and savage temper have earned it the nickname 'sea fiend', and it slurps up poison to nourish itself. You've got a tough, prickly exterior. Warm-blooded and edgy, hands-on with moody moments, you thrive on things that would bring others down, and you're always ready to defend the people you care about.",
  "Enamorus": "When Enamorus flies in from across the sea, the bitter winter comes to an end, and legend says its love makes fresh life bud across the land. You bring renewal with you. Modest and level-headed, down-to-earth with a legendary warmth, people feel the season change for the better when you walk into their lives.",
  "Enamorus (Therian Forme)": "In its Therian Forme, Enamorus descends from the clouds to deliver ruthless punishment to anyone who treats life with disrespect. You've got a big heart and firm principles. Bright and ambitious, sweet-natured but fiercely independent, you look after the people and things you love, and you won't tolerate anyone who mistreats them.",
  "Sprigatito": "Sprigatito's body gives off a sweet scent that mesmerises those around it, and the scent grows stronger whenever it's out in the sun. You're good-natured and natural, elusive with an edgy streak. You've got a sweet charm that people love, but you like to do things on your own terms.",
  "Floragato": "Floragato hides a vine beneath its long fur, and it whips it out deftly, slamming the hard flower bud on the end against its opponents. You've got hidden strength under a gentle surface. Hands-on and affectionate, level-headed in everyday life, you're always ready to protect the people you love when the moment comes.",
  "Meowscarada": "Meowscarada uses the reflective surface of its cape to camouflage itself, and it's said to be a skilled magician that can create flower bombs. You're bold and light-hearted, an everyday soul who loves the outdoors. You've got a flair for the dramatic, and you know how to make a magical entrance.",
  "Fuecoco": "Fuecoco lies on warm rocks, soaking up heat through its square scales, and because its flame sac is small, its fire energy is always leaking out and flickering from its head. You can't help but show how you feel. Young at heart and fiery, grounded with warm tastes, your relaxed, easygoing glow makes people comfortable around you.",
  "Crocalor": "Crocalor's fire energy and overflowing vitality combine to form an egg-shaped fireball that sits on top of its head. Your passion practically spills over. Bright and good-natured, with an edgy, slightly elusive streak, you carry your fiery spirit with you wherever you go, and people can see it at a glance.",
  "Skeledirge": "Skeledirge's gentle singing is said to soothe the souls of everyone who hears it, yet its flames can burn at over five thousand degrees. You're gentle and fierce at once. Warm and fiery, guarded with a mischievous side, your creativity comforts the people you love, and your passion is fierce when you need it to be.",
  "Quaxly": "Quaxly migrated to Paldea from distant lands long ago, and the gel secreted by its feathers repels water and grime. You're young at heart, cool and calm with classic values, and you like to keep things tidy. You take pride in your appearance, and you always look polished and put together, no matter what.",
  "Quaxwell": "Quaxwell trains endlessly, running about and kicking with its strong legs while moving with a dancer's grace and rhythm. You put the work in. Young at heart and independent, with a down-to-earth good nature, you're dedicated to your craft, and you've learned to blend elegance and strength in everything you do.",
  "Quaquaval": "Quaquaval's elegant dances are so captivating that they're said to mesmerise anyone who watches, and it uses its moves to attack. You're modest and natural, fiery but understated. You've got a beautiful, graceful style, and people are inspired by the passion and dedication you put into your art.",
  "Lechonk": "Lechonk searches for food all day with its keen sense of smell, and it's said that its nose can sniff out the best berries. You're approachable and city-minded, sweet-natured with moody moments. You've got a big appetite for life, and you're always on the lookout for the best things around you.",
  "Oinkologne": "Oinkologne is proud of its fine, glossy skin, and it gives off a concentrated, flowery scent from the tip of its tail that it uses to attract partners. You take quiet pride in yourself. Guarded at first but good-natured, down-to-earth and city-minded, you've got a pleasant, calming presence that puts people at ease.",
  "Tarountula": "Tarountula spins thread as strong as wire, and it wraps itself in a ball of that thread, which works as first-rate armour. You're always quietly building something. Independent and grounded, you're bright and steady in your work, and you've got a knack for making something truly protective out of simple materials.",
  "Spidops": "Spidops covers its whole territory in tough, sticky threads, setting careful traps and defending its home with patience rather than speed. You're a dependable guardian. Hands-on and steady, independent but good-natured, you put real effort into making the spaces around you safe for everyone who belongs there.",
  "Nymble": "Nymble keeps its third pair of legs folded up, and when it's in a tight spot, it uses them to spring over thirty feet into the air. You've got a hidden bounce. Light-hearted, quick and good-natured, you stay steady most of the time, yet you can always leap out of trouble when you need to.",
  "Lokix": "When Lokix decides to fight all out, it rises up on its folded legs to enter its Showdown Mode and finishes opponents off in short order. You've got another gear when it matters. Seasoned, quick and happiest outdoors, with a mischievous streak, you can switch into a fierce, focused version of yourself in an instant.",
  "Pawmi": "Pawmi's electric sacs aren't fully developed yet, so it can only make electricity by rubbing them furiously with the pads on its paws. You put in effort for your spark. Bold and independent, modest with a love of tech, you're still learning to channel your energy, and you're determined to grow stronger with every try.",
  "Pawmo": "When its group comes under attack, Pawmo is the first to leap into battle, defeating enemies with a fighting style built around electric shocks. You step up first. Bright and independent, modest with an edgy streak, you've learned to combine your natural energy with real skill, and you're always ready when your people need you.",
  "Pawmot": "Pawmot's fluffy fur works like a battery, storing as much electricity as an electric car, and though it's usually slow to react, it moves at lightning speed in battle. You've got deep reserves. Seasoned and good-natured, an everyday soul who loves tech, you seem relaxed until someone you care about needs you.",
  "Tandemaus": "Tandemaus are a pair that stick together no matter what, and whenever they find food, they split it exactly in half. You share everything with the people you love. Sweet-natured and grounded, young at heart and light-hearted, your bonds run deep, and fairness comes as naturally to you as breathing.",
  "Maushold": "Maushold is a family of mice that live together, and the larger ones protect the smaller ones, always sticking together. You're quick and sweet-natured, a grounded, natural soul. You're devoted to your family and friends, and you'll do anything to protect the people you love.",
  "Fidough": "Fidough's body is soft and squishy like bread dough, and its breath is full of yeast that's used to make bread rise. You're guarded but sweet-natured, elusive and level-headed. You've got a warm, comforting presence, and you help the people around you rise to their full potential.",
  "Dachsbun": "Dachsbun's body gives off a pleasant, freshly baked aroma that helps wheat grow, so farming villages have treasured it for generations. You make the places around you flourish. Grounded and a little guarded, with a sweet, everyday warmth, you're a loyal, steady presence, and people feel warm and safe whenever you're around.",
  "Smoliv": "Smoliv's head produces a bitter oil that it squirts at opponents, and it can easily go a whole week without eating or drinking. You're modest and outdoorsy, edgy with a warm-blooded heart. You've got a sunny disposition, but you're not afraid to show your bitter side when someone crosses you.",
  "Dolliv": "Dolliv shares its tasty, fresh-scented oil with others, and its kind has lived alongside people since ancient times. You've been someone's good neighbour forever. Seasoned and sweet-natured, an everyday soul who loves the outdoors, you're generous by habit, and you're always ready to share your gifts with whoever's around.",
  "Arboliva": "Arboliva is calm and deeply compassionate, and it shares its delicious, nutrient-rich oil with Pokémon that have been weakened or hurt. You quietly look after people. Independent and natural, level-headed in a crisis, you've got a steady, everyday wisdom, and you give your best to the people who need it most.",
  "Squawkabilly": "Squawkabilly prefer living in cities, where they form noisy flocks organised by colour and squabble with rival flocks over territory. You've got a big, bold personality. Bright and sweet-natured, a soaring spirit with a cool style, you're not afraid to make some noise when you're with your favourite people.",
  "Nacli": "Nacli was born in a layer of rock salt deep underground, and in the old days it was treasured because it shared its precious salt with people. You make everything better. Good-natured and grounded, unhurried with a warm-blooded heart, you're endlessly useful to the people around you, and you add flavour to everything you do.",
  "Naclstack": "Naclstack compresses rock salt inside its body and fires hardened salt pellets with enough force to punch through a sheet of iron. You've built strong defences. Grounded and thoughtful, with warm tastes and a guarded side, you're steady and dependable, and anyone who threatens the things you care about meets real resistance.",
  "Garganacl": "Garganacl rubs its fingertips together to sprinkle salt on injured Pokémon, and even severe wounds are said to heal quickly afterwards. You're a gentle giant. Grounded and level-headed, wonderfully everyday in your kindness, you're always ready to help the people around you recover, and you never make a fuss about it.",
  "Charcadet": "Charcadet came to life when a piece of burnt charcoal became a Pokémon, and its fiery fighting spirit makes it take on even the toughest opponents. You're young at heart and full of fire. Warm and light-hearted, you're still discovering who you are, but you never back down from a challenge because it looks too big.",
  "Armarouge": "Armarouge evolved by putting on a set of armour that once belonged to a distinguished warrior, and it's known for its incredible loyalty. You honour the people who came before you. Fiery and deeply intuitive, natural with moody moments, you've got a strong sense of loyalty, and you'll stand by your people no matter what.",
  "Ceruledge": "Ceruledge wears armour that once belonged to a fallen swordsman, and its blades burn with ghostly flames fuelled by a grudge. You're fiery and guarded, with an independent, mischievous streak. You've been shaped by your past, and you channel your old wounds into a fierce determination to keep going.",
  "Tadbulb": "Tadbulb shakes its tail to generate electricity, and when it senses danger, it makes its head blink on and off to warn its friends. You're the friend who flags trouble early. Light-hearted and bright, you stay practical and grounded, and you bring a little light to the people around you whenever things start to feel uncertain.",
  "Bellibolt": "When Bellibolt wobbles its round body back and forth, the belly-button dynamo in its stomach churns out a huge amount of electricity. You've got a relaxed, easygoing power. Independent and tech-minded, an everyday soul with classic values, you look laid-back, but there's plenty of energy humming away inside whenever you need it.",
  "Wattrel": "When the wind catches Wattrel's wings, the bones inside them generate electricity, and it dives into the sea to catch prey with a shock. You draw energy from the elements. Quick and light-hearted, a soaring spirit with moody moments, you're happiest flying free, and you're not afraid to brave the storms of life.",
  "Kilowattrel": "Kilowattrel stores electricity in its throat pouch and uses it to fly great distances, covering over four hundred miles a day. You're a soaring spirit with warm tastes, edgy with a love of tech. You've got enormous stamina, and you're always ready to go the distance for the things that matter to you.",
  "Maschiff": "Maschiff always scowls, trying hard to make opponents take it seriously, but its face is so funny that even crying children burst out laughing. You're tougher in your own mind than your face lets on. Grounded, independent and wonderfully down-to-earth, you're fiercely loyal, and people adore you for it.",
  "Mabosstiff": "Mabosstiff is a gentle giant that's kind to its family, but it uses its intimidating face to scare off intruders. You're grounded and bold, natural with a mischievous streak. You're a big softie with the people you love, but you know how to put on a tough face when you need to.",
  "Shroodle": "Shroodle is usually mellow, but if anything angers it, it sinks its sharp, poison-soaked front teeth in, leaving the culprit paralysed. You're sweeter than you are sharp, mostly. Sweet-natured and compact, with classic tastes and a mischievous streak, you're easygoing company, but people learn that pushing your buttons is a mistake.",
  "Grafaiai": "Grafaiai paints with its poisonous saliva, and each Grafaiai paints its own individual pattern over and over throughout its life. You're independent and thoughtful, moody with a mischievous streak. You express yourself through your own unique style, and your creativity is a window into who you really are.",
  "Bramblin": "Bramblin is a soul that couldn't move on, which got tangled up in dried grass as the wind blew it about, and not even Bramblin knows where it's heading. You go where the breeze takes you. Modest and light-hearted, moody with a mischievous side, you roll through life without a fixed plan and enjoy the ride.",
  "Brambleghast": "Brambleghast drifts through dry regions, and on rare occasions, so many of them tumble in at once that they bury an entire town. You arrive with real presence. Bold and classic, with warm tastes and a mischievous streak, once you've decided to settle somewhere, you make the place unmistakably your own.",
  "Toedscool": "Toedscool looks a lot like Tentacool, but it's a completely different species that lives in muggy forests, and its thin legs can run at thirty miles per hour. You're not what people expect. Guarded and a little elusive, level-headed with an edgy streak, you have your own unique way of getting through life, and fast.",
  "Toedscruel": "Toedscruel lives in groups in forests, and it uses its ten tentacles to latch on to prey and drain their nutrients, never letting go. You're thoughtful and ambitious, adaptable with classic values. You're happiest when you're part of a group, and once you've set your sights on something, you hold on tight.",
  "Klawf": "Klawf hangs upside down from cliffs, waiting patiently for prey to pass below, then drops down and attacks with its huge claws. You know how to wait for your moment. Quick, grounded and thoroughly hands-on, when the right opportunity comes along you seize it with both claws and don't let it slip away.",
  "Capsakid": "The more sunlight Capsakid soaks up, the more spicy chemicals its body makes, and its shed teeth are a secret ingredient in fiery Paldean dishes. You bring the heat. Bold and outdoorsy, moody with a light-hearted streak, you've got a fiery personality that some people love straight away, and others need time to get used to.",
  "Scovillain": "Scovillain's red head turns spicy chemicals into fire, while its green head has grown vicious from those same chemicals stimulating its brain. You hold two very different sides together. Modest and unhurried most of the time, independent and practical, you've found a way to make your contrasting moods work as a team.",
  "Mega Scovillain": "Scovillain's green head has turned vicious from spicy chemicals stimulating its brain, and once it goes on a rampage, there's no stopping it. You're independent and everyday, with a moody streak. When you transform, your two sides finally work in perfect harmony, and your passion becomes an unstoppable force.",
  "Rellor": "Rellor mixes sand and dirt with psychic energy to make a mud ball, and it treasures that mud ball more than its own life. You hold on to what matters to you. Good-natured and unhurried, light-hearted but a little guarded, you keep your most precious things close, and you quietly take care of them every single day.",
  "Rabsca": "An infant sleeps inside the ball that Rabsca carries, and Rabsca rolls it soothingly with its legs so the little one can sleep comfortably. You're a devoted protector. Thoughtful and deeply intuitive, compact and experienced, you put everything you've got into caring for the people who rely on you, even when nobody sees it.",
  "Flittle": "Flittle's toes levitate about half an inch off the ground thanks to the psychic power from the frills on its belly, and if anyone steals its beloved berries, it chases them down for revenge. You seem delicate, but you're not. Bold and natural, a little elusive with deep intuition, you skim lightly through life and you never let anyone get away with taking what's yours.",
  "Espathra": "Espathra freezes opponents in place by bathing them in psychic power from its large eyes, and it can sprint at over a hundred miles per hour. You see straight through people. Down-to-earth and intuitive, you stay level-headed and bright, and once you know exactly what needs doing, you move faster than anyone expects.",
  "Tinkatink": "Tinkatink pounds scraps of iron together to make its own hammer, and it remakes it again and again until it's finally satisfied with the result. You're a perfectionist with a brave heart. Bright and sweet-natured, guarded with a love of tech, you keep refining your tools, and you'll stand up for yourself however big the challenge.",
  "Tinkatuff": "Tinkatuff ambushes groups of Pawniard and Bisharp, collecting the metal they leave behind to build a bigger, sturdier hammer. You're resourceful and determined. Independent and bright, modest yet sweet-natured, you gather what you need piece by piece, and you're quietly building towards something much bigger than people realise.",
  "Tinkaton": "Tinkaton swings a hammer weighing over two hundred pounds with ease, and it's daring enough to bat rocks into the sky to knock down passing Corviknight. You've built real strength over time. Bright and practical, grounded in everyday life, you've got the confidence and power to take on anything, however high it flies.",
  "Wiglett": "Wiglett can pick up the scent of a Veluza from just over sixty-five feet away, and it hides itself in the sand as soon as it does. You're young at heart, calm and bright. You might keep a low profile, but you're always paying attention, and you pick up on things long before anyone else notices.",
  "Wugtrio": "Despite how it looks, Wugtrio has a vicious temperament, wrapping its three long bodies around prey and dragging it down into its den. You're steadier and stronger than people assume. Level-headed and warm, you stay cool and calm under pressure, and when you commit to something, you hold on with all three hands.",
  "Bombirdier": "Bombirdier bundles up food in the apron on its chest to carry home to its nest, and it loves dropping things from the sky that make a loud noise. You enjoy a little harmless chaos. A free spirit with a cool style and a guarded side, you've got a playful, troublemaking streak, and people never quite know what's coming.",
  "Finizen": "Finizen loves playing with others using the ring of water on its tail, and it uses ultrasonic waves to sense how other creatures are feeling. You're tuned in to the people around you. Light-hearted and good-natured, with a cool style and quick-burning enthusiasm, you're always up for fun, and you notice when friends need cheering up.",
  "Palafin": "Palafin looks just like Finizen until it hears its friend in trouble, and then it transforms into a muscular hero, ready to save the day. You're good-natured and compact, seasoned with a cool style. You might seem ordinary most of the time, but when someone needs help, you become a true hero.",
  "Varoom": "Varoom is said to have been born when an unknown poison Pokémon inspirited an engine left at a scrap-processing factory. You're city-minded and elusive, a mischievous spirit with a love of tech. You've got a noisy, energetic presence, and you love making your mark on the world.",
  "Revavroom": "Revavroom makes a gas from poison and minerals in rocks, then detonates it in the eight cylinders on its body to produce enormous energy. You run on a powerful engine. Grounded and bold, level-headed with a love of tech, you've got a competitive spirit, and when you rev up, everyone within earshot knows about it.",
  "Cyclizar": "Cyclizar is said to have carried people on its back since ancient times, racing across the plains at the speed of a motorbike. You've never minded giving people a lift. Light-hearted, good-natured and free-spirited, you love helping the people around you get where they're going, and you enjoy every moment of the ride.",
  "Orthworm": "Orthworm lives in arid deserts and maintains its metal body by eating iron from the soil, and when attacked, it pelts the opponent with its tendrils like a storm of fists. You adapt well to harsh conditions. Warm-blooded with warm tastes and a love of tech, you get through life one steady step at a time, and you're surprisingly easygoing about it.",
  "Glimmet": "Glimmet's toxic mineral crystals look just like flower petals, and it scatters a poisonous powder around itself as though it were pollen. You look delicate, but you've got defences. Independent and light-hearted, steady with a mischievous streak, you're a little gem that people quickly learn not to touch without asking first.",
  "Glimmora": "Glimmora's petals are made of crystallised poison energy, and when it senses danger, it opens them wide and fires beams from its glittering body. You're beautiful in a way that commands respect. Thoughtful and bold, completely genuine and happiest outdoors, your presence lights up even the darkest places you find yourself in.",
  "Mega Glimmora": "When Glimmora Mega Evolves, its crystal petals grow larger and blaze with light, turning it into a dazzling chandelier of glittering crystal. You're thoughtful and bold, with an outdoorsy, transformative spirit. When you change, you turn even the darkest cave into a cathedral of light.",
  "Greavard": "Greavard is a friendly ghost dog that hates being alone, and if you pay it even the slightest bit of attention, it'll follow you around forever. You're loyal from the very first hello. City-minded and a little elusive, with a natural, mischievous charm, people can't help falling for your playful, devoted spirit.",
  "Houndstone": "Houndstone spends most of its time dozing in graveyards, and of all the dog Pokémon, it's said to be the most loyal to the people it loves. You're a gentle guardian of memories. Light-hearted and bright, mischievous with a cool style, you keep the people you've loved close to your heart long after they've gone.",
  "Flamigo": "Thanks to a behaviour known as synchronising, an entire flock of Flamigo can attack at once in perfect harmony. You're warm-toned and seasoned, natural with an edgy streak. You've got real elegance and balance, and you know how to work in perfect harmony with the people around you.",
  "Cetoddle": "Cetoddle's ancestors left the ocean and moved onto land long ago, and it seems to be closely related to Wailmer, though it lives in the snowy mountains now. You're happy wherever you end up. Young at heart and good-natured, you stay cool and calm, and you treat every new place as an adventure.",
  "Cetitan": "Cetitan wanders snowy, icy lands, protected by powerful muscles and a thick layer of fat, while ice energy builds up in the horn on its jaw until it reaches cryogenic temperatures. Big as you are, you're remarkably gentle. Modest and level-headed, a city-minded soul who stays down-to-earth, you break through tough challenges with quiet, steady strength.",
  "Veluza": "Veluza sheds excess flesh to lighten its body and sharpen its mind, and it's said to become calmer and more focused afterwards. You're calm and bold, intuitive with a cool style. You know when to let go of the things that weigh you down, and you're sharper for it.",
  "Dondozo": "Dondozo is a huge glutton, but it's terrible at catching food on its own, so it teams up with a Tatsugiri who rides in its mouth and directs it. You're the big, laid-back friend. Calm, hands-on and light-hearted, you adapt easily, and you happily go along with your clever partner's plans, and together you're unbeatable.",
  "Tatsugiri": "Tatsugiri is extremely cunning, pretending to be weak to lure prey close and then ordering the Dondozo it lives inside to attack. You're the brains of the operation. Quick-witted and a little edgy, seasoned and completely genuine, you might look like the cute one, but you're always the one quietly running the show.",
  "Mega Tatsugiri (Curly)": "Tatsugiri lives inside Dondozo's mouth to protect itself from enemies on the outside, but it's the one giving the orders. There's more to you than meets the eye. Quick-witted and a little edgy, seasoned by experience, you transform into someone who's no longer just the clever voice but the main event.",
  "Mega Tatsugiri (Droopy)": "Droopy Form Tatsugiri tricks its opponents by playing dead, using its smarts to survive even though it's small and weak. You make hard work look lazy. Tireless and quick, with an edgy, seasoned wit, you might look like you're lounging over the sofa, but you're always quietly in charge of what happens next.",
  "Mega Tatsugiri (Stretchy)": "Stretchy Form Tatsugiri is one of the most intelligent dragon Pokémon, camouflaging itself by inflating its throat sac and hunting bird Pokémon alongside a partner. You carry yourself with real pride. Tireless and quick, with an edgy, seasoned confidence, you sit up straight, face the world head-on and make sure everyone knows exactly who's in charge.",
  "Annihilape": "When Annihilape's anger rose beyond a critical point, it gained power unfettered by the limits of its physical body, and it imbues its fists with the rage it kept hidden in its heart. You're fiery and affectionate, guarded with a mischievous streak. You feel things intensely, and your passion is a force that nothing can contain.",
  "Clodsire": "Clodsire lives at the bottom of ponds and swamps and ferries Wooper across the water on its back, but when attacked, it retaliates by sticking thick spines out from its body. You're level-headed and warm, guarded with a mischievous streak. You're a calm, easygoing presence, but you know how to protect yourself when you need to.",
  "Farigiraf": "Farigiraf's tail has evolved into a separate head with its own brain, and the two heads work together to protect each other. You're bold and unhurried, natural with warm tastes. You know how to watch your own back, and you've learned to work in perfect harmony with every part of yourself.",
  "Dudunsparce": "Dudunsparce bores deep into bedrock with its hard tail to build its nest, and the tunnels it digs can stretch for over six miles underground. You've built your own world from the ground up. Independent and adaptable, down-to-earth with a sweet nature, you're quietly hard-working, and the things you make are far bigger than people realise.",
  "Kingambit": "Kingambit leads a group of Bisharp and Pawniard, and only the strongest Bisharp can evolve into Kingambit, earning the right to lead. You're light-hearted and understated, an everyday soul with moody moments. You've earned your place through hard work, and you lead with quiet authority.",
  "Great Tusk": "Great Tusk looks like an ancient Donphan, and its name comes from a creature described in an old, rather questionable book about the mysteries of the past. You're a living link to old stories. Hands-on and happiest outdoors, practical in everyday life, you're grounded in tradition and strong enough to carve your own path through anything.",
  "Scream Tail": "Scream Tail looks like an ancient Jigglypuff, and there has only ever been a single reported sighting of it, matching a creature in an old expedition journal. You're one of a kind. Bright and light-hearted, practical in an everyday way, you've got a big voice and a big heart, and people never forget meeting you.",
  "Brute Bonnet": "Brute Bonnet resembles an ancient, far fiercer Amoonguss, and it matches a creature described in an old book of mysterious sightings. You're a tough customer from a wilder age. Guarded and outdoorsy, mischievous with a cool style, you know exactly how to defend yourself, and people learn to give you a little room.",
  "Flutter Mane": "Flutter Mane has features similar to a ghostly pterosaur covered in a paranormal magazine, and it shares its name with a creature mentioned in a certain book. You drift through life gracefully. An everyday soul, down-to-earth, practical and level-headed, your quiet, slightly mysterious charm draws people in without you ever trying.",
  "Slither Wing": "Slither Wing somewhat resembles an ancient form of Volcarona introduced in a dubious magazine, and an old book describes a similar creature by the same name. You don't need to fly to make an impact. An everyday soul with a natural, fiery spirit and a moody side, you move through life at ground level, warming everything you pass.",
  "Sandy Shocks": "Sandy Shocks slightly resembles a Magneton that a paranormal magazine claimed had lived for ten thousand years, and no records exist of one ever being caught. You're held together by your own pull. Moody and fiery, an everyday spirit with a love of tech, you draw the right things towards you, and your energy is impossible to ignore once it gets going.",
  "Iron Treads": "Iron Treads closely resembles a scientific weapon that a paranormal magazine claimed was sent to this planet by aliens. You roll towards the future with steady purpose. Thoughtful and practical, an everyday spirit with a love of tech, you keep moving forward, building momentum one careful step at a time.",
  "Iron Bundle": "Iron Bundle's shape is similar to a robot from a paranormal magazine said to have been built by an ancient civilisation, and there are only two reported sightings of it. You're the courier of tomorrow. Independent and bright, ambitious but thoughtful, you're always on the go, delivering ideas, help and enthusiasm wherever they're needed, usually faster than anyone expected.",
  "Iron Hands": "Iron Hands is very similar to a cyborg covered exclusively by a paranormal magazine, which claimed it was the modified form of a certain athlete. You've got heavyweight strength and a big heart. Grounded and down-to-earth, with an everyday warmth and a fiery spark, you throw your full weight behind the things you care about.",
  "Iron Jugulis": "Iron Jugulis resembles a Pokémon that a paranormal magazine described as the offspring of a Hydreigon that fell in love with a robot. You're always a step ahead. Grounded and level-headed, with an edgy, mischievous streak, you take in every angle at once, and you've got a precise answer ready for each of them.",
  "Iron Moth": "Iron Moth resembles an unknown object that a paranormal magazine described as a UFO sent to observe humanity. You bring warmth to cold places. Practical and down-to-earth, an everyday soul with a fiery heart, you quietly power through what needs doing and keep everyone around you warm.",
  "Iron Thorns": "Iron Thorns has some similarities to a Pokémon a dubious magazine introduced as a Tyranitar from one billion years in the future. You're an armoured force of nature. Fiery and bold, a little elusive with a love of tech, you look intimidating from the outside, but underneath you're simply determined to protect what's yours.",
  "Frigibax": "Frigibax absorbs heat through its dorsal fin and turns it into ice energy, so the hotter its surroundings, the more power it stores. You grow stronger from pressure. Independent and free-spirited, you stay cool and calm when things heat up, quietly converting every difficult moment into energy for later.",
  "Arctibax": "Arctibax freezes the air around it to protect its face with a mask of ice, and it turns its dorsal fin into a sharp blade of ice. You protect your heart with a frozen shield. Level-headed with a moody side, a city-minded free spirit, you keep people at a cool distance until you're sure they're worth letting in.",
  "Baxcalibur": "Baxcalibur blasts cryogenic air from its mouth, cold enough to freeze molten lava instantly, and it fights with the giant icy blade of its dorsal fin. You're a giant with a calm presence. Grounded, modest and a free spirit, a little elusive, you rarely show your full power, but when you do, nothing stands in your way.",
  "Mega Baxcalibur": "Baxcalibur launches itself into battle by flipping upside down and spewing frigid air from its mouth, then finishes opponents off with its dorsal blade. Your ambition sharpens when you change. Grounded and free-spirited, an everyday soul at heart, you transform into an icy legend in the making, with a quiet, unbreakable resolve.",
  "Gimmighoul": "Gimmighoul was born inside a treasure chest around fifteen hundred years ago, and it drains the life force of scoundrels who try to steal the treasure. You guard what's precious. Grounded and natural, with a moody, edgy streak, you're a little bit protective of your little hoard, and people learn not to help themselves to it.",
  "Gholdengo": "Gholdengo's body is made up of a thousand coins, and it gets along well with others, making friends with just about anyone. You're rich in friendships. Light-hearted and ambitious, an everyday soul with a practical streak, you've got a golden charm that draws people in, and you share your good fortune generously.",
  "Wo-Chien": "Wo-Chien is said to be the grudge of someone punished for writing a king's wicked deeds on wooden tablets, cloaked in dead leaves. You remember the truth. Grounded and adaptable, with a mischievous, legendary streak, you hold on to what's right, and you have a quiet way of making sure it isn't forgotten.",
  "Chien-Pao": "Chien-Pao is said to be the hatred of those who fell by the sword long ago, cloaked in snow, and it can control a hundred tons of fallen snow. You're cool and sleek with a sharp edge. Natural, cool and calm, with a mischievous streak, you keep your intensity frozen beneath a composed surface.",
  "Ting-Lu": "Ting-Lu is the fear poured into an ancient ritual vessel, clad in rocks and dirt, and it slowly brings its heavy head down to split the earth with fissures over a hundred and sixty feet deep. You quietly reshape your surroundings. Hands-on and city-minded, with a mischievous, legendary streak, you might move slowly, but nothing about the places you've been stays the same.",
  "Chi-Yu": "Chi-Yu is said to be the envy that built up in a set of curved beads that sparked many conflicts, and it controls flames hotter than five thousand degrees. You're small with a huge impact. Bright and independent, down-to-earth with a legendary fire, people constantly underestimate how much heat you can bring.",
  "Roaring Moon": "Roaring Moon may well be the creature listed under that name in an expedition journal that still holds many mysteries. You've got a powerful old soul. Hands-on and city-minded, an everyday spirit with a level head, you carry an untamed strength that people sense the moment you walk into a room.",
  "Iron Valiant": "Iron Valiant has some similarities to a mad scientist's invention covered in a paranormal magazine, and it may be the object listed under that name in a certain expedition journal. You're a hero of tomorrow. Bold and fiercely independent, an everyday, city-minded soul, you combine grace and strength, and you charge in to protect anyone who needs it.",
  "Koraidon": "Koraidon seems to be the Winged King from an old expedition journal, a creature said to have split the land apart with its bare fists. You're ready for any adventure. Ambitious and good-natured, city-minded with an edgy streak, you're a loyal companion who'll carry your friends anywhere, as fast as they want to go.",
  "Miraidon": "Miraidon seems to be the Iron Serpent described in an old book, said to have turned the land to ash with its lightning. You're a legend of tomorrow. Fiery and tech-minded, with a moody, legendary depth, you hum with electric energy, and you're always racing ahead towards whatever's coming next.",
  "Walking Wake": "Walking Wake resembles an ancient, dragon-like Suicune, striding forward with a flowing mane that looks like rippling water. You stride through life like you own the rain. A genuine free spirit, natural and a little elusive, you've got a calm, steady grace that makes people trust you to lead them through a storm.",
  "Iron Leaves": "Iron Leaves looks like a robotic Virizion, its leafy horns replaced by gleaming blades of energy that it wields like a knight's sword. You're a protector of the green spaces of tomorrow. Hands-on and outdoorsy, bright with deep intuition, you defend the things that matter with sharp, graceful precision.",
  "Dipplin": "Dipplin is really two creatures living as one, a tiny dragon inside a syrup-coated candy apple, and its evolution was triggered by a special apple grown in only one place. You're a sweet soul with a strong will. Thoughtful, steady and young at heart, you and the people close to you work as a team.",
  "Poltchageist": "Poltchageist is said to be born from the regrets of a tea ceremony master who died before perfecting their craft, lingering in a bowl of matcha. You care deeply about doing things properly. Independent and grounded, moody with a mischievous streak, you're a little trickster with high standards hidden in your cup.",
  "Sinistcha": "Sinistcha makes its home in a fine tea bowl, and it pretends to be a delicious cup of matcha, draining the energy of anyone who sips it. You're an elegant host with a secret. Compact and practical, seasoned by experience, you've got a refined charm with a mischievous twist that keeps people guessing.",
  "Okidogi": "Okidogi gained tremendous power after eating toxic mochi, and its chain-like collar can be swung like a weapon when it fights. You've got surprising strength under a gruff exterior. Light-hearted but practical, understated with moody moments, you're a tough character who's happy to throw your weight behind the people you care about.",
  "Munkidori": "Munkidori used its psychic power to steal and gained even more strength from eating toxic mochi, and it's known as one of the Loyal Three. You're a trickster with a lot of charm. Light-hearted and ambitious, with a legendary mischievous streak, you can talk people into almost anything, and you usually get away with it.",
  "Fezandipiti": "Fezandipiti's beautiful feathers and graceful dance captivate anyone who sees it, and it's said to use its looks to charm and distract. You know how to work a room. Practical and classic, with a cool style and a mischievous streak, people find your charisma hard to resist, even when they suspect what you're up to.",
  "Ogerpon": "Ogerpon wears masks that change its type and power, and it's said to be shy, keeping its distance from people after being misunderstood long ago. You're a shy hero with a fierce heart. Level-headed and guarded, with an edgy, legendary streak, you protect the people you love, even if they don't always see the real you.",
  "Archaludon": "Archaludon's body is shaped like a bridge, and it gathers static electricity from its surroundings to fire tremendously powerful beams. You're a natural connector. A free spirit who's genuine and a little elusive, with a love of tech, you bring people and ideas together, and you're happiest when you're building bridges between them.",
  "Hydrapple": "Hydrapple is made up of seven small dragons living together inside a great apple-shaped body, coated in sticky, sweet syrup. You're a whole community in one person. Thoughtful and natural, with a big presence and a free spirit, you hold lots of different parts of yourself together, and people love how much warmth you contain.",
  "Gouging Fire": "Gouging Fire resembles an ancient Entei, with a blazing mane and fierce tusks that make it look like a beast from a primeval age. You're a powerful force from another time. Hands-on and city-minded, an everyday soul with a fiery heart, you charge into life with an old, wild strength that's impossible to tame.",
  "Raging Bolt": "Raging Bolt resembles an ancient Raikou, with a long neck and a thundercloud-like mane that crackles with stored electricity. You're a gentle giant with a spark. Bright, genuine and thoughtful in an everyday way, you carry a lot of power calmly, letting it out only when something truly deserves the storm.",
  "Iron Boulder": "Iron Boulder looks like a robotic Terrakion, its horn reshaped into a sharp, gleaming blade that it charges with at incredible speed. You're a powerful force of tomorrow. Hands-on and outdoorsy, intuitive with moody moments, you charge straight at obstacles, trusting your instincts to find the right line through them.",
  "Iron Crown": "Iron Crown looks like a robotic Cobalion, its head topped with a crown of sharp, gleaming metal blades that it uses to cut down opponents. You're a leader of tomorrow. Thoughtful and tech-minded, everyday in manner with deep intuition, you lead with calm intelligence, and people follow you because they trust your judgement.",
  "Terapagos": "Terapagos protects itself by turning energy into hard crystals, and it's believed to be the source of the Terastal phenomenon. You're a gentle guardian with hidden power. Grounded and a little guarded, sweet-natured with a legendary depth, you shield yourself carefully, but the energy you carry can transform everyone around you.",
  "Pecharunt": "Pecharunt feeds others toxic mochi that draw out their desires and abilities, and anyone who eats it falls under Pecharunt's control. You're a cheeky little legend. Cool in style, guarded and mischievous, you know exactly how to tempt people, and you have a surprising amount of influence over the people around you."
};
